\par }{\fs20\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof {\shp{\*\shpinst\shpleft1440\shptop2070\shpright10512\shpbottom2070\shpfhdr1\shpbxpage\shpbxignore\shpbypage\shpbyignore\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt0\shpz2\shplockanchor\shplid2049{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn shapePath}{\sv 4}}{\sp{\sn fFillOK}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFilled}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fArrowheadsOK}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelh}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelv}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}{\shprslt{\*\do\dobxpage\dobypage\dodhgt8194\dpline\dpptx0\dppty0\dpptx9920\dppty0\dpx1190\dpy2070\dpxsize9920\dpysize0\dplinew15\dplinecor0\dplinecog0\dplinecob0}}}}{\f0\fs16  \par }}{\footerf \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }{\footer \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}} of {\field{\*\fldinst NUMPAGES}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\fs20 {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/14: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE, LTC, MATIC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,774 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are likely to witness a minor correction or consolidation before the resumption of the recent rally.\par \par \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 victory in the case against the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  gives a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-wins-case-against-sec-as-judge-rules-xrp-is-not-a-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 significant boost to the crypto industry}}}\uc2 . In addition to benefitting Ripple and XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), analysts believe that the ruling will weaken the regulator\u8217\'20\'19s case against Binance and \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In another positive event for the crypto space, the U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern on July 12 and followed that up with a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-btc-price-40k-dollar-dxy-last-time"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drop below the psychological level of 100}}}\uc2  on July 13. The DXY typically moves in inverse correlation with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ); hence its weakness is a positive sign for the crypto bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/d1d7e47b-695d-496a-a9d4-7264d160e48c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 LookIntoBitcoin creator Philip Swift said that increased on-chain spending volume shows that Bitcoin is in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-spending-metric-btc-price-bull-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first stage of a bull market}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The sharp rally in XRP and several other altcoins following Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s victory is a sign that the crypto bulls are making a comeback.\par \par \uc2 What are the important resistance levels that need to be crossed for Bitcoin and the altcoins to start the next leg of the up move? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke and closed above the $31,000 resistance on July 13, but the bulls are struggling to build upon this strength. This suggests that the bears have not yet given up and they continue to sell at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/713e5158-e34c-4636-a7d2-738aa94bdcf1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the upsloping moving averages indicate an advantage to buyers, the relative strength index (RSI) is forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, signaling that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price back below the breakout level of $31,000. If they do that, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $30,244. This remains the key level to keep an eye on. A bounce off it will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips. A rally above $32,400 could clear the path for a potential rise to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break and close below the 20-day EMA could yank the price to $29,500. The bears will have to break this support to gain the upper hand in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sink Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) in the past few days may have attracted strong buying by the bulls. That pushed the price to the overhead resistance of $2,000 on July 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/12596fe6-5e33-4c65-a548-59032db78675.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls and the bears may witness a tough battle near $2,000, but the rising 20-day EMA ($1,895) and the RSI in the positive zone indicate that bulls have a slight edge. If buyers clear the hurdle at $2,000, the ETH/USDT pair may retest the overhead resistance zone between $2,142 and $2,200.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down and drops to the 20-day EMA. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to overcome the overhead obstacle.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to tug the price below the 50-day SMA ($1,850) to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 20-day EMA ($245) on July 13 and broke above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/c457d6f3-91a4-45a2-ba67-9536ec9e9fdc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued the up move on July 14 and pushed the price above the 50-day SMA ($257), but the bears are posing a formidable challenge near the overhead resistance at $265. If the price turns down and reenters the triangle, it will suggest that the recent breakout may have been a bull trap. The pair may then plummet to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the resistance line, it will suggest that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That will enhance the prospects of a rally above $265. The pair may then start its northward march to $280 and later to $300.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) skyrocketed above the overhead resistance of $0.56 on July 13. This meant the $0.30 to $0.56 range resolved in favor of the bulls. The pattern target of this breakout is $0.82, but the price overshot this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/9b9f87ff-4bc6-481e-8130-3cef9d711ff0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair is facing profit booking near $0.94. Generally, a sharp rally is followed by a violent correction and a few days of consolidation. The bulls will try to arrest any pullback in the zone between the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.75 and the 50% retracement level of $0.70.\par \par \uc2 If the price stays above this level, the pair may retest the overhead resistance at $0.94. Contrarily, a break below $0.70 could sink the pair to the 61.8% retracement level of $0.64. Such a deep fall may delay the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) witnessed aggressive buying by the bulls on July 13, which drove the price above the immediate resistance of $0.30 and the 50-day SMA ($0.31).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/3c545316-2105-4229-a83a-47d45fb0efdf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 That may have hit the stops on several \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trades, triggering short covering. The price soared toward the target objective of $0.38 on July 14, but the long wick on the candlestick shows profit-booking by the bulls. The first support on the downside is at the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.33.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will once again try to overcome the hurdle at $0.38. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may rally to $0.42. Contrarily, a break below the 61.8% retracement level of $0.32 could indicate weakening momentum.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 After trading near the $22.30 resistance for a few days, Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) made a solid move on July 13. That pushed the price to the strong overhead resistance at $27.12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/e3c0218e-5939-4783-9669-d15e88c14846.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued their purchase on July 14 and thrust the price above $27.12. This pushed the RSI into deeply overbought territory, indicating that the rally may be extended in the near term. That may result in a short-term correction or consolidation.\par \par \uc2 The important level to watch on the downside is the breakout level of $27.12. If bulls flip this level into support, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could start a strong rally to $39. Alternatively, if bears sink and sustain the price below $27.12, the pair could descend to $22.30.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) staged a strong turnaround on July 13 and surged above the moving averages. This shows that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/8a3cf094-1584-45e3-9eb8-cf809cee1419.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to sustain the price above the overhead resistance of $0.07. If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could start a new up move. The pair may then rise to $0.08, where the bears will again try to stall the rally.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below $0.07, it could trap several aggressive bulls. The pair may then plummet to the moving averages. Such a move will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-cardano-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully held the 20-day EMA ($96) on July 12, indicating that the sentiment has turned positive in \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/39a14c47-f220-4b09-a823-21f92a04db21.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rally has reached near $106, where the bulls are likely to face solid resistance. If buyers do not give up much ground from the current levels, it will increase the likelihood of a break above $106. The LTC/USDT pair could then retest the important resistance of $115. If this level is scaled, the pair may rally to $134.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and closes below the 20-day EMA. The pair may then slump to the 50-day SMA ($90).\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) back below the breakout level of $0.72 on July 12, but the bulls held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/39c49e4f-dca1-4fff-873a-2a698611d2f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 That attracted huge buying on July 13, which propelled the price to $0.89, just shy of the pattern target of $0.94. The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is near the overbought zone, indicating that bulls are in control. The up move could reach the psychological level of $1, where the bears are expected to mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($0.72). A break and close below it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the moving averages on July 13 and reached the overhead resistance at $5.64 on July 14.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/81207d60-f017-42c3-9c43-dd1ef5b2b025.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($5.20) has turned up slightly and the RSI has jumped into positive territory, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. The DOT/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head-and-shoulders pattern on a break and close above $5.64. That could start a new up move, which has a pattern target of $7.06.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the rally, they will have to drag and sustain the price back below $5.64. That may keep the pair range-bound between the 50-day SMA ($5.05) and $5.64 for some time.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/4d5ba272-30c2-482e-a4d9-973a19d43d6a.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230714ej7e000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By   Yashu Gola \par \uc2 743 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano price has rallied substantially as traders see its potential of bypassing the SEC's regulatory threats based on the recent \uc2 Ripple\uc2  win.\par \par \uc2 The price of Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has soared in the past 24 hours as traders assess the impact of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-wins-case-against-sec-as-judge-rules-xrp-is-not-a-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple's legal win}}}\uc2  on the broader cryptocurrency market.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't a security"\par \par \uc2 On July 14, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price rose 6% to $0.379, its highest level in over a month, only to pare some of those gains as traders booked profits.\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD was up around 20% on a 24-hour timeframe, boosted by the euphoria of \uc2 Ripple\uc2 's legal win against the \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/067a2a9b-1582-4e86-803c-c539d4c13f48.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Notably, a federal judge ruled on July 13 that XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) sales on public crypto exchanges complied with U.S. securities laws. The ruling provided fodder for cryptocurrencies \u8212\'20\'14 that the SEC had accused of being securities \u8212\'20\'14 to defend themselves in court.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-holders-celebrate-ripple-win-victory-sec-case"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP ruling a \u8216\'20\'18watershed moment,\u8217\'20\'19 but we\u8217\'20\'19re not out of the woods yet \u8212\'20\'14 Lawyers}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is one of those cryptocurrencies; it fell by as much as 45% in June after the SEC deemed it as security in its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/5-key-highlights-sec-lawsuit-binance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lawsuits}}}\uc2  against crypto exchanges \uc2 Binance\uc2  and \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 . But now, Cardano's token has erased almost all of those losses.\par \par \uc2 If {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24XRP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $XRP}}}\uc2  isn't a security... {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETH}}}\uc2  isn't a security {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BNB&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BNB}}}\uc2  isn't a security {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  isn't a security {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SOL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SOL}}}\uc2  isn't a security {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MATIC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MATIC}}}\uc2  isn't a security {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ATOM&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ATOM}}}\uc2  isn't a security {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24FIL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $FIL}}}\uc2  isn't a security {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ICP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ICP}}}\uc2  isn't a security\par \par \uc2 And so on...\par \par \uc2 Not a legal opinion, just common sense.\par \par \uc2 gg GG\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Chris Burniske (@cburniske) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/cburniske/status/1679525205239287810?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 13, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano whales are napping\par \par \uc2 However, whales appear to have stood by as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price saw double-digit gains in the last 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 For instance, the number of daily \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions exceeding $100,000 on the network has risen to its highest count since June.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/3f12f0b0-8f10-42f4-be95-5abf0f05a3f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The number of Cardano whale transactions exceeding $100K on a daily basis. Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 At the same time, the Cardano supply held by the 100,000-100 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  balance cohort was flat during the price rally. Meanwhile, the 100 million-1 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  balance cohort (green) rose sharply due to the decline in the 1 billion-infinity \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token cohort (gray).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/a2923515-334a-4e5b-9846-f68d8c018ea3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano supply distribution. Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 In other words, the richest \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  holders may have been selling (or redistributing) their holdings during the price rally.\par \par \uc2 What's next for Cardano's price?\par \par \uc2 From a technical perspective, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price risks entering a consolidation or correction period in the coming days as its big rally left it "overbought."\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-hit-1-dollar-ripple-levels"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Can XRP price hit $1? Watch these levels next}}}\par \par \uc2 On July 14, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's daily relative strength index (RSI) crossed above 70, the "overbought" threshold.\par \par \uc2 In addition, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD tests a multi-month trendline (orange) and the 200-day exponential moving average (200-day EMA; the blue wave) near $0.35 as resistance, which limits its upside potential.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/925d99c5-ac68-4a0d-8864-e06cc6231b9b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 So if the bears manage to pull the price down significantly, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price could test $0.32 in July \u8212\'20\'14 also its support level from October 2022-November 2022 and January 2023-March 2023.\par \par \uc2 Additional selloffs can take Cardano down further down to $0.30 in July, down 12.5% from current price levels.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price double bottom?\par \par \uc2 Conversely, the bulls will argue for their case by zooming out. Notably, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price appears to be forming a classic \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  reversal pattern on the weekly candle chart \u8212\'20\'14 with a potential price target 150% higher than today's.\par \par \uc2 Dubbed the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-double-bottom-excites-bulls-as-nvt-signal-predicts-major-move"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 double bottom}}}\uc2 , the pattern develops when the price forms two local lows in a row followed by a sharp rebound toward a common neckline resistance. The price can rally by as much as the pattern's maximum height after it breaks above the neckline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/65af40fc-d6f8-4989-8d08-84a66b8f9555.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD weekly price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 In other words, the Cardano bulls will target $0.45 by the end of 2023 based on such a scenario.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/ee242966-6569-4aaa-84e1-d03cabc311b1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230714ej7e0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 XRP price\par \b \uc2 Why is XRP price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Kyle White \par \uc2 495 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s victory against the SEC was followed by a strong double-digit rally from XRP.\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) price is up today following news that Federal District Judge Analisa Torres of the Southern District of New York ruled against the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s contention that XRP is a security.\par \par \uc2 Shortly after the ruling became public, XRP price rose more than 75% to a 1-year high of $0.93 as market participants viewed the ruling as a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign for XRP.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/95cfea35-501a-40f2-adae-91b01753bfde.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT price. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 XRP and peers rally after a favorable court ruling\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s longstanding legal battle with numerous courts and investors' lingering concerns over XRP\u8217\'20\'19s utility has long weighed on the altcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price. For at least a year, numerous analysts have speculated that a positive ruling in federal courts would translate to a sharp rally in XRP price, an outcome which was validated on July 13.\par \par \uc2 United States District Judge Analisa Torres of the Southern District of New York {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-wins-case-against-sec-as-judge-rules-xrp-is-not-a-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 granted summary judgment}}}\uc2  in favor of \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2  on 3 out of 4 issues maintaining that in certain scenarios, the XRP token is not a security.\par \par \uc2 The ruling comes nearly 3-years after the lawsuit was filed by the SEC against \uc2 Ripple\uc2  on Dec. 22, 2022. An amended complaint from the SEC was subsequently filed on February 18, 2021.\par \par \uc2 Interestingly, other tokens which had recently been delisted by major exchanges over concerns that they could be unregistered securities issuances also rallied.\par \par \uc2 Top gainers on the hour include {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MATIC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MATIC}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SOL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SOL}}}\uc2 , and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  -- all three were delisted by Robinhood after SEC named them securities in suits against \uc2 Binance\uc2  and \uc2 Coinbase{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/ZiwNGlntVx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/ZiwNGlntVx}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Andrew T (@Blockanalia) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Blockanalia/status/1679524251357917185?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 13, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s sibling token Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ), also followed in \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s footsteps, rallying more than 70% at the time of publishing to hit a near 9-month high at $0.19.\par \par \uc2 As a result of today\u8217\'20\'19s ruling, a handful of analysts have suggested that the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s loss against \uc2 Ripple\uc2  calls into question the viability of its other enforcement actions against crypto-focused companies. Some have even suggested that today\u8217\'20\'19s ruling will hamper the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s multi-year resistance to approving a spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  +8% in an hour after XRP declared not a security. Market is pricing in a higher chance of \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  winning its case against the SEC.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Will Clemente (@WClementeIII) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1679523261443448833?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 13, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Year-to-date, XRP has gained 136%, and while the altcoin is still significantly down from the all-time high of $3.40, today\u8217\'20\'19s victory against the SEC could possibly be the beginning of a longer-term turnaround.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/27adace7-91b4-4f1e-a47f-00f5c1e7cf7c.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230713ej7d000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Why is the crypto market up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Kyle White \par \uc2 607 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The entire crypto market flashed green today as \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s victory over the SEC triggered a market-wide rally.\par \par \uc2 The crypto market is up today as Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and numerous altcoins rallied after a United States Federal {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-wins-case-against-sec-as-judge-rules-xrp-is-not-a-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 District Judge ruled}}}\uc2  that XRP is not a security.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-xrp-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP price}}}\uc2  led the rally on July 13, reaching a 1-year high of $0.93 and gaining over 75% on the day. Bitcoin price reached above the year-to-date high of $31,800, while Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ), which is similar to XRP rallied over 67% to hit a near 9-month high above $0.19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/e7925d88-b038-4de4-9231-7dc1535ea6e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market 1-day price action. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/bitcoin-miami-2023-shitcoins-for-bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin 2023 in Miami comes to grips with \u8216\'20\'18shitcoins on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s examine three of the major factors influencing today\u8217\'20\'19s crypto market rally.\par \par \uc2 Crypto liquidations rule the day\par \par \uc2 Today\u8217\'20\'19s rally fueled a wave of short position liquidations across the market, totaling over $180 million in 24-hours. XRP short liquidations lead the way with the largest single liquidation of $2.8 million in one transaction on BitMex exchange. In total, $27.3 million in XRP shorts have been liquidated in 24-hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/244ea031-5edb-4a87-9fa0-13de61a94b36.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total crypto liquidations in 1-day. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 The US dollar index (DXY) continues to cool off\par \par \uc2 Another positive sign for crypto market prices is the cooling U.S. dollar index (DXY). Historically when the DXY index retracts, sentiment for risk assets like Bitcoin increases.\par \par \uc2 The DXY may continue cooling after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-31k-disinflation-boosting-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CPI data showed}}}\uc2  the smallest 12-month jump since March 2021. In a perfect world, investors would ideally view a retracting DXY as a reason to increase sentiment for risk assets like cryptocurrencies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/0af9862d-b76b-4dee-9f47-af1ad256c2f5.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC and DXY price action. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 DXY\u8217\'20\'19s pullback has been in lockstep with a return to form for Bitcoin and altcoins. Historically, a cooling DXY is followed by Bitcoin price and crypto markets moving in the opposite direction.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  buzz\par \par \uc2 Previous speculations around the potential for the first \uc2 Bitcoin \b \highlight22\uc2 ETF\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2  approval\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the U.S. helped the crypto market but the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-hopium-fades-as-on-chain-and-futures-data-reflect-traders-muted-activity"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hopium had somewhat waned}}}\uc2  since the rush of filings in early July. Some analysts think that the recent victory by \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2  against the SEC may make it more difficult for Chairman \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  to reject the current round of \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  applications.\par \par \uc2 PS - If XRP isn't a security, clearly BTC and ETH are not either.\par \par \uc2 Good luck on stopping the ETF now Gensler.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Adam Cochran (adamscochran.eth) (@adamscochran) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/adamscochran/status/1679516114970083329?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 13, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Galaxy Digital\uc2  founder, \uc2 Mike Novogratz\uc2  believes approval of a spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  would essentially be a government {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-seal-of-approval-sec-galaxy-novogratz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seal of approval}}}\uc2  for Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-xrp-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is XRP price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin and altcoins still have risk events that can impact the price, the Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-this-week-fear-26k-key-5-things"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fear & Greed Index}}}\uc2  is highlighting that investors are more apt to take on risk assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/289456e3-e4d5-4732-b44e-8887765e0075.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Fear & Greed Index. Source: Alternative.me\par \par \uc2 Overall, crypto markets are likely to continue seeing price \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . While the positive news of \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 victory against the SEC is providing a nice short-term bump in crypto prices, the market\u8217\'20\'19s reaction to any new enforcement actions or an economic recession will be the true determinant of the direction the market chooses to take.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/a633230d-3f9a-4749-8bab-017c4b9435a0.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230713ej7d000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 XRP price\par \b \uc2 Why is XRP price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Kyle White \par \uc2 493 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s victory against the SEC was followed by a strong double-digit rally from XRP.\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) price is up today following news that Federal District Judge Analisa Torres of the Southern District of New York ruled against the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s contention that XRP is a security.\par \par \uc2 Shortly after the ruling became public, XRP price rose 64.74% to a 1-year high of $0.77 as market participants viewed the ruling as a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign for XRP.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/95cfea35-501a-40f2-adae-91b01753bfde.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT price. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 XRP and peers rally after a favorable court ruling\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s longstanding legal battle with numerous courts and investors' lingering concerns over XRP\u8217\'20\'19s utility has long weighed on the altcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price. For at least a year, numerous analysts have speculated that a positive ruling in federal courts would translate to a sharp rally in XRP price, an outcome which was validated on July 13.\par \par \uc2 United States District Judge Analisa Torres of the Southern District of New York {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-wins-case-against-sec-as-judge-rules-xrp-is-not-a-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 granted summary judgment}}}\uc2  in favor of \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2  on 3 out of 4 issues maintaining that in certain scenarios, the XRP token is not a security.\par \par \uc2 The ruling comes nearly 3-years after the lawsuit was filed by the SEC against \uc2 Ripple\uc2  on Dec. 22, 2022. An amended complaint from the SEC was subsequently filed on February 18, 2021.\par \par \uc2 Interestingly, other tokens which had recently been delisted by major exchanges over concerns that they could be unregistered securities issuances also rallied.\par \par \uc2 Top gainers on the hour include {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MATIC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MATIC}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SOL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SOL}}}\uc2 , and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  -- all three were delisted by Robinhood after SEC named them securities in suits against \uc2 Binance\uc2  and \uc2 Coinbase{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/ZiwNGlntVx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/ZiwNGlntVx}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Andrew T (@Blockanalia) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Blockanalia/status/1679524251357917185?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 13, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s sibling token Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ), also followed in \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s footsteps, rallying 36.2% at the time of publishing to hit a near 9-month high at $0.13.\par \par \uc2 As a result of today\u8217\'20\'19s ruling, a handful of analysts have suggested that the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s loss against \uc2 Ripple\uc2  calls into question the viability of its other enforcement actions against crypto-focused companies. Some have even suggested that today\u8217\'20\'19s ruling will hamper the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s multi-year resistance to approving a spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  +8% in an hour after XRP declared not a security. Market is pricing in a higher chance of \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  winning its case against the SEC.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Will Clemente (@WClementeIII) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1679523261443448833?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 13, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Year-to-date, XRP has gained 114%, and while the altcoin is still significantly down from the all-time high of $3.40, today\u8217\'20\'19s victory against the SEC could possibly be the beginning of a longer-term turnaround.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/27adace7-91b4-4f1e-a47f-00f5c1e7cf7c.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230713ej7d000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, LTC, MATIC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,736 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Strong inflows into Bitcoin could enhance the prospects of a break above $31,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls are again having a go at the overhead resistance of $31,000. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment may get a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/07/11/stock-market-today-live-updates.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 boost}}}\uc2  from the United States inflation report, which showed signs of slowing inflation. Economists were expecting the year-on-year Consumer Price Index to rise 3.1%, but the June print came in at 3%.\par \par \uc2 The month-on-month increase of 0.2% was also less than forecast. This suggests that the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s rate hikes are having the desired effect. That may limit future rate hikes by the Fed.\par \par \uc2 Supported by macroeconomic conditions, institutional investors seem to be turning positive on cryptocurrencies, especially Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ). A \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  report published on July 10 showed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-continues-dominance-3rd-week-fund-inflows-correct-previous-months-outflows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflows of $136 million into digital investment products}}}\uc2  in the past week. That brings the total inflows of three consecutive weeks to $470 million, indicating a positive outlook.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/bc00db62-c880-43c4-88ad-b22d415257c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Large investors could be turning positive on Bitcoin because they anticipate a huge inflow of traditional finance money if the \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  approves a spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund (ETF). Bloomberg ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2  said in an exclusive interview with Cointelegraph that an \b \highlight22\uc2 ETF approval\b0 \highlight{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-bitcoin-etf-could-unlock-30-trillion-worth-of-wealth-bloomberg-analyst-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 would unlock $30 trillion worth of capital}}}\uc2  for Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Could the tailwind of the positive triggers prove \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for Bitcoin and the major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from the overhead resistance at $31,000 on July 10, but a positive sign is that the bulls did not allow the price to dip below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $30,012.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/42181d48-9b38-480b-9120-e21e0f9e06c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers drive and sustain the price above $31,000, the BTC/USDT pair is likely to start the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The pair could ascend to $32,400, where the bears are expected to again mount a strong defense. If bulls do not allow the price to fall below the 20-day EMA, the pair is likely to soar toward $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly pull the price below $29,500. That could start a decline to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $28,312.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) once again bounced off the 50-day SMA ($1,843) on July 10, indicating that the bulls are fiercely guarding this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/a5251501-48af-469b-b566-b6996ecbfed8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned up and closed above the 20-day EMA ($1,874), indicating that the bulls are trying to make a comeback. If buyers drive the price above $1,906, the ETH/USDT pair could attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $2,000. This level is likely to witness strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 The crucial support to watch on the downside is the 50-day SMA. If this level gives way, it could pave the way for a deeper correction to $1,700.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle in BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ). This suggests indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/e961d1c7-eacc-43a9-a5c9-3f08ef6b4e05.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The symmetrical triangle usually behaves as a continuation pattern, but in some cases, it turns into a reversal setup. If buyers kick and maintain the price above the triangle, it will suggest a possible trend reversal. The BNB/USDT pair could rise to $265 and thereafter sprint to the pattern target of $293.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and slips below the 20-day EMA ($242), it will suggest that the pair may spend some more time inside the triangle. The bears will have to yank the price below the support line to seize control.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to thrust XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.48) on July 10, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/6580dbb4-7ab3-40fe-b75a-0caea79130fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to cross the roadblock at the 20-day EMA and then at the 50-day SMA ($0.49) to gain the upper hand. If they do that, the XRP/USDT pair could pick up momentum and surge to $0.53 and eventually to $0.56.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply from the current level