opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/5d4b08a3-a82d-48f6-a1a7-b4fcd976e9e7.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230712ej7c000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/10: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,801 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index has turned down, a potential buy signal for Bitcoin and altcoin traders.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been struggling to rise and sustain above the $31,000 level for the past few days, but \uc2 Standard Chartered\uc2  has painted a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  picture for this year and the next. In a report, the bank said that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) could reach $50,000 this year and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-supply-shock-btc-price-120k-standard-chartered"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stretch the rally to $120,000}}}\uc2  by the end of next year.\par \par \uc2 Large investors seem to be taking a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  stance and are making the most of the stagnant Bitcoin prices. Behavioral analytics platform Santiment shows that sharks and whales, entities holding between 10 and 10,000 Bitcoin, have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cpi-btc-supply-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased their hoarding by 71,000 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  since mid-June.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/759f586a-22e4-40b7-a6c0-b8f4d0a82aea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 While the long term looks \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , macroeconomic indicators hold the key in the short term. The United States equities market is likely to be influenced by second-quarter earnings and the inflation data due to be released on July 12. That is likely to set the stage for a risk-on or a risk-off sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Could the S&P 500 Index (SPX) resume its rally over the next few days? Will Bitcoin and altcoins follow the equities markets higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to protect the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of 4,373, but the long wick on the July 7 candlestick shows that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/7b90b635-f278-4f03-89f2-0a595bf46b8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has started to form a negative divergence, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. That could result in a minor correction or consolidation for a few days.\par \par \uc2 If the 20-day EMA crumbles, the index may decline to 4,325. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it may sink the index to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of 4,257.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the price turns up from the current level and soars above 4,457. That will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The index could next rally to 4,650.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) skidded back below the moving averages on July 7, which suggests that the bears have kept up the pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/4f8194a7-d75f-45ab-b948-f2fcfb1e2966.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The index could next slump to the support at 101.92. Buyers are expected to defend this level with vigor because a break below it may challenge the vital support at 100.82.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to keep an eye on, but if it breaks down, the index will complete a descending triangle pattern. That could signal the resumption of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off 101.92, the bulls will again try to overcome the barrier at 103.57. If they can pull it off, the index may climb to the downtrend line. A break and close above this level will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, signaling that the bulls are on a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the 20-day EMA ($29,886) on July 7 but returned to retest the level on July 10. The retest of a support level within a short period of time tends to weaken it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/02d7f782-5ccf-4a2a-ab9a-22ecdd173fd5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent a fall, they will have to propel the price to the overhead resistance zone between $31,000 and $31,500. This zone is likely to attract strong selling, but if bulls overcome this obstacle, the BTC/USDT pair may rally to the next major resistance at $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and plunges below the 20-day EMA, it may tempt several short-term bulls to book profits. The pair could then descend to the 50-day SMA ($28,170). Such a deep correction will suggest that the pair may remain stuck between $24,800 and $31,500 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to guard the 50-day SMA ($1,841), but they are struggling to propel Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($1,871). This suggests that the bears are not willing to give up their advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/80515487-2ed9-47a2-905e-45b5b503426f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out and the RSI is near the midpoint, signaling a balance between supply and demand. If buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, the ETH/USDT pair may climb to the overhead resistance at $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price tumbles below the 50-day SMA, the bears will try to yank the price to $1,700. This level may act as support, but if it gives way, the pair could extend its slide to the vital support at $1,626.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully held the support at $230 and pushed BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($241) on July 10. This indicates solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/65cd393a-5b1f-4351-94ff-7b7af150a3ca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. The BNB/USDT pair may then attempt a rally to the overhead resistance zone between $257 and $265. The bears are expected to fiercely defend the zone.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest that the pair may continue to oscillate between $220 and $265 for a while longer. The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below $220 to indicate the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) remains pinned below the 20-day EMA ($0.48), indicating that the bears are selling on every recovery attempt.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/680b7a56-5e7c-44f7-b994-fc86e9bf714d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping down and the RSI is in negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand. Sellers will attempt to strengthen their position by pulling the price below the $0.45 support. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair may deepen the correction to the next support at $0.41.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the slide, they will have to quickly thrust and sustain the price above the moving averages. That could open the doors for a possible relief rally to $0.53 and then to $0.58.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.29) on July 8, but they could not sustain the higher levels. The bears pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA on July 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/c22f293c-ef64-4ef8-88f5-af05d214c857.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to protect the uptrend line if they want to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern intact. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to drive the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair above the $0.30 resistance. If they manage to do that, the pair may start a new up move toward $0.35 and then $0.39.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price slips below the uptrend line, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern and sink the pair to $0.26. That will indicate a consolidation between $0.24 and $0.30 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gaming-gear-maker-razer-hacked-user-data-encryption-keys-for-sale-online-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Gaming gear maker Razer hacked, user data, encryption keys for sale online: Report}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers are finding it difficult to propel Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.07), indicating that the bears are defending the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/10e6d837-9f9d-43f5-b603-7f5c878132c8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price to the strong support at $0.06. This level is likely to attract buyers. If the price rebounds off this level with strength, it will signal that the DOGE/USDT pair may extend its range-bound action between $0.06 and $0.07 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is expected to begin after buyers drive the price above $0.07 or bears sink the pair below $0.06. Until then, random and volatile price action is likely to continue.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the immediate resistance at $22, indicating that bears continue to sell on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/551a0021-dac4-4f49-87dd-dd31d456c17b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could correct to the 20-day EMA ($19.15), which is an important support level to keep an eye on. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to clear the overhead hurdle at $22. If they can pull it off, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. The pair could then start a rally toward $27.12.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price continues lower and plummets below the 50-day SMA ($18.44), several aggressive bulls may get trapped. That could result in long liquidation, pulling the pair near $15.28.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to arrest \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) correction at the 20-day EMA ($95), but the bears had other plans. Sellers pulled the price below the 20-day EMA on July 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/93a139dd-5334-4152-828d-3e59899db1fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push the price back above the 20-day EMA, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. If they do that, the LTC/USDT pair may rise to the psychological level of $100. A break above this resistance could start a stronger recovery toward $106 and then $115.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the bears are not willing to let go of their advantage. The pair may then descend to the 50-day SMA ($89) and subsequently to $81.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://mint.cointelegraph.com/?url=https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-7-10-spx-dxy-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-ada-doge-sol-ltc&utm_source=cointelegraph_com&utm_medium=appendix&utm_campaign=articles"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Collect this article as an NFT}}}\uc2  to preserve this moment in history and show your support for independent journalism in the crypto space.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/15573065-76e7-414d-b7a9-8a2e5302796a.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230710ej7a000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
