ved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is finding support at key price levels, opening the door for a rebound in select altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is still struggling to stay above $31,000.\par \par \uc2 While a tight consolidation near the overhead resistance is a positive sign, the failure to rise above it may result in short-term liquidations. However, a shallow pullback should not be considered a trend change because, many times, the bulls take a step back to regroup and launch another attack at the resistance. If the barrier is overcome, the positive momentum picks up.\par \par \uc2 Binance\uc2  CEO Changpeng \u8220\'20\'1CCZ\u8221\'20\'1D Zhao said in an \u8220\'20\'1Cask me anything\u8221\'20\'1D session on \uc2 Twitter\uc2  that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) could witness a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-ceo-cz-predicts-next-bitcoin-bull-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bull year after its halving in 2024}}}\uc2 . CZ added that \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s foray into cryptocurrencies will be \u8220\'20\'1Chugely beneficial\u8221\'20\'1D for the industry.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/933df4c8-c181-484d-9a71-a1b0e38c1e7a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  CEO \uc2 Larry Fink\uc2  made positive comments about Bitcoin while speaking in an interview with Fox Business on July 5. Fink said that Bitcoin was an \u8220\'20\'1Cinternational asset not based on any one currency,\u8221\'20\'1D and investors could use it as a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-international-asset-black-rock-ceo-bullish-remarks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hedge against inflation or currency devaluation}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could positive comments from Fink act as a floor during pullbacks? What are the important overhead resistance levels in Bitcoin and altcoins that need to be crossed to signal the start of a short-term up move? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin once again rose above $31,000 on July 6, but the rally was met with strong selling pressure from the bears. That pulled the price down to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) at $29,763.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/db77fbf6-007f-494d-811f-97494a9a24d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A positive sign in favor of the bulls is that the BTC/USDT pair has rebounded off the 20-day EMA. This suggests a positive sentiment where traders are viewing minor dips as a buying opportunity. That enhances the prospects of a rally above the $31,000 to $31,500 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the pair could start an upward march to $40,000. The bears will attempt to stall the up move at $32,400, but the buyers are expected to bulldoze their way through.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears have the upper hand. The pair may then dump to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $27,971.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) July 6 candlestick shows that the bears are aggressively guarding the psychological resistance at $2,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/4c8ef6a1-0722-49cb-9091-5f9c4ec04f9a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($1,837), the short-term advantage will tilt in favor of the bears. The ETH/USDT pair could then descend toward $1,626.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level and maintains above the 20-day EMA ($1,872), it will suggest strong buying at the 50-day SMA. The bulls will then again try to push the price above $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $257 and $220 for the past few days. This suggests that the bears are using the relief rallies to sell while the bulls are buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/baf38de5-f6e1-4cba-a120-7e9d4d3b9753.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($242) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have an edge. Sellers will try to drag the price to the crucial support at $220. The bulls are expected to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to propel the price above $257 to suggest the start of a sustained recovery. The $265 level may act as a barrier, but it is likely to be crossed. The pair may then surge to $280.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 20-day EMA ($0.48) and the horizontal support at $0.45 for the past few days. This shows that the bears are selling on rallies, but supply is being lapped up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/76e85a65-9463-480c-ad84-b149e702fb67.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This tight-range trading is unlikely to continue for long and may result in a breakout. If the support at $0.45 gives way, the bears will try to build upon this advantage and tug the price to the next strong support at $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will try to overcome the obstacle at the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the XRP/USDT pair could start its march toward $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $0.30 and $0.24 for the past few days. Generally, inside a range, traders buy near the support and sell close to the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/c866eb51-37a4-4634-8d68-110a127254aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Traders did just that in the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair and sold at $0.30. The bulls are attempting to arrest the decline at the uptrend line. If the price turns up from the current level or the uptrend line, the bulls will once again endeavor to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.30.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair may start an up move to $0.38. The 50-day SMA ($0.31) may act as a barrier, but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break below the uptrend line could open the doors for a potential drop to the support at $0.25.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure to propel Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $0.07 on July 4 may have attracted profit-booking from the short-term bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/e8616382-99f3-4ebb-84dc-cc8d6503cca5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 That pulled the price below the moving averages, signaling that the DOGE/USDT pair could remain stuck inside the $0.07 to $0.06 range for a few more days. The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.07) and the RSI just below the midpoint also suggest a range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the overhead resistance of $0.07 to seize control. That could pave the way for a rally to $0.08 and then to $0.10. On the downside, a break below $0.06 could resume the down move. The pair may then slump to $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($18.34) on July 5, indicating that every minor dip is being purchased. The bulls have pushed the price above the downtrend line, indicating that the short-term corrective phase may be ending.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/caf642f1-9366-4822-8393-76acdd03bc66.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are about to complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the RSI is near the overbought territory. This shows that the bulls are in command. If buyers sustain the price above the downtrend line, the SOL/USDT pair may climb to $24. Such a move will indicate that the pair is range-bound between $15.28 and $27.12.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to gain the upper hand, they will have to yank the price below the moving averages. That may catch the aggressive bulls off guard, resulting in a drop to the strong support zone between $16.18 and $15.28.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ai-bitcoin-price-prediction-over-750k-arthur-hayes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AI has potential to send Bitcoin price over $750K \u8212\'20\'14 Arthur Hayes}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $106 on July 5 and 6, but the long wick on the candlesticks shows that the bears fiercely defended the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/d3d2a71a-6442-4126-ac43-1e4da7746324.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USDT pair plunged to the 20-day EMA ($94), which is an important support level to watch out for. If the price bounces off the current level, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $106.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to sell the rallies and sink the pair below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the selling may intensify and the pair may further slide to the 50-day SMA ($89).\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) slipped and closed below the 20-day EMA ($0.67) on July 6, suggesting that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/853b0993-31a6-451f-affd-ff7aaea316c0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to trap the aggressive bulls by pulling the price below the uptrend line. If they manage to do that, the ascending triangle pattern will invalidate. That could trigger the stops of several short-term bulls. The MATIC/USDT pair may then slide to $0.60 and subsequently to $0.55.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the uptrend line, the bulls will again try to resume the up move. A break and close above the 50-day SMA ($0.74) could start the journey toward the pattern target of $0.88.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) July 6 candlestick shows that the bears are selling on intraday rallies. The price plunged below the moving averages, but the bulls are trying to arrest the decline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/1875704a-6f4f-4887-b84c-bc32e2dc78bf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out, and the RSI is near the midpoint. This indicates a balance between supply and demand. The DOT/USDT pair may oscillate between $4.74 and $5.64 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above $5.15. That will indicate solid demand at lower levels. The bulls will then again try to push the pair to $5.64. On the downside, a break below $4.74 could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/d527ad67-58c3-44a0-bbf6-88422a8783c4.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230707ej77000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin forks\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin forks BCH, BSV and XEC soared last month, but are the gains organic and sustainable?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Nivesh Rustgi \par \uc2 1,359 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin forks and proof-of-work blockchains rallied throughout the past month, but data questions the sustainability of each rally.\par \par \uc2 The start of June saw {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 negative price action}}}\uc2  across the cryptocurrency market after the \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) brought fresh lawsuits against the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest exchanges, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-and-cz-sued-by-the-sec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Binance}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-sues-coinbase-crypto-exchange"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 However, the sentiment quickly turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  after a crucial exchange-traded fund (ETF) proposal was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-apply-spot-bitcoin-etf-sec-nasdaq"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed by the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest asset management firm}}}\uc2 , \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 , on June 16. A wave of ETF fillings and institutional trading interest in digital assets followed \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ETF filling.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wall-street-giants-back-edx-markets-cryptocurrency-exchange"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launch of EDX Markets}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 backed by Wall Street giants \uc2 Fidelity Investments\uc2 , Citadel Securities and \uc2 Charles Schwab\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 on June 20 fueled a particular sector of the market, that being Bitcoin forks like Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) and Bitcoin SV ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bsv-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BSV}}}\uc2  ) and other proof-of-work (PoW) cryptocurrencies like Kaspa (KAS).\par \par \uc2 The exchange debuted with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) and BCH. The inclusion of BCH catalyzed an uptrend across other Bitcoin forks.\par \par \uc2 Among the top gainers in June, three Bitcoin forks populated the list, followed by Kaspa and FLEX Coin (FLEX). FLEX benefited from its integration with Open Exchange (OPNX), which is backed by the co-founders of the bankrupt Three Arrows Capital fund.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/9dd47cfd-2315-4348-b7ed-08e06d7a8c3c.JPG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The top five performing coins in June. Source: CoinGecko\par \par \uc2 In comparison, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s monthly gains stood at 11.94%, as it traded above the $30,000 level for the first time since April 2023.\par \par \uc2 FLEX Coin (FLEX) receives short-term boost from link with 3AC co-founders\par \par \uc2 FLEX {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinflex.com/blog/coinflex-to-opnx-account-migration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  a transition to OPNX, a bankruptcy claims exchange, in May 2023. The token\u8217\'20\'19s price reached a 13-month high of $4.37 on June 27.\par \par \uc2 OPNX is backed by the co-founders of now-bankrupt venture fund Three Arrows Capital. Reportedly, the co-founders face {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/three-arrows-liquidators-recoup-losses-from-founders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $1.3 billion in liability}}}\uc2  for actions that exacerbated the losses of the fund.\par \par \uc2 Still, the duo continued to endorse OPNX under a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/former-three-arrows-capital-founders-launch-new-vc-fund#:~:text=OPNX%20was%20founded%20by%20Su,Three%20Arrows%20Capital%20(3AC)."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new venture fund}}}\uc2 , using the same branding as their previous fund.\par \par \uc2 FLEX was approved for a restructuring of its exchange by the Seychelles courts on March 6. Its integration with Open Exchange imparts utility to the FLEX token in OPNX to settle claims and earn staking rewards.\par \par \uc2 Notably, as the FLEX price surged to 2022 peak levels, the trading volumes remained subdued at around 0.01% of the $1 billion daily volume it was generating at its peak, which raises a red flag.\par \par \uc2 It represents a case of significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in illiquid assets. Due to limited liquidity, traders can more easily push up the price of these coins compared to larger, more liquid assets.\par \par \uc2 Technically, the 2022 breakdown level of around $5.08 and all-time-high level of $7.56 will act as resistance levels to the upside. The token faces 80% downside risk to $0.75, which represents the accumulation level in May 2023.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/8d8a1845-b5bb-429f-b169-af0209b05251.JPG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 FLEX price chart. Source: CoinGecko\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash (BCH) riding the EDX Markets uptrend\par \par \uc2 BCH\u8217\'20\'19s price more than doubled in June following its listing on EDX Markets. BCH was one of the four cryptocurrencies that debuted on the platform alongside BTC, ETH, and LTC.\par \par \uc2 While the EDX listing acted as a positive catalyst, negative funding across perpetual swap markets and potential market manipulation on South Korean exchange Upbit are also the primary drivers of the recent uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/2a2a3d6e-19b9-4481-9c2f-20d2b170faae.JPG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Funding rate for BCH perpetual swaps. Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 The token\u8217\'20\'19s price {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TheTieIO/status/1674482699967275025"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 witnessed}}}\uc2  a combined liquidation of $21 million in June, according to an update from crypto analytics outlet The TIE. The levels are significantly higher than usual, when the \u8220\'20\'1Cdaily liquidations total tens of thousands of dollars, if anything.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The total fees paid on the Bitcoin Cash blockchain have ranged lower than $200 since the start of the year, indicating that the blockchain\u8217\'20\'19s usage has been limited.\par \par \uc2 In comparison, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 , which provides a similar utility, generates around 10 times larger revenue for the miners in fees than BCH. The poor fundamentals and high liquidation levels raise a red flag on the sustainability of the recent gains.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/abac47de-13fc-426c-ac12-bfe1ade3b2e0.JPG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The total fees paid on the Bitcoin Cash blockchain. Source: CoinMetrics\par \par \uc2 BSV rides the BCH wave despite poor fundamentals\par \par \uc2 BCH and BSV have a strong correlation of 0.78, which appears to be the reason why BSV enjoyed 31.4% gains in June.\par \par \uc2 BSV has been in a consistent downtrend since 2022, as interest in the blockchain faded after the crypto bull market and its trading volumes dried up.\par \par \uc2 The coin made an all-time low of $21.43 on June 10 before catching the BCH \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  tide and staging an up move.\par \par \uc2 Its poor performance drove miners away from its ecosystem, making a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-is-a-51-attack-and-how-to-detect-it#:~:text=While%20there%20are%20many%20mechanisms,then%20assumes%20control%20over%20it."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 51% attack}}}\uc2  relatively cheaper on Bitcoin SV \u8212\'20\'14 a one-hour attack {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.crypto51.app/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 requiring}}}\uc2  less than $2,000 compared to $1.4 million for Bitcoin, which makes Bitcoin SV vulnerable.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/e28c2b26-7c20-4a94-9929-d359f1aaa9c8.JPG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BSV daily price action. Source: CoinGecko\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/roger-ver-ethereum-catalyst-for-crypto-adoption"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Bitcoin Jesus\u8217\'20\'19 says Ethereum is the front-runner for global \b  \highlight22crypto adoption\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Kaspa (KAS) benefits from improved performance and low liquidity\par \par \uc2 Kaspa is a PoW consensus-based blockchain network similar to Bitcoin and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Kaspa offers a high throughput of one block per second compared to one block per 10 minutes for Bitcoin. Kaspa Labs, the team building the blockchain, also hinted at the launch of a public testnet that will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/DesheShai/status/1674382827108876288"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 enhance}}}\uc2  its scalability 10,000 times, which appears to be fueling its market sentiments.\par \par \uc2 However, the token is primarily {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/kaspa"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 traded}}}\uc2  on unregulated exchanges with low trading volumes and low trust scores, according to CoinGecko. This makes the cryptocurrency susceptible to high \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and manipulation.\par \par \uc2 Technically, if the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum continues, KAS will look to retest 2023 highs of around $0.40. On the downside, the token faces the risk of a correction toward the yearly lows of around $0.15.\par \par \uc2 While the token exhibits illiquid market signs, making it susceptible to \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and faces tough competition from large PoW networks like Bitcoin and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 , its one-year price action has been positive, with higher highs and higher lows.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/c7ca2b18-7410-4bb0-a37e-dbc5c82d850d.JPG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 KAS daily price chart. Source: CoinGecko\par \par \uc2 eCash (XEC) joins BSV and BCH in a Bitcoin fork-rally\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency eCash (XEC) is a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-cash-abc-rebrands-to-ecash-embraces-proof-of-stake-and-2-decimal-places"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rebranded version of a tertiary Bitcoin fork}}}\uc2 , Bitcoin Cash ABC, which was another fork of Bitcoin Cash, like Bitcoin SV.\par \par \uc2 Similar to BCH and BSV, XEC also rode the positive tide that lifted all boats in the BTC fork category.\par \par \uc2 Similar to Bitcoin SV, eCash lacks fundamental value and exhibits \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  due to illiquid market conditions. The token is listed on a few top exchanges like \uc2 Binance\uc2  and Bithumb. However, it has yet to be supported on any United States-based exchange, which raises a red flag.\par \par \uc2 The rise of tokens with low liquidity and loosely based narratives suggest that there could be some price manipulation in these tokens that is influencing their short-term price. The long-term value proposition of Bitcoin forks remains questionable, with low utility and security.\par \par \uc2 Moreover, the cryptocurrency market is still suffering from the adverse {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-sues-coinbase-crypto-exchange"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 impacts of the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s cases}}}\uc2 . The tokens regarded as securities, such as Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) and Flow (FLOW), all posted more than a 20% loss over the month.\par \par \uc2 As the markets struggle with legal challenges, building \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  narratives has been difficult. Given that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-btc-reach-50-percent-market-dominance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin is leading the market}}}\uc2 , its price action will be crucial in determining the direction of altcoins.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/222a170b-ed4f-4bba-b8e6-318d0008e41b.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230706ej76000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
