\par\par \b \uc2 Vitalik Buterin\uc2  Concerned About Solana\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 456 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 July 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Ethereum founder \uc2 Vitalik Buterin\uc2  has expressed his sympathy and concerns for Solana and other cryptocurrencies in the context of the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s crackdown on the crypto markets.\par \par \uc2 Buterin Feels Sorry For Rival Solana\par \par \uc2 In the midst of the ongoing regulatory crackdown on cryptocurrencies by the \uc2 US Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC), Ethereum co-founder \uc2 Vitalik Buterin\uc2  has extended his sympathy to Solana, a rival blockchain platform, in light of the legal actions taken by the SEC against \uc2 Binance\uc2  and \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , both renowned cryptocurrency exchanges globally. Buterin voiced his concerns over what he perceived as an unfair approach to crypto \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , labeling the SEC's actions as unjust.\par \par \uc2 Buterin Questions SEC\u8217\'20\'19s Moves\par \par \uc2 Buterin's comments were made during an online discussion with Matt Huang, Co-Founder and Managing Partner of \uc2 Paradigm\uc2 , a crypto-focused venture capital firm. While the SEC's actions are aimed at protecting investors, Buterin believes that the approach lacks nuance and could impede the progress of the industry as a whole. When asked how he felt about the United States\u8217\'20\'19s crypto policy, Buterin expressed his sympathy, saying,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe one comment I'll make is that I feel bad that Solana and other projects are getting hit in this way. They don\u8217\'20\'19t deserve it, and if Ethereum ends up \u8216\'20\'18winning\u8217\'20\'19 through all other blockchains getting kicked off exchanges, that\u8217\'20\'19s not an honorable way to win, and in the long term probably isn\u8217\'20\'19t even a victory.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 SEC Names SOL As Unregistered Security\par \par \uc2 Solana, which has gained significant attention and experienced rapid growth in recent times, is among the projects facing increased scrutiny from the SEC. The regulatory agency has been actively investigating projects in the crypto sector to ensure compliance with existing securities laws. It has accused the major crypto firms of \uc2 Binance\uc2  and \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  of offering unregistered securities to the public. Naturally, these legal actions have also affected other major tokens, like Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Polygon (MATIC), Algorand (ALGO), Filecoin (FIL), Cosmos (ATOM), Sandbox (SAND), Axie infinity (AXS), Decentraland (MANA), BNB (\uc2 BNB\uc2 ), and others.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCentralized World Imposing On Decentralized Space\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Buterin's sympathy for Solana reflects a broader sentiment within the crypto community, with many expressing concerns about the regulatory uncertainty faced by various projects. Industry participants are calling for clear guidelines and regulations that promote innovation and safeguard investor interests without stifling technological advancements. Buterin underscores that the crypto firms need to stand united as the true opponent is not each other but the \u8220\'20\'1Crapidly expanding centralized world that is imposing itself on the decentralized space.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020230703ej73000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , LTC, MATIC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,704 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins saw increased \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but most have not broken above their respective resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) witnessed a volatile trading session on the last day of the quarter. As the bulls tried to maintain Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price above $31,000, they received a jolt from a report in The Wall Street Journal, which stated that the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-overreacting-sec-etf-filings-btc-price-dives-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 returned applications for Bitcoin}}}\uc2  spot-price exchange-traded funds (ETF).\par \par \uc2 Although there was a knee-jerk reaction to the news, the downside was limited because it turned out that the ETF applications were returned due to a technical issue. The regulators said the asset managers {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-sec-deems-spot-bitcoin-etfs-filings-as-inadequate-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 could refile after providing the necessary clarifications}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/be8bd746-ea91-413b-ae4b-a9934a322b23.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s failure to cross above $31,000 seems to be making the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-send-35k-btc-exchanges-new-elation-inflow"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 short-term speculators jittery}}}\uc2 . A June 28 Glassnode research report shows that short-term holders (STHs) \u8212\'20\'14 entities holding coins for 155 days or less \u8212\'20\'14 have sent over 35,000 coins to the exchanges.\par \par \uc2 Any negative news is likely to spur an adverse reaction from STHs. What are the important support and resistance levels to watch on Bitcoin and altcoins in the near term? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin continues its tight consolidation near the overhead resistance at $31,000. This shows that the bears are trying their best to stall the up-move, but the bulls have kept up the pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/cf3a2010-8ab5-415a-be77-c1e80de58b2f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Generally, a tight consolidation near an overhead resistance resolves to the upside. The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($28,982) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $31,000, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and start the next leg of its uptrend. There is a minor resistance at $32,400, but it will likely be scaled. The pair could then dash toward $40,000.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below the 20-day EMA. The pair may then swing inside the large range between $31,000 and $24,800 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the moving averages on June 29, indicating that the lower levels attract buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/5945e4b3-6f89-4efe-842b-5331deb1dc92.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to propel the price above the overhead resistance at $1,937. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair may rise to the psychological level of $2,000. This level may again act as a minor barrier, but it is likely to be crossed. The pair may then rally to $2,142.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from 1,937, it will suggest that bears are unwilling to surrender. That will increase the likelihood of a drop below the moving averages. The pair may then slump to $1,700 and next to $1,600.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the support at $230 on June 28, but the long tail on the candlestick shows that the bulls aggressively purchased the dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/bd426be2-c068-45fb-9753-fff3c0f509a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($245) remains the key level for the bulls to cross. If they kick the price above it, the BNB/USDT pair could fly toward the overhead resistance zone between $257 and $265. Sellers are expected to mount a strong defense in this zone.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then make one more attempt to sink the pair below $220 and start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) fell close to the first support at $0.44 on June 28 and June 30, but the long tail on the candlesticks shows strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/1d2f7353-de5e-4739-894e-d52e0e185e13.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The $0.44 support is an important level to watch out for in the near term. If this level breaks down, the selling could pick up, and the XRP/USDT pair may tumble to $0.41. This level may again attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.48) remains the key resistance for the bulls to scale. If buyers overcome this obstacle, it will enhance the prospects of a rally to the strong overhead resistance zone between $0.53 and $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $0.24 and $0.30 for the past few days. The long wick on the June 30 candlestick shows that the bears are fiercely defending the $0.30 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/92f0d7f1-27f6-4429-a8bd-71567f4fe02c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.28) could keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair stuck inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 A close above the 20-day EMA will be the first indication that the bears may be losing their grip. Buyers will then try to strengthen their position further by driving the price above the crucial overhead resistance at $0.30. If they do that, the pair may surge toward the 50-day SMA ($0.32).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the support at $0.06 on June 28, indicating that the bulls continue to defend the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/fbee31b0-5ca4-4008-8bf4-0a21bb84fe55.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.07) and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a range-bound action in the near term. The price may swing between $0.06 and $0.07 for a while longer. This neutral view will tilt in favor of the buyers if they thrust and sustain the price above the overhead resistance at $0.07. The DOGE/USDT pair may then climb to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, the bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the strong support of $0.06 to gain the upper hand. The pair may then fall to the vital support at $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke below the $16.18 support on June 28, but this proved to be a bear trap. The price turned up sharply on June 29 and skyrocketed above the 20-day EMA ($17.07) as the bears may have rushed to cover their short positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/1cf3b617-394c-4107-88a4-d9d06d5515e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buying continued on June 30, with the bulls trying to drive the price above the breakdown level of $18.70. If they can pull it off, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair may shoot up to $22 and subsequently to $24.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to stop the relief rally at $18.70 and pull the price back below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then retest the crucial support zone between $16.18 and $15.28.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-approval-billion-dollar-sell-pressure"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why approving a Bitcoin ETF might unleash $18B in sell-pressure}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the moving averages on June 28, but the bears could not build upon this advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/01a2aa26-b8f5-49f7-b85f-10e61ae0f7a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip on June 29 and pushed the price back above the moving averages on June 30. This attracted aggressive buying by the bulls, who drove the price above the downtrend line of the descending channel pattern. The price reached the crucial resistance at $106, but the bulls could not overcome this barrier.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level for the bears to defend because if this resistance crumbles, the LTC/USDT pair may jump to $135. The major support is at the downtrend line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to form a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close above $0.69.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/74dbd8bb-4f8f-4771-893d-265d7f44496e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.66) on June 30, but the long wick on the candlestick shows aggressive selling at higher levels. If the price dips below the uptrend line, the MATIC/USDT pair may slide toward $0.55.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises from the current level, it will signal strong buying near the uptrend line. A break and close above $0.69 could open the doors for a potential rally to the 50-day SMA and subsequently to $1.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sink Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($4.93) on June 28 and June 30, but the bulls held their ground. This suggests that dips are being bought.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/6a58ec49-0c6c-4c31-a310-a9d4f6d508af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to clear and sustain the overhead hurdle at $5.15. If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair may rise to $5.56. This level could attract strong selling by the bears, but on the way down, if bulls do not allow the price to slip below $5.15, the possibility of a rally to the downtrend line increases.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA remains the key level to watch out for because a break below it may open the doors for a collapse to the pivotal support at $4.22.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/8dcd4c5f-ba69-410c-91f8-b90c0d2ec519.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230702ej710005m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Hodler's Digest\par \b \uc2 SEC calls ETF filings inadequate, \uc2 Binance\uc2  loses euro partner and other news: Hodler\u8217\'20\'19s Digest, June 25 \u8211\'20\'13 July 1\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Editorial Staff \par \uc2 1,455 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 SEC calls BTC ETF filings inadequate, \uc2 Binance\uc2  loses euro partner, and a record number of DeFi hacks and scams in 2023.\par \par \uc2 Top Stories This Week\par \par \uc2 US SEC\uc2  deems spot Bitcoin ETFs filings as inadequate\par \par \uc2 There may be a longer wait for a spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund (ETF) in the United States, as the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-sec-deems-spot-bitcoin-etfs-filings-as-inadequate-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 labeled investment managers recent applications inadequate}}}\uc2 . The SEC told the Nasdaq and the \uc2 Chicago Board Options Exchange\uc2  that their filings are not sufficiently clear and comprehensive. The regulator returned the filings, citing the lack of information regarding the proposed surveillance-sharing agreement. Asset managers can still resubmit their applications.\par \par \uc2 Cathie Woods ARK reportedly first in line for a spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\par \par \uc2 ARK Investment Management\uc2  is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cathie-wood-s-ark-reportedly-first-in-line-for-a-spot-bitcoin-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reportedly ahead of BlackRock}}}\uc2  in the race for a spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 , as it still has a previous application pending with the United States securities regulator. ARK and \uc2 21Shares\uc2  filed their third application for a spot BTC ETF in April, and amended it this week {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-race-gets-hotter-as-ark-invest-adds-surveillance-agreement-to-application"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to include a surveillance-sharing agreement}}}\uc2 , making it similar to \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s filing. Since \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s application on June 16, other investment firms such as Valkyrie, \uc2 WisdomTree\uc2  and Invesco have reapplied for spot Bitcoin ETFs.\par \par \uc2 Binance\uc2  to lose support of its euro banking partner\par \par \uc2 Crypto exchange \uc2 Binance{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-loses-support-of-euro-banking-partner"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 informed users that its current euro banking partner}}}\uc2 , Paysafe Payment Solutions, will no longer support the exchange after September 25. \uc2 Binance\uc2  said it will switch to a new service provider for euro deposits and withdrawals via SEPA bank transfer, though it didnt name which provider that would be. In recent months, \uc2 Binance\uc2  has been facing waves of backlash from regulators around the world, leading to a cessation of operations in various countries.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://servedbyadbutler.com/go2/;ID=169476;size=728x90;setID=601214;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fcointelegraph.com%2Fmagazine%2Fwp-json%2Fwp%2Fv2%2Fposts%3F_embed%26per_page%3D100"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://servedbyadbutler.com/go2/;ID=169476;size=300x250;setID=601213;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fcointelegraph.com%2Fmagazine%2Fwp-json%2Fwp%2Fv2%2Fposts%3F_embed%26per_page%3D100"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 FTX\uc2  has recovered $7B in assets so far, has almost $2B to go to cover misappropriations\par \par \uc2 FTX\uc2  has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-recovered-7b-assets-has-almost-2b-to-go-to-cover-misappropriations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recovered about $7 billion in liquid assets so far}}}\uc2 , and the search for additional assets is continuing, according to an interim report released June 26. The extensive commingling of funds complicates their efforts, however. The FTX Debtors, made up of \uc2 FTX\uc2  and affiliates, currently estimate the amount of misappropriated customer assets at $8.7 billion. Most of that money, about $6.4 billion, was in fiat and stablecoins. The former \uc2 FTX\uc2  leadership did not commingle and misuse customer deposits by accident, the report alleged.\par \par \uc2 3AC liquidators look to recoup $1.3B from founders\par \par \uc2 Teneo\uc2 , the liquidator behind bankrupt hedge fund Three Arrows Capital (3AC) is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/three-arrows-liquidators-recoup-losses-from-founders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seeking to recover roughly $1.3 billion in funds}}}\uc2  from its founders Su Zhu and Kyle Davies. The debt reportedly incurred when 3AC was already insolvent, adding to creditors losses. The company owed creditors $3.5 billion, making the founders potential liability more than a third of the total debt. Davies and Zhu have maintained active social media profiles, but their physical whereabouts are unknown, delaying the liquidation process. Both 3AC founders have received digital subpoenas during the bankruptcy proceedings. To date, they have not cooperated.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Mel-McCann-1024x682.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Winners and Losers\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/WL-july-1-01-1024x826.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 At the end of the week, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is at $30,418, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) at $1,928 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  at $0.47. The total market cap is at $1.19 trillion, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 Among the biggest 100 cryptocurrencies, the top three altcoin gainers of the week are Compound (COMP) at 84.33%, Bitcoin Cash (BCH) at 63.16% and eCash (XEC) at 44.59%.\par \par \uc2 The top three altcoin losers of the week are Conflux (CFX) at -22.38%, Sui (SUI) at -15.41% and Stacks (STX) at -14.81%.\par \par \uc2 For more info on crypto prices, make sure to read {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraphs market analysis}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Read also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/sexual-violence-india-blockchain/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features Sexual Violence in India: Blockchains Role in Empowering Survivors}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/what-metaverse-really-like-right-now-pictures/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features Basic and weird: What the Metaverse is like right now}}}\par \par \uc2 Most Memorable Quotations\par \par \uc2 One of the things that I think people need to stop doing is going, Whats the ultimate blockchain? [\u8230\'20\'26] It doesnt exist in my mind because it really depends.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-best-blockchain-does-not-exist-cardano-foundation-exec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mel McCann}}}\uc2 , vice president of engineering at the Cardano Foundation\par \par \uc2 Crypto presents [the SEC] an opportunity to rethink how we approach innovation. [\u8230\'20\'26] I really think we\u8217\'20\'19ve been taking an approach that is not appropriate.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/hester-peirce-dont-label-all-crypto-financial-asset"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Hester Peirce}}}\uc2 , commissioner of the \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission\par \par \uc2 Many of the largest financial institutions in the US are actively working to provide access to Bitcoin and more.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/27-trillion-ready-for-bitcoin-btc-coinshares-cso-meltem-demirors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Meltem Demirors}}}\uc2 , chief strategy officer at \uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 I think that our NFTs are a neat way to show that we do have a seat at the table and that were really invested in crypto and the investigation of digital assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/secret-service-reveals-more-about-its-nft-collection"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Andrew Frey}}}\uc2 , forensic financial analyst in the \uc2 U.S. Secret Service\par \par \uc2 Once in a while, something comes along that makes poor people rich because they got it really, really cheap. This [Bitcoin] was one of them.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/story-behind-buy-1-worth-of-bitcoin-video-10-years-later"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Davinci Jeremie}}}\uc2 , crypto advocate\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  by enforcement is the equivalent of having a hammer and seeing everything as a nail.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blockchain-australia-new-ceo-takes-aim-regulation-by-enforcement-united-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Simon Callaghan}}}\uc2 , CEO of Blockchain Australia\par \par \uc2 Prediction of the Week\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin speculators send 35K BTC to exchanges in new elation inflow\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin short-term holders (STHs) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-send-35k-btc-exchanges-new-elation-inflow"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 are feeling the need to sell BTC at $30,000}}}\uc2 , according to a recent report from analytics firm Glassnode flagging tens of thousands of coins being sent to exchanges.\par \par \uc2 This indicates that speculative interest in Bitcoin remains fickle and highly sensitive to even smaller price movements.\par \par \uc2 Historical data has shown that once STH profitability reaches an aggregate 20%, selling begins, and against their current $26,500 breakeven point, anything much above $33,000 could spark a significant shift in hodler composition. Current data shows STH profitability at around 10%, with their realized price the price at which STH coins last moved now above $27,000.\par \par \uc2 FUD of the Week\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Simon-Callaghan-1024x682.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/california-files-order-against-nexo-interest-account-says-it-s-8th-state-to-take-action"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/california-files-order-against-nexo-interest-account-says-it-s-8th-state-to-take-action}}}\par \par \uc2 FTX\uc2  alleges former exec used hush money to silence whistleblowers\par \par \uc2 FTX\uc2  has filed a lawsuit against a former regulatory and compliance executive at the exchange, alleging he made a series of payments {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-sues-dan-friedberg-for-paying-off-whistleblowers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 attempting to prevent staff from blowing the whistle}}}\uc2  about the exchanges issues. Daniel Friedberg, who held multiple leadership roles at the exchange, is accused of making hush money payments to two potential whistleblowers to stop them from leaking information about regulatory issues and the close ties between \uc2 FTX\uc2  and Alameda.\par \par \uc2 Over $204M was lost in Q2 DeFi hacks and scams\par \par \uc2 Over $204 million {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/over-204m-was-lost-in-q2-defi-hacks-and-scams-de-fi-rekt-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 was lost in decentralized finance (DeFi) hacks and scams}}}\uc2  in the second quarter of 2023, according to a recent report. A total of $208.5 million was initially lost during the quarter, but $4.5 million was recovered through prosecutions, deals with hackers and other recovery methods. The number of DeFi hacks in Q2 rose by almost 7 times year-over-year, with 117 incidents during the period, compared with only 17 in the same quarter of 2022. A total of over $665 million was lost during the first half of 2023.\par \par \uc2 Revolut US to delist \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , MATIC and \uc2 SOL\uc2  in September\par \par \uc2 Crypto-friendly neobank \uc2 Revolut\uc2  is next {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/revolut-us-to-delist-ada-matic-and-sol-in-september"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to delist a batch of digital assets}}}\uc2  on its platform in the United States amid the ongoing regulatory developments in the country, including the complete delist of tokens like Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Polygon (MATIC) and Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ). The firm, however, still supports the tokens in other jurisdictions outside the country. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , MATIC and \uc2 SOL\uc2  were labeled as unregistered securities by the SEC in early June.\par \par \uc2 Best Cointelegraph Features\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Meltem-Demirors-1024x682.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/09/26/5-years-reddits-top-10-cryptos-joe-greene"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/09/26/5-years-reddits-top-10-cryptos-joe-greene}}}\par \par \uc2 How smart people invest in dumb memecoins: 3-point plan for success\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/how-smart-people-invest-in-dumb-memecoins-3-point-plan-for-success/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 If you can make money out of it}}}\uc2 , then its a smart investment. Thats the playbook of smart investors making bank from dumb memecoins.\par \par \uc2 AI Eye: AI travel booking hilariously bad, 3 weird uses for ChatGPT, crypto plugins\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/ai-travel-booking-bad-3-weird-uses-chatgpt-crypto-plugins/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ChatGPT and Bard can help you book}}}\uc2  fictional hotels and awful 29-hour flights, 3 bizarre uses for AI, and do crypto plugins actually work?\par \par \uc2 NFT Collector: Snoops NFT nostalgia, The Goose draws Gen Y to Sothebys {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/ai-eye-is-ai-a-threat-why-ai-advance/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/ai-eye-is-ai-a-threat-why-ai-advance/}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/nft-collector-snoop-nft-passport-the-goose-millennials-sothebys/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Snoop Dogg\u8217\'20\'19s NFT passport is a blueprint}}}\uc2  for concert merch of the future, \uc2 Sotheby\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  NFT VP says. The Goose drew Millennials to auction house.\par \par \uc2 Subscribe The most engaging reads in blockchain. Delivered once a week.\par \par \uc2 Email address\par \par \uc2 SUBSCRIBE\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/reading-copy.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Subscribe to Magazine by Cointelegraph Newsletter.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/july1-scaled.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230702ej7100005\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , LTC, MATIC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,714 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins witnessed increased \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  but most have not broken above their respective resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) witnessed a volatile trading session on the last day of the quarter. The bulls were trying to maintain Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price above $31,000 but they received a jolt on a Wall Street Journal report which stated that the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-overreacting-sec-etf-filings-btc-price-dives-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 returned applications for the Bitcoin}}}\uc2  spot-price exchange-traded fund (ETF).\par \par \uc2 Although there was a knee-jerk reaction to the news, the downside was limited because it turned out that the ETF applications were returned due to a technical issue. The regulators said the asset managers {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-sec-deems-spot-bitcoin-etfs-filings-as-inadequate-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 could refile after providing the necessary clarifications}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/be8bd746-ea91-413b-ae4b-a9934a322b23.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s failure to cross above $31,000 seems to be making the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-send-35k-btc-exchanges-new-elation-inflow"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 short-term speculators jittery}}}\uc2 . A Glassnode research report released on June 28 shows that short-term holders (STHs), entities holding coins for 155 days or less, have sent more than 35,000 coins to the exchanges.\par \par \uc2 Any adverse news is likely to witness a negative reaction from SThs. What are the important support and resistance levels that need to be watched on Bitcoin and altcoins in the near term? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin continues its tight consolidation near the overhead resistance at $31,000. This shows that the bears are trying their level best to stall the up-move but the bulls have kept up the pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/cf3a2010-8ab5-415a-be77-c1e80de58b2f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Generally, a tight consolidation near an overhead resistance resolves to the upside. The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($28,982) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $31,000, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and start the next leg of its uptrend. There is a minor resistance at $32,400 but it is likely to be scaled. The pair could then dash toward $40,000.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below the 20-day EMA. The pair may then swing inside the large range between $31,000 and $24,800 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the moving averages on June 29, indicating that the lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/5945e4b3-6f89-4efe-842b-5331deb1dc92.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to propel the price above the overhead resistance at $1,937. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair may rise to the psychological level of $2,000. This level may again act as a minor barrier but it is likely to be crossed. The pair may then rally to $2,142.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from 1,937, it will suggest that bears are not willing to surrender. That will increase the likelihood of a drop below the moving averages. The pair may then slump to $1,700 and next to $1,600.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the support at $230 on June 28 but the long tail on the candlestick shows that the bulls aggressively purchased the dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/bd426be2-c068-45fb-9753-fff3c0f509a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($245) remains the key level for the bulls to cross. If they kick the price above it, the BNB/USDT pair could fly toward the overhead resistance zone between $257 and $265. Sellers are expected to mount a strong defense in this zone.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then make one more attempt to sink the pair below $220 and start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) fell close to the first support at $0.44 on June 28 and June 30 but the long tail on the candlesticks shows strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/1d2f7353-de5e-4739-894e-d52e0e185e13.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The $0.44 support is an important level to watch out for in the near term. If this level breaks down, the selling could pick up and the XRP/USDT pair may tumble to $0.41. This level may again attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.48) remains the key resistance for the bulls to scale. If buyers overcome this obstacle, it will enhance the prospects of a rally to the strong overhead resistance zone between $0.53 and $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $0.24 and $0.30 for the past few days. The long wick on the June 30 candlestick shows that the bears are fiercely defending the $0.30 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/92f0d7f1-27f6-4429-a8bd-71567f4fe02c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.28) could keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair stuck inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 A close above the 20-day EMA will be the first indication that the bears may be losing their grip. Buyers will then try to strengthen their position further by driving the price above the crucial overhead resistance at $0.30. If they do that, the pair may surge toward the 50-day SMA ($0.32).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the support at $0.06 on June 28, indicating that the bulls continue to defend the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/fbee31b0-5ca4-4008-8bf4-0a21bb84fe55.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.07) and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a range-bound action in the near term. The price may swing between $0.06 and $0.07 for a while longer. This neutral view will tilt in favor of the buyers if they thrust and sustain the price above the overhead resistance at $0.07. The DOGE/USDT pair may then climb to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, the bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the strong support of $0.06 to gain the upper hand. The pair may then fall to the vital support at $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke below the $16.18 support on June 28 but this proved to be a bear trap. The price turned up sharply on June 29 and skyrocketed above the 20-day EMA ($17.07) as the bears may have rushed to cover their short positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/1cf3b617-394c-4107-88a4-d9d06d5515e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buying continued on June 30 and the bulls are trying to drive the price above the breakdown level of $18.70. If they can pull it off, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair may shoot up to $22 and subsequently to $24.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to stop the relief rally at $18.70 and pull the price back below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then retest the crucial support zone between $16.18 and $15.28.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-approval-billion-dollar-sell-pressure"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why approving a Bitcoin ETF might unleash $18B in sell-pressure}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the moving averages on June 28 but the bears could not build upon this advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/01a2aa26-b8f5-49f7-b85f-10e61ae0f7a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip on June 29 and pushed the price back above the moving averages on June 30. This attracted aggressive buying by the bulls who drove the price above the downtrend line of the descending channel pattern. The price reached the crucial resistance at $106 but the bulls could not overcome this barrier.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level for the bears to defend because if this resistance crumbles, the LTC/USDT pair may jump to $135. The major support is at the downtrend line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to form a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close above $0.69.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/74dbd8bb-4f8f-4771-893d-265d7f44496e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.66) on June 30 but the long wick on the candlestick shows aggressive selling at higher levels. If the price dips below the uptrend line, the MATIC/USDT pair may slide toward $0.55.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises from the current level, it will signal strong buying near the uptrend line. A break and close above $0.69 could open the doors for a potential rally to the 50-day SMA and subsequently to $1.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sink Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($4.93) on June 28 and June 30 but the bulls held their ground. This suggests that dips are being bought.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/6a58ec49-0c6c-4c31-a310-a9d4f6d508af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to clear and sustain the overhead hurdle at $5.15. If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair rise to $5.56. This level may attract strong selling by the bears but on the way down, if bulls do not allow the price to slip below $5.15, the possibility of a rally to the downtrend line increases.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA remains the key level to watch out for because a break below it may open the doors for a collapse to the pivotal support at $4.22.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/8dcd4c5f-ba69-410c-91f8-b90c0d2ec519.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230702ej7100004\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/28: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , LTC, MATIC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,800 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 June 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Data suggests that Bitcoin and select altcoins could be getting ready for a breakout within the next few days.\par \par \uc2 A large part of the recent leg of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally started after \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  filed to list a spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund (ETF) on June 15. Several applications by other firms have been rejected by the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  in the past. However, \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s filing has a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-bitcoin-etf-grayscale-sec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 50% possibility of getting approved}}}\uc2 , said \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  senior ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Another \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  catalyst for the cryptocurrency markets could be a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bulls-grill-31k-fidelity-etf-btc-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filing by asset manager Fidelity Investments}}}\uc2  to launch its Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) spot ETF. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  chief strategy officer \uc2 Meltem Demirors\uc2  said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/27-trillion-ready-for-bitcoin-btc-coinshares-cso-meltem-demirors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 firms managing $27 trillion}}}\uc2  of assets are \u8220\'20\'1Cactively\u8221\'20\'1D pursuing efforts to allow their clients exposure in the crypto space.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/562214ae-a991-4044-8066-929847121d0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Most of the focus in recent days has been on institutional money, but the retail trader\u8217\'20\'19s power should not be underestimated. Fireblocks CEO and co-founder Michael Shaulov said in an interview with Cointelegraph that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-btc-price-surge-driven-retail-fireblocks-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 institutional entry may not boost prices}}}\uc2  higher because institutions are likely to do it in such a way as to avoid large price bursts. Shaulov said there was a significant inflow of institutional money in 2020, but the prices did not appreciate until retail investors entered.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and altcoins break out of their respective overhead resistance levels, or could they start a short-term correction? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to catapult Bitcoin above the overhead resistance of $31,000 on June 27, but the bears did not budge. This kept the price stuck inside the tight range between $31,000 and $29,500.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/d5be988a-aff8-40fa-84fa-9b22c50391dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to make an attempt to sink the price below $29,500, but if bulls protect this level, it will indicate strength. The rising 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $28,696 and the relative strength index (RSI) in positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above $31,000, the BTC/USDT pair may resume its uptrend. The bears may try to stall the up move at $32,400, but the buyers are likely to bulldoze their way through.\par \par \uc2 The first indication of weakness will be a close below $29,500. That may pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($28,696). If this level cracks, the pair may stay range-bound between $31,000 and $24,800.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) narrow range trading between $1,936 and $1,861 resolved to the downside on June 26. The bulls pushed the price back into the range on June 27 but could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/4e443d81-8c24-44a1-9a10-be308ffa23ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to sink the price below the moving averages. This remains the key level to watch out for in the near term because a break and close below it may open the gates for a potential decline to the strong support at $1,700.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will suggest that the bulls are fiercely defending the level. The bulls will then make one more attempt to overcome the barrier at $1,937. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the psychological level of $2,000 and then to $2,142.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has reached the first support at $230. This level has not been broken since June 13, hence the bulls will try to defend it aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/4c2061c6-5519-471a-b4b0-6a97499f4f8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a rise above the 20-day EMA ($247). That will indicate solid buying at lower levels. The BNB/USDT pair may then rise to the overhead resistance zone between $257 and $265.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price dumps below $230, the pair could fall to the vital support at $220. This remains the key level to keep an eye on in the near term because a break and close below it may start the next leg of the downtrend to $200.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) closed below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $0.48 on June 26, and the attempts by the bulls to push the price back above the level failed on June 27. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the 50-day SMA into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/3a7e1668-91f1-48fb-85fc-95a56d03f550.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.49) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that the bears have the upper hand. The XRP/USDT pair could first drop to $0.44 and next to the strong support at $0.41.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA. That could open the doors for a possible rally to $0.53 and then to $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to shove Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $0.30 may have resulted in profit booking.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/2ef58d8b-d8ac-4193-a8da-1f8665fe9f7e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.29) on June 26, increasing the likelihood of range-bound action between $0.24 and $0.30 for a few days. Trading inside a range could be random and volatile.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to kick and maintain the price above $0.30 to signal the start of a sustained recovery. The pair may first ascend to the 50-day SMA ($0.33) and later to $0.38. On the downside, a break and close below $0.24 may start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) tripped below the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on June 26, indicating that the bears are fiercely defending the overhead resistance of $0.07.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/acb94981-688e-41e4-a4d7-8dcbd8166d7c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price back above the 20-day EMA, but the bears held their ground. The DOGE/USDT pair may next tumble to the strong support at $0.06. A bounce off this level will indicate that the pair may oscillate between $0.06 and $0.07 for a while.\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint also signal a possible consolidation in the near term. Buyers will have to overcome the barrier at $0.07 to start the next leg of the up move to $0.08 and then to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($16.84) on June 26 and fell to the immediate support at $16.18. The bulls guarded the level on June 27, but they could not thrust the price above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/6019e16d-90c1-4a4f-a588-6535949ed759.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 After the tight range trading of the past few days, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair is ripe for a range expansion. If the price plummets and sustains below $16.18, the pair may slide to $15.28 and thereafter to $14.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. The pair may pick up momentum after the price rises above $17.75. The next stop is likely to be the breakdown level of $18.70.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-price-2k-futures-market-data-not-soon"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum price won\u8217\'20\'19t see $2K anytime soon, market data suggests}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls managed to keep \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages for the past few days, but they could not start a rebound. This may tempt the bears to seize control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/55d48757-5f72-41c2-846d-8bc12876d378.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price dips below the moving averages, the LTC/USDT pair could drop to $80 and then to $76. That may keep the pair stuck inside the descending channel pattern for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to maintain their hold, they will have to quickly propel the price above the resistance line of the channel. The pair may then start an up move, which could reach the overhead resistance at $105. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) traded in a narrow range near the overhead resistance of $0.69 for the past few days, but the bulls failed to push the price above it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/49325bbc-5905-47c3-b126-fc0acac347c3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to clear the overhead hurdle may tempt the aggressive bears to sell. The gradually downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.67) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that the bears have a minor advantage. Sellers will try to sink the price to the strong support zone between $0.56 and $0.51.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to gain the upper hand, they will have to drive and sustain the price above $0.69. The MATIC/USDT pair may then climb to the 50-day SMA ($0.78).\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the breakdown level of $5.15 for the past five days. Although the bears successfully defended the level, a positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($4.91).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/737dabf9-d573-48dd-b1e2-f1c70ede1c9d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the bulls have a slight edge. If buyers drive the price above $5.25, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to the next resistance at $5.56.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. The pair may then remain range-bound between $5.15 and $4.22 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/f5bed91c-cdec-40a1-b103-b0ead6c3e55c.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230629ej6s00009\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/28: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , LTC, MATIC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,800 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 June 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Data suggests that Bitcoin and select altcoins could be getting ready for a breakout within the next few days.\par \par \uc2 A large part of the recent leg of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'