ice-surge-driven-retail-fireblocks-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 institutional entry may not boost prices}}}\uc2  higher because they are likely to do it in such a way as to avoid large price bursts. Shaulov said there was a significant inflow of institutional money in 2020 but the prices did not appreciate until retail investors entered.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and altcoins break out of their respective overhead resistance levels or could they start a short-term correction? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to catapult Bitcoin above the overhead resistance of $31,000 on June 27 but the bears did not budge. This keeps the price stuck inside the tight range between $31,000 and $29,500.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/d5be988a-aff8-40fa-84fa-9b22c50391dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to make an attempt to sink the price below $29,500 but if bulls protect this level, it will indicate strength. The rising 20-day exponential moving average ($28,696) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above $31,000, the BTC/USDT pair may resume its uptrend. The bears may try to stall the up-move at $32,400 but the buyers are likely to bulldoze their way through.\par \par \uc2 The first indication of weakness will be a close below $29,500. That may pull the price to the 20-day exponential moving average ($28,696). If this level cracks, the pair may stay range-bound between $31,000 and $24,800.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) narrow range trading between $1,936 and $1,861 resolved to the downside on June 26. The bulls pushed the price back into the range on June 27 but could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/4e443d81-8c24-44a1-9a10-be308ffa23ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to sink the price below the moving averages. This remains the key level to watch out for in the near term because a break and close below it may open the gates for a potential decline to the strong support at $1,700.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will suggest that the bulls are fiercely defending the level. The bulls will then make one more attempt to overcome the barrier at $1,937. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the psychological level of $2,000 and then to $2,142.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has reached the first support at $230. This level has not been broken since June 13, hence the bulls will try to defend it aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/4c2061c6-5519-471a-b4b0-6a97499f4f8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a rise above the 20-day EMA ($247). That will indicate solid buying at lower levels. The BNB/USDT pair may then rise to the overhead resistance zone between $257 and $265.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price dumps below $230, the pair could fall to the vital support at $220. This remains the key level to keep an eye on in the near term because a break and close below it may start the next leg of the downtrend to $200.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) closed below the 50-day simple moving average ($0.48) on June 26 and the attempts by the bulls to push the price back above the level failed on June 27. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the 50-day SMA into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/3a7e1668-91f1-48fb-85fc-95a56d03f550.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.49) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that the bears have the upper hand. The XRP/USDT pair could first drop to $0.44 and next to the strong support at $0.41.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA. That could open the doors for a possible rally to $0.53 and then to $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to shove Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $0.30 may have resulted in profit booking.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/2ef58d8b-d8ac-4193-a8da-1f8665fe9f7e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.29) on June 26, increasing the likelihood of a range-bound action between $0.24 and $0.30 for a few days. Trading inside a range could be random and volatile.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to kick and maintain the price above $0.30 to signal the start of a sustained recovery. The pair may first ascend to the 50-day SMA ($0.33) and later to $0.38. On the downside, a break and close below $0.24 may start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) tripped below the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on June 26, indicating that the bears are fiercely defending the overhead resistance of $0.07.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/acb94981-688e-41e4-a4d7-8dcbd8166d7c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price back above the 20-day EMA but the bears held their ground. The DOGE/USDT pair may next tumble to the strong support at $0.06. A bounce off this level will indicate that the pair may oscillate between $0.06 and $0.07 for a while.\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint also signal a possible consolidation in the near term. Buyers will have to overcome the barrier at $0.07 to start the next leg of the up-move to $0.08 and then to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($16.84) on June 26 and fell to the immediate support at $16.18. The bulls guarded the level on June 27 but they could not thrust the price above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/6019e16d-90c1-4a4f-a588-6535949ed759.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 After the tight range trading of the past few days, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair is ripe for a range expansion. If the price plummets and sustains below $16.18, the pair may slide to $15.28 and thereafter to $14.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. The pair may pick up momentum after the price rises above $17.75. The next stop is likely to be the breakdown level of $18.70.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-price-2k-futures-market-data-not-soon"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum price won\u8217\'20\'19t see $2K anytime soon, market data suggests}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls managed to keep \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages for the past few days but they could not start a rebound. This may tempt the bears to seize control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/55d48757-5f72-41c2-846d-8bc12876d378.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price dips below the moving averages, the LTC/USDT pair could drop to $80 and then to $76. That may keep the pair stuck inside the descending channel pattern for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to maintain their hold, they will have to quickly propel the price above the resistance line of the channel. The pair may then start an up-move, which could reach the overhead resistance at $105. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) traded in a narrow range near the overhead resistance of $0.69 for the past few days but the bulls failed to push the price above it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/49325bbc-5905-47c3-b126-fc0acac347c3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to clear the overhead hurdle may tempt the aggressive bears to sell. The gradually downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.67) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that the bears have a minor advantage. Sellers will try to sink the price to the strong support zone between $0.56 and $0.51.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to gain the upper hand, they will have to drive and sustain the price above $0.69. The MATIC/USDT pair may then climb to the 50-day SMA ($0.78).\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the breakdown level of $5.15 for the past five days. Although the bears successfully defended the level, a positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($4.91).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/737dabf9-d573-48dd-b1e2-f1c70ede1c9d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the bulls have a slight edge. If buyers drive the price above $5.25, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to the next resistance at $5.56.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. The pair may then remain range-bound between $5.15 and $4.22 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/f5bed91c-cdec-40a1-b103-b0ead6c3e55c.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230628ej6s000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,831 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 June 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's recent gains and the steady inflow of BTC ETF applications could be another sign that the bear market is coming to an end.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) snapped a five-week winning streak last week, but it is still on track to close the first half of the year with stellar gains of nearly 13%. The tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite has done much better, as it is up {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/06/25/stock-market-today-live-updates.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 about}}}\uc2  29%. Both these indexes have been overtaken by Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), which has risen nearly 83% year-to-date.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price action and the recent rush by several firms to apply for a Bitcoin spot exchange-traded fund seem to have attracted institutional investors\u8217\'20\'19 attention. \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  senior ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2  highlighted on June 26 that the \uc2 ProShares Bitcoin Strategy ETF\uc2  (BITO) \u8212\'20\'14 a Bitcoin futures fund \u8212\'20\'14 witnessed its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/proshares-bitcoin-etf-bito-weekly-inflows-largest-in-year"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 largest weekly inflow in a year}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/076cf922-72e7-4bdd-b008-0110dbba957b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Another \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view was that of LookIntoBitcoin founder Philip Swift, who said in his latest research that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s RHODL ratio metric is showing that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s supply has started to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-up-fundamentals-down-5-things-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 move from long-term holders to speculative investors}}}\uc2 , indicating increasing mainstream trading interest.\par \par \uc2 Could the entry of speculators boost prices further or is it a sign that the markets are overheated in the near term and may correct? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out the next possible move.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index turned down from 4,448 on June 16, indicating that the short-term bulls are booking profits. That has pulled the price to the breakout level near 4,325. The 20-day exponential moving average (4,314) is placed just below this level, hence the bulls are likely to defend it aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/8983bfbe-9824-43c7-8a21-f4d309c8154c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity. The bulls will then try to propel the price above 4,448 and resume the uptrend. If they succeed, the index could attempt a rally to 4,650. There is a minor resistance at 4,500 but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below the 20-day EMA. The index could then start a deeper correction to the 50-day simple moving average (4,206).\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index plunged below the 50-day SMA (102.68) on June 15 but the bears could not build upon this strength. The bulls are trying to form a higher low near 102.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/3ee69c49-707f-4dff-8428-329716315a8f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed the price above the moving averages on June 23 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that bears are selling at higher levels. The 20-day EMA (102.92) is flattening out and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the price closes above the 20-day EMA, the index could rise to the downtrend line. The bears are expected to defend this level with all their might. The important level to watch on the downside is 102. A break and close below this support could sink the index to 100.82.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are aggressively defending the $31,000 level but the bulls are not allowing the price to sustain below $30,000. This suggests that lower levels are being bought.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/41202d79-44a9-4dea-9ac6-aa6cd2ea94f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A tight consolidation near the overhead resistance of $31,000 shows that the bulls are in no mood to book profits as they expect the up-move to extend further. The rising 20-day EMA ($28,288) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought zone indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If bulls propel the BTC/USDT pair above the $31,000 to $31,500 resistance zone, it will signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. There is a minor resistance at $32,400 but it may not hold the price for long. A rally above this resistance could clear the path for a dash to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range between $1,936 and $1,861 for the past few days. This suggests indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/9eadade2-a15d-4f81-9e89-3d61e6c28d51.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($1,822) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls have the upper hand. If buyers kick the price above $1,936, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to the psychologically important level of $2,000. This level may act as a hurdle but it is likely to be crossed. The pair may then soar toward $2,200.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to tug the price below the support at $1,861. The pair may then slip to the moving averages, which is an important level to keep an eye on. If this level cracks, the pair may again descend toward $1,700.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the strong support at $230 on June 24, indicating that the bulls are trying to arrest the decline at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/19cea16c-4508-42b7-891e-ae5e26baa403.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($250) to indicate strength. The BNB/USDT pair may then rise to the breakdown level of $265. If the price turns down sharply from this level, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. That could keep the pair range-bound between $265 and $220 for a while.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and breaks below $230, it will suggest that bears are in control. They will then try to drag the price below the vital support at $220 and start the next leg of the downtrend. The next support is at $200.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.49) for the past few days but the bears did not relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/04874a13-dffe-4de9-9a61-4d38aa2147cb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to sink the price below the strong support at the 50-day SMA ($0.48). If they do that, the XRP/USDT pair could slump to $0.44 and then to $0.41. The gradually downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI near 45 indicate that bears have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the 20-day EMA remains the key level to keep an eye on. Buyers will have to thrust and sustain the price above this level to gain strength. The pair could then attempt a rally to $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are finding it difficult to sustain Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the breakdown level of $0.30, which suggests that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/8890d528-79f3-4df1-a6da-96938d6ec523.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair has been trading in a narrow range near the overhead resistance. This indicates uncertainty between the bulls and the bears. If the price turns down and breaks below $0.28, it will point to a range-bound action between $0.24 and $0.30 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls shove and sustain the price above $0.30, it will signal the start of a stronger recovery to the 50-day SMA ($0.33). This level may again act as a strong hurdle but if crossed, the pair may reach $0.38.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-surfs-30k-us-trading-boost-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin surfs $30K as traders hope US trading will boost BTC price}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance of $0.07 on June 23, indicating that the bears are defending the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/a129859f-7e19-48ae-8004-d6905b93ce0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.07) has flattened out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a state of equilibrium between buyers and sellers. If the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the DOGE/USDT pair may consolidate between $0.06 and $0.07 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a rally above the resistance at $0.07. Buyers will then try to extend the recovery to $0.08. On the downside, a break and close below $0.06 could start a deeper correction to $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The relief rally in Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is facing strong resistance at the 20-day EMA ($17), indicating that the bears have not given up and they continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/9c785554-8ef1-469f-ac0a-c09be210b1db.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will have to sink the price below the immediate support of $16.18 to be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair may then retest the important support zone between $15.28 and $14.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $17.75, it will suggest that bulls have a slight edge. The pair could then rise to the breakdown level of $18.70. The 50-day SMA ($18.82) is placed just above this level hence the bears are expected to defend it fiercely.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the resistance line of the descending channel on June 24 and reached the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/e3fd8480-b591-40dc-9d1b-b746633f86fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the June 24-26 candlestick shows that the bulls are buying the dips to the 50-day SMA ($85). Buyers will try to push the price to the resistance line of the channel which remains the important resistance to watch out for. If bulls overcome this obstacle, the LTC/USDT pair could start an up-move toward $105.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price continues lower and plunges below the moving averages, it will suggest that bears have the upper hand. The pair could then tumble to $76 and later to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/4b5f46e3-6764-4790-8a6e-6ff7d8c016d2.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230627ej6q0005r\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,831 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 June 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's recent gains and the steady inflow of BTC ETF applications could be another sign that the bear market is coming to an end.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) snapped a five-week winning streak last week but it is still on track to close the first half of the year with stellar gains of nearly 13%. The tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite has done much better, as it is up {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/06/25/stock-market-today-live-updates.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 about}}}\uc2  29%. Both these indexes have been overtaken by Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), which has risen nearly 83% year-to-date.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price action and the recent rush by several firms to apply for a Bitcoin spot exchange-traded fund seem to have attracted institutional investors\u8217\'20\'19 attention. \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  senior ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2  highlighted on June 26 that the \uc2 ProShares Bitcoin Strategy ETF\uc2  (BITO) \u8212\'20\'14 a Bitcoin futures fund \u8212\'20\'14 witnessed its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/proshares-bitcoin-etf-bito-weekly-inflows-largest-in-year"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 largest weekly inflow in a year}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/076cf922-72e7-4bdd-b008-0110dbba957b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Another \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view was that of LookIntoBitcoin founder Philip Swift, who said in his latest research that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s RHODL ratio metric is showing that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s supply has started to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-up-fundamentals-down-5-things-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 move from long-term holders to speculative investors}}}\uc2 , indicating increasing mainstream trading interest.\par \par \uc2 Could the entry of speculators boost prices further or is it a sign that the markets are overheated in the near term and may correct? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out the next possible move.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index turned down from 4,448 on June 16, indicating that the short-term bulls are booking profits. That has pulled the price to the breakout level near 4,325. The 20-day exponential moving average (4,314) is placed just below this level, hence the bulls are likely to defend it aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/8983bfbe-9824-43c7-8a21-f4d309c8154c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity. The bulls will then try to propel the price above 4,448 and resume the uptrend. If they succeed, the index could attempt a rally to 4,650. There is a minor resistance at 4,500 but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below the 20-day EMA. The index could then start a deeper correction to the 50-day simple moving average (4,206).\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index plunged below the 50-day SMA (102.68) on June 15 but the bears could not build upon this strength. The bulls are trying to form a higher low near 102.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/3ee69c49-707f-4dff-8428-329716315a8f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed the price above the moving averages on June 23 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that bears are selling at higher levels. The 20-day EMA (102.92) is flattening out and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the price closes above the 20-day EMA, the index could rise to the downtrend line. The bears are expected to defend this level with all their might. The important level to watch on the downside is 102. A break and close below this support could sink the index to 100.82.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are aggressively defending the $31,000 level but the bulls are not allowing the price to sustain below $30,000. This suggests that lower levels are being bought.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/41202d79-44a9-4dea-9ac6-aa6cd2ea94f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A tight consolidation near the overhead resistance of $31,000 shows that the bulls are in no mood to book profits as they expect the up-move to extend further. The rising 20-day EMA ($28,288) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought zone indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If bulls propel the BTC/USDT pair above the $31,000 to $31,500 resistance zone, it will signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. There is a minor resistance at $32,400 but it may not hold the price for long. A rally above this resistance could clear the path for a dash to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range between $1,936 and $1,861 for the past few days. This suggests indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/9eadade2-a15d-4f81-9e89-3d61e6c28d51.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($1,822) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls have the upper hand. If buyers kick the price above $1,936, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to the psychologically important level of $2,000. This level may act as a hurdle but it is likely to be crossed. The pair may then soar toward $2,200.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to tug the price below the support at $1,861. The pair may then slip to the moving averages, which is an important level to keep an eye on. If this level cracks, the pair may again descend toward $1,700.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the strong support at $230 on June 24, indicating that the bulls are trying to arrest the decline at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/19cea16c-4508-42b7-891e-ae5e26baa403.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($250) to indicate strength. The BNB/USDT pair may then rise to the breakdown level of $265. If the price turns down sharply from this level, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. That could keep the pair range-bound between $265 and $220 for a while.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and breaks below $230, it will suggest that bears are in control. They will then try to drag the price below the vital support at $220 and start the next leg of the downtrend. The next support is at $200.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.49) for the past few days but the bears did not relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/04874a13-dffe-4de9-9a61-4d38aa2147cb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to sink the price below the strong support at the 50-day SMA ($0.48). If they do that, the XRP/USDT pair could slump to $0.44 and then to $0.41. The gradually downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI near 45 indicate that bears have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the 20-day EMA remains the key level to keep an eye on. Buyers will have to thrust and sustain the price above this level to gain strength. The pair could then attempt a rally to $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are finding it difficult to sustain Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the breakdown level of $0.30, which suggests that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/8890d528-79f3-4df1-a6da-96938d6ec523.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair has been trading in a narrow range near the overhead resistance. This indicates uncertainty between the bulls and the bears. If the price turns down and breaks below $0.28, it will point to a range-bound action between $0.24 and $0.30 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls shove and sustain the price above $0.30, it will signal the start of a stronger recovery to the 50-day SMA ($0.33). This level may again act as a strong hurdle but if crossed, the pair may reach $0.38.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-surfs-30k-us-trading-boost-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin surfs $30K as traders hope US trading will boost BTC price}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance of $0.07 on June 23, indicating that the bears are defending the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/a129859f-7e19-48ae-8004-d6905b93ce0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.07) has flattened out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a state of equilibrium between buyers and sellers. If the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the DOGE/USDT pair may consolidate between $0.06 and $0.07 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a rally above the resistance at $0.07. Buyers will then try to extend the recovery to $0.08. On the downside, a break and close below $0.06 could start a deeper correction to $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The relief rally in Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is facing strong resistance at the 20-day EMA ($17), indicating that the bears have not given up and they continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/9c785554-8ef1-469f-ac0a-c09be210b1db.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will have to sink the price below the immediate support of $16.18 to be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair may then retest the important support zone between $15.28 and $14.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $17.75, it will suggest that bulls have a slight edge. The pair could then rise to the breakdown level of $18.70. The 50-day SMA ($18.82) is placed just above this level hence the bears are expected to defend it fiercely.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the resistance line of the descending channel on June 24 and reached the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/e3fd8480-b591-40dc-9d1b-b746633f86fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the June 24-26 candlestick shows that the bulls are buying the dips to the 50-day SMA ($85). Buyers will try to push the price to the resistance line of the channel which remains the important resistance to watch out for. If bulls overcome this obstacle, the LTC/USDT pair could start an up-move toward $105.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price continues lower and plunges below the moving averages, it will suggest that bears have the upper hand. The pair could then tumble to $76 and later to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/4b5f46e3-6764-4790-8a6e-6ff7d8c016d2.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230627ej6q0000a\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , MATIC, LTC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,742 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 June 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The markets\u8217\'20\'19 momentum favors Bitcoin bulls, increasing the likelihood of a breakout to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 The rush to apply for a spot Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded fund (ETF) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/valkyrie-submits-btc-spot-etf-application-to-go-with-its-futures-miners-etfs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rejuvenated the bulls}}}\uc2 , but this news is likely to boost the price only to a certain distance. As the price moves up, the risks of a crash increase if none of the ETF applications are approved. Trading firm QCP Capital, for example, is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-bitcoin-spot-etf-unlikely-near-term"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 not convinced that a spot ETF}}}\uc2  will see the light of day in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Another point of view came from \uc2 Gemini\uc2  co-founder \uc2 Cameron Winklevoss\uc2 , who said on June 21 that the \u8220\'20\'1Cfloodgates\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/great-accumulation-bitcoin-begun-gemini-cofounder-winklevoss"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 for accumulating Bitcoin}}}\uc2  are \u8220\'20\'1Cclosing fast.\u8221\'20\'1D Similarly, \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  executive chairman \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  said that the opportunity to \u8220\'20\'1Cfront-run institutional demand for Bitcoin\u8221\'20\'1D was ending.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/6a4cfbf7-a775-400c-85b8-dcdb9fb960cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin remains the center of attraction as its market dominance hovers near 50%. K33 Research analysis found that over the long term, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-only-buy-and-hold-investment-strategy-outperforms-altcoins-over-the-long-term-analysis-shows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin investment has far outperformed an altcoin portfolio}}}\uc2  by a huge margin. Altcoins had their share of short-term outperformance in 2017 and again in 2021, but that could not sustain in the long term.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and the altcoins rise above their respective overhead resistance levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is facing resistance at the overhead resistance of $31,000, but the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears. This enhances the prospects of a break above $31,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/5e17dca7-3e51-45e3-bd67-239394e6c0d7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty of the June 22 Doji candlestick pattern resolved to the upside on June 23. Buyers will again try to sustain the price above $31,000. If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could first rise to $32,400 and thereafter make a dash toward the next major resistance at $40,000.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average, or EMA ($27,561), has turned up and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the overbought zone, indicating that bulls are in control. This view will be negated in the near term if the price sustains below $28,500. The pair could then enter a range-bound action between $31,000 and $24,800.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to resume its up-move. The bulls pushed the price above the overhead resistance of $1,928 on June 22 but could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/d92e416f-7c11-4a25-b7e0-a488b5e35255.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the intraday dips and have again sent the price to the overhead resistance at $1,928. If this level is scaled, it will suggest that lower levels are attracting buyers. That could enhance the prospect of a rally to $2,000 and then to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price once again turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears are selling on rallies near $2,000. The ETH/USDT pair could then decline to 20-day EMA ($1,804).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($255) on June 22, indicating that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/4b26161c-12b6-470e-9dcc-b3b4323d5683.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to the first support at $230 and then to the vital support at $220. Sellers will have to tug the price below the support zone to signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers drive the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. The BNB/USDT pair could then surge to the breakdown level of $265 and subsequently to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $272.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) recovery picked up momentum on June 22, and the bulls kicked the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.49). However, the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that the bears are unlikely to give up easily.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/20a134c2-299d-4072-a572-6a46be0caa99.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. That could keep the XRP/USDT pair between the 50-day SMA ($0.47) and the overhead resistance of $0.56 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move could start after the bulls overcome the obstacle at $0.56 or the bears sink the price below $0.46. Until then, random range-bound price action is likely to continue.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) long wick on the June 22 candlestick suggests that the bears are selling the rallies to this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/8eac7f03-5cf5-43e1-b492-07ae52e20a33.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 But the bulls are in no mood to give up. They are again trying to thrust the price above the breakdown level of $0.30. If they can pull it off, it will suggest the start of a stronger recovery to the 50-day SMA ($0.34). The bears will again try to check the relief rally at this level.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down sharply from the overhead resistance. Such a move would enhance the prospects of consolidation between $0.24 and $0.30. The bears will have to yank the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below $0.24 to start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply from the overhead resistance of $0.07 on June 22, indicating that the bears are guarding the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/c54035aa-e98d-4d79-a6ff-cbbdea3d0d94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.06). If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could again rise to $0.07. A break and close above this level will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The pair may then climb to $0.08, which may prove to be a tough barrier to cross.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is the key support for the bulls to protect. If this level gives way, it will suggest that the pair may swing between $0.06 and $0.07 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($17) on June 21, but they could not sustain the higher levels. Sellers pulled the price back below the level on June 22.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/d0af912c-a35d-4dd9-9ecd-ab91f782ca66.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The immediate support to watch for on the downside is $16.18. If the price remains above this level, the likelihood of a break above the 20-day EMA increases. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could then rally to $18.70.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down and breaks below $16.18, it will signal that the bulls have given up and are bailing out of their positions. That could risk a retest of the crucial support zone between $15.28 and $14.06.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-volatility-break-31k-btc-price-yearly-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  takes a break as $31K BTC price yearly highs loom}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the breakdown level of $0.69 on June 22, but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears are trying to protect the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/c6d70e1e-c386-45e9-9975-035a92206e1e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to drift much lower from the overhead resistance. This suggests that the bulls are hanging on to their positions in expectation of a move higher.\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel and sustain the price above $0.69, it may start a stronger recovery to the 50-day SMA ($0.80). This level may again act as a hurdle, but if cleared, the MATIC/USDT pair may soar to $1.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and dips below $0.62, it will suggest that the pair may oscillate between $0.69 and $0.50 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to make a comeback on June 21 and 22 by defending the 50-day SMA ($85), but the bulls kept up the buying pressure on \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/bf77d75c-5d6a-43b4-87e7-56aa7a450ee3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($82) has started to turn up, and the RSI has jumped into positive territory, indicating that the bulls are in command. There is a minor resistance at $92, but if that is crossed, the LTC/USDT pair may rally to the zone between $96 and the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to halt the upward march, they will have to quickly pull the price back below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the pair may slide to $75.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) June 21 and 22 candlestick shows that the bears tried to halt the recovery, but the bulls were in the mood to relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/f2a01c15-d83b-4f3b-ac4b-fbf620695a23.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($4.80) shows that the bulls are trying to flip this level into support. Buyers pushed the price to the breakdown level of $5.15, where the bears may again mount a strong defense. If bulls overcome this hurdle, the DOT/USDT pair could rise to $5.56 and then to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from $5.15 and slips below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. That could keep the pair range-bound between $5.15 and $4.22 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/c58a99df-748c-48c4-a822-c080fd06ca92.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230623ej6n000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/21: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, MATIC, LTC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,768 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 June 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sharp rally has ignited buying in several altcoins, which are also trying to break above their respective resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s application for a spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund (ETF) has encouraged other financial firms to follow suit. First, it was the New York-based asset management fund \uc2 WisdomTree\uc2 , which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-spot-bitcoin-etf-new-sec-filings-wisdomtree-invesco"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 made a new filing on June 21}}}\uc2  for a Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) ETF. This was then followed by investment manager Invesco, which reactivated its application for a spot ETF.\par \par \uc2 These announcements boosted \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2 , resulting in a short squeeze and additional buying interest from traders who may have been waiting on the sidelines. The slew of events over the past few days has increased buying interest in Bitcoin, which sent its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-btc-reach-50-percent-market-dominance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market dominance to above 50%}}}\uc2  on June 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/f52c73d5-b954-4246-87c1-b5c4388e50d2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 The short-term traders who are expecting a quick rally to the all-time highs may be in for a shock. In the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-boredom-18-months-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 latest edition of its weekly newsletter}}}\uc2 , \u8220\'20\'1CThe Week On-Chain,\u8221\'20\'1D analytics firm Glassnode warned investors that their patience could be tested for another eight to 18 months before the market hits a new all-time high.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally continue to rise for a few more days, or is it time to book profits? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke and closed above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $26,934 on June 17. The bears tried to sink the price back below the level on June 18, but the bulls held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/c30c36d6-ecbf-49cb-9650-0f1c8f5d0593.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 That attracted aggressive buying on June 19, which picked up further momentum on June 20. That catapulted the price above the resistance line of the descending channel pattern, signaling a short-term trend change. This move may have hit the stops of several short-term bears, resulting in a short squeeze. That sent the price skyrocketing to $30,800 on June 21.\par \par \uc2 The bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to halt the rally at $31,000, but if the bulls do not give up much ground from the current level, it will enhance the prospects of a rally above the overhead resistance. If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair may surge to $32,400. The bears are expected to defend this level with all their might because if they fail to do that, the pair may surge to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to trap the bulls, they will have to yank the price back below the moving averages. That could result in a long liquidation and threaten the $25,250 support.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the strong support of $1,700 on June 19, signaling strong buying at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/79bed623-892d-46a0-a3d5-fd5f7bbd0723.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued their purchases and pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($1,781) on June 20. This was the first sign that the bears were losing their grip. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum picked up further on June 21 and sent the ETH/USDT pair above the downtrend line. The pair is expected to rally to the psychological resistance at $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price reverses direction from the current level and slips below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears remain in control. The pair could then dip to $1,700.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The wick on BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) June 21 candlestick shows that the bears are selling the relief rallies to the 20-day EMA ($257).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/46725b7d-a10a-4fad-b95a-e202c43249cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory indicate that bears have an edge. If the price turns down from the current level, the BNB/USDT pair may slide to $230 and later retest the vital support at $220.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls overcome the obstacle at the 20-day EMA, it will suggest solid demand at lower levels. The pair could then attempt a rally to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $272 and subsequently to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $290.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply from the 20-day EMA ($0.49) on June 20 and slipped below the 50-day SMA ($0.47), but the long tail on the candlestick shows aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/62d8fd70-c3c5-4fd6-8437-ef9dd01c1174.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If bulls sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, it could open the doors for a potential rally to the overhead resistance at $0.56. This level may again act as a strong barrier.\par \par \uc2 The 50-day SMA remains the key support to watch out for on the downside. If this level is breached, the advantage will tilt in favor of the bears. The XRP/USDT pair could then plummet to $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) June 20 candlestick shows that the bulls are trying to guard the zone between $0.25 and $0.24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/e59fa1f5-ee56-43c1-afea-9cc1ec8d5b38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could reach the $0.30 level, which is likely to behave as a formidable resistance. If the price turns down sharply from this level, the pair may consolidate between $0.30 and $0.24 for a while.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls kick the price above $0.30, it will suggest the start of a sustained recovery to the 50-day SMA ($0.34). The support on the downside is at $0.25 and then at $0.22.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the strong support at $0.06 on June 20, indicating that the bulls are fiercely defending this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/823abf04-14d9-4ad8-b9e2-b2f6121c3a3d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair has risen above the 20-day EMA ($0.06), suggesting that the bears may be losing their grip. The pair may next rally to $0.07. If the price turns down sharply from this level, it will signal that the pair may stay range-bound between $0.06 and $0.07 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to clear the hurdle at $0.07 to indicate strength. The pair may then climb to $0.08, where the bears may again mount a strong defense. On the downside, a tumble below $0.06 will indicate an advantage to bears.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rose above the immediate resistance of $16.18 on June 20 and reached the 20-day EMA ($17.04) on June 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/b77f60b1-e4c0-4d9e-b2c3-0ac75992c8f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level and slips below $16.18, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The SOL/USDT pair may then again retest the critical support zone between $15.28 and $14.06.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the break below $15.28 may have been a bear trap. That could cause a short squeeze, propelling the pair to the 50-day SMA ($19.34).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-ethereum-market-cap-dominance-is-rising"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3 reasons why Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s market cap dominance is on the rise}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) is gradually rising toward the breakdown level of $0.69. The 20-day EMA ($0.69) is also placed at this level; hence, the bears are expected to defend this resistance with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/089f8253-8c02-44c4-b38f-ddf656ee5a9f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate a minor advantage to the bears. If the price turns down from $0.69, the MATIC/USDT pair could remain stuck between $0.69 and $0.50 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest strong buying at lower levels. The pair may then rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.82). The crucial support to watch for on the downside is $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) rebounded sharply off the strong support at $75 on June 20, indicating that the bulls are aggressively buying the dips to this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/e126a0cb-5ba7-4b59-9bd0-d22bd0a5a70a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buying continued on June 21, and the bulls propelled the price above the 20-day EMA ($81), signaling a comeback. There is a minor resistance at the 50-day SMA ($85), but it is likely to be crossed. The LTC/USDT pair may first hit $92 and then $98.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to reestablish control, they will have to quickly tug the price back below the $75 to $71 support zone. Until that happens, the bulls are likely to view the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) toward the $4.22 support on June 20, but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/d620073f-095e-4d6e-9117-55db10f884d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers have pushed the price to the 20-day EMA ($4.76), which is likely to act as a strong resistance. If bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the DOT/USDT pair could reach the breakdown level of $5.15.\par \par \uc2 This level is again likely to pose a strong challenge to the bulls. If the price turns down from this level, the pair may oscillate between $5.15 and $4.22 for some time. The bears will have to yank the price below $4.22 to start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/b3dddf74-f274-43e8-99c3-7d6d936e4463.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230621ej6l000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Why is the crypto market up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Kyle White \par \uc2 779 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 June 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin, Ethereum and altcoins rallied after institutional interest from \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 , \uc2 Fidelity\uc2  and other large fund managers sparked optimism and a wave of short liquidations.\par \par \uc2 The crypto market is up today as Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and numerous altcoins rallied after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-spot-bitcoin-etf-new-sec-filings-wisdomtree-invesco"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 multiple large institutions}}}\uc2  followed \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  and filed for Bitcoin ETFs in the United States.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-taps-30-k-first-time-since-april"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 price reached $30,000}}}\uc2  for the first time since April 18 while also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-up-36-after-china-warned-btc-zero"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cementing a 36% year-over-year}}}\uc2  gain since China warned BTC was heading to zero in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/china-warns-bitcoin-is-heading-to-zero-but-boe-looks-on-the-bright-side"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 2022}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The rally fueled a wave of short liquidations across the market, totaling over $173 million in 24-hours on June 21. The rise in crypto prices is helping to narrow the appreciation {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fed-rate-pause-triggers-traders-pivot-to-stocks-will-bitcoin-catch-up"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gap between equities}}}\uc2  and the cryptocurrency market which widened after the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  paused interest rate hikes.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/6d69b2e9-5963-4508-8213-5ddc42759bdd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total crypto liquidations in 1-day. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Despite the strength of today\u8217\'20\'19s rally, its longevity remains under question as investors {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-sec-lawsuit-could-dent-crypto-exchange-s-global-plans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 anticipate further \b  \highlight22regulation\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  from the United States Security and Exchange Commission. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bipartisan-support-crypto-regulation-attractive-to-firms-moodys"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lack of bipartisan support}}}\uc2  on crypto \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  makes it unlikely that any significant legislation will pass the \uc2 U.S. Congress\uc2 , meaning many cryptocurrencies may be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trading-crypto-as-non-securities-over-says-exchange-ex"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 classified as securities}}}\uc2  by the SEC.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/bitcoin-miami-2023-shitcoins-for-bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin 2023 in Miami comes to grips with \u8216\'20\'18shitcoins on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s examine three of the major factors influencing the day\u8217\'20\'19s crypto market strength.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  buzz\par \par \uc2 Speculations around the potential for the first \uc2 Bitcoin \b \highlight22\uc2 ETF\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2  approval\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the U.S. helped the crypto market price to bounce. The speculation skyrocketed after the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest asset manager, \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  filed a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-apply-spot-bitcoin-etf-sec-nasdaq"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin spot ETF}}}\uc2  with the SEC on June 16.\par \par \uc2 Notably, \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 , an investment firm managing $9.5 trillion in assets, has applied for 576 ETFs, facing only one rejection. Market analyst Lark Davis predicts an SEC approval could have the asset manager purchase every single Bitcoin available across crypto exchanges. Davis made the statement in the filing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TheCryptoLark/status/1669751744182779904"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noting}}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 "Only about 10% of all Bitcoin [worth $50 billion] is sitting on exchanges. 0.5% of \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  money movings to BTC would buy every single coin available."\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, the SEC has rejected all \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  applications, including those from asset managers like \uc2 VanEck\uc2 , Ark Invest, and Bitwise. \uc2 WisdomTree\uc2  is the most recent investment firm to lodge a new filing for a spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  that has been rejected by the SEC twice. The first rejection took place in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-rejects-wisdomtree-s-application-for-a-spot-bitcoin-etf-again"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 December 2021}}}\uc2  and again in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-rejects-wisdomtree-s-application-for-a-spot-bitcoin-etf-again"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 October 2022}}}\uc2 . \uc2 WisdomTree\uc2 , a New York based asset management fund, oversees approximately $83 billion in assets. Another notable asset management fund, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cdn.cboe.com/resources/regulation/rule_filings/pending/2023/SR-CboeBZX-2023-038.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Invesco}}}\uc2 , reactivated an application for a \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  on the \uc2 Cboe\uc2  exchange.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crypto market sentiment is rising\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin and altcoins still have risk events that can impact the price, BTC futures are showing traders switching from majority short to long. According to Coinglass, 54.24% of traders are long Bitcoin at a ratio of 1.2 compared to BTC shorts.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/c543fa2d-8171-471f-acc4-176b8cc378e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin long versus short ratio. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Combined with reduced spot volume and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s net exodus from exchanges, prices may see further \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Typically, when there is a greater net outflow of Bitcoin from exchanges, sell pressure decreases allowing short liquidations to influence the BTC price at a greater magnitude.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/188c4a6d-0eb2-4a66-ad38-56cb2a4091c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin net exchange position change. Source: Glassnode\par \par \uc2 Fed interest rate pause increases risk appetite\par \par \uc2 At the June 14 Federal Open Market Committee (FOMC) Fed Chairman \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  revealed that the central bank would pause rate hikes for June. While this move aligned with investors\u8217\'20\'19 expectations, the crypto market did not initially match the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/hawkish-fed-stocks-market-rally-and-crypto-falling-behind"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 equities\u8217\'20\'19 market \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin and Ether price has been impacted by the recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 negative enforcement news}}}\uc2 , today\u8217\'20\'19s rally shows a flash of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. The Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-this-week-fear-26k-key-5-things"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fear & Greed Index}}}\uc2  has reached a 3-month high highlighting that investors are more apt to take on risk assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/2612ccd0-3f03-4c8e-89c7-49b036336166.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Fear & Greed Index. Source: Alternative.me\par \par \uc2 Overall, crypto markets are likely to continue seeing price \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  powered by macro events. While the positive news of \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ETF filing and renewed institutional interest is providing a nice short-term bump in crypto prices, the market\u8217\'20\'19s reaction to any potential enforcement actions or economic recession will be the true determinant of which direction the market chooses to take.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/a633230d-3f9a-4749-8bab-017c4b9435a0.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230621ej6l000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
