\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Weekly Roundup: SEC\u8217\'20\'19s View On SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, And More\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 908 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 June 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 In its latest salvo against crypto, the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) has called popular cryptocurrencies such as Solana (SOL), Polygon (MATIC), and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) unregistered securities.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ZEBEDEE And Fiatjaf Launch Nostr Social Media Client\par \par \uc2 ZEBEDEE and Nostr co-creator Fiatjaf have launched the ZBD app, touted as the most decentralized social media yet. The app is built on Bitcoin, allowing users to own their content and send microtransactions.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum \uc2 Vitalik Buterin\uc2  Unveils Roadmap For Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s Future\par \par \uc2 Ethereum co-founder, \uc2 Vitalik Buterin\uc2 , has unveiled a roadmap for Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s future. The roadmap consists of three significant technical transitions, which according to Buterin, are crucial for ensuring the long-term success of Ethereum.\par \par \uc2 Optimism Prepares For Bedrock Upgrade\par \par \uc2 Ethereum Layer-2 scaling solution Optimism unveiled its Bedrock upgrade on the 6th of June. The step is a significant stride in Optimism\u8217\'20\'19s vision of becoming a utility-oriented Superchain with lower gas fees and faster transaction finality.\par \par \uc2 DeFi Federal Judge Dismisses Lawsuit Against PoolTogether\par \par \uc2 A federal judge has thrown out a lawsuit against decentralized finance (DeFi) startup PoolTogether. The judge stated that the federal court system was not the appropriate platform for concerns regarding the startup and its operations.\par \par \uc2 Technology \uc2 Deutsche Telekom\uc2  Joins Polygon As Validator Node\par \par \uc2 Technology giant \uc2 Deutsche Telekom\uc2  has joined the Polygon blockchain as a validator node as it looks to establish itself as a critical infrastructure provider in the Web3 space.\par \par \uc2 Russia\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Rosbank\uc2  Announces Launch Of Crypto Payments Solution\par \par \uc2 Rosbank\uc2 , one of Russia\u8217\'20\'19s most important banks, has announced the launch of a crypto payments solution. According to the bank, the payment solution will help facilitate cross-border settlements.\par \par \uc2 Business \uc2 Changpeng Zhao\uc2  Was Binance.US Shadow CEO, Alleges \uc2 Brian Brooks\par \par \uc2 Binance.US former CEO \uc2 Brian Brooks\uc2  has revealed that he left his position as CEO in court documents submitted earlier in the week. Brooks stated that after a point of time, it became clear that Zhao was the CEO of BAM Trading.\par \par \uc2 Circle Obtains Major Payment Institution License\par \par \uc2 Circle Internet Singapore Pte. Ltd. has revealed that it has received a Major Payment Institution (MPI) license from the \uc2 Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS)\uc2 . This will allow Circle to offer users in Singapore digital payment services, cross-border money transfer services, and domestic money transfer services.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  Australia\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Commonwealth Bank\uc2  Restricts Payments To Certain Exchanges\par \par \uc2 Australia\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Commonwealth Bank\uc2  has announced the implementation of new processes designed to protect customers from possible scams associated with certain cryptocurrency exchanges.\par \par \uc2 Draft Bill Proposes Clear Roles For SEC And CFTC\par \par \uc2 A draft bill introduced by Republican lawmakers Glen Thompson and \uc2 Patrick McHenry\uc2  aims to define clear roles for the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  and the CFTC. It also charts out a clear regulatory plan to enable the trading of digital assets on conventional platforms.\par \par \uc2 SEC Alleges SOL, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and MATIC Are Unregistered Securities\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  has called Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), Polygon (MATIC), and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) unregistered securities in its lawsuit against \uc2 Binance\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Cboe Digital Receives Approval For Margin Trades On Crypto Futures Exchange\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Commodity Futures Trading Commission\uc2  (CFTC) has given approval to an amended order of registration, clearing the path for Cboe Digital to clear additional products as a derivatives clearing organization.\par \par \uc2 Will SEC Go After Tether Next?\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  has gone all guns blazing against crypto recently, targeting some of the most prominent exchanges in \uc2 Binance\uc2  and \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 . With the SEC looking for a new target, could Tether be in its crosshairs next?\par \par \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  CEO Unfazed By SEC Lawsuit\par \par \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  CEO \uc2 Brian Armstrong\uc2  has revealed that he is unfazed by the SEC lawsuit. Instead, Armstrong has stated that a court battle will help establish much-needed clarity around crypto.\par \par \uc2 Billionaire \uc2 Mark Cuban\uc2  Launches Scathing Attack On SEC\par \par \uc2 Billionaire \uc2 Mark Cuban\uc2  has heavily criticized the SEC for what he calls a clear lack of support for companies trying to comply with securities regulations in the country.\par \par \uc2 Robinhood\uc2  Reviewing Crypto Offerings Following SEC Crackdown\par \par \uc2 Robinhood\uc2  is reportedly reviewing crypto offerings on its platform as the SEC cracks down on major exchanges such as \uc2 Binance\uc2  and \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 UK FCA Announces New Crypto Marketing Rules\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 UK Financial Conduct Authority\uc2  has announced a new set of crypto marketing rules, which are set to take effect from the 8th of October.\par \par \uc2 Did \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  Want To Join Binance?\par \par \uc2 Binance\uc2  lawyers have alleged that current SEC Chair \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  discussed the possibility of an informal advisor for the crypto exchange in 2019.\par \par \uc2 UK Announces Ban On Airdrops And Free Promotional NFTs\par \par \uc2 The Financial Conduct Authority has announced the prohibition of free promotional NFTs and crypto airdrops in a new set of stricter marketing rules announced earlier in the week.\par \par \uc2 NFTs Louis Vuitton Debuts New NFT Collection\par \par \uc2 Luxury fashion house Louis Vuitton has announced the launch of a new NFT collection called Treasure Trunks, exclusively for its top customers.\par \par \uc2 Web3 Ankr Launches Enterprise RPC Services On Azure\par \par \uc2 Web3 developer hub Ankr has announced the official launch of Enterprise Remote Procedure Call on \uc2 Microsoft\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Azure Marketplace.\par \par \uc2 Security Elliptic To Integrate ChatGPT\par \par \uc2 Crypto risk management firm \uc2 Elliptic\uc2  has revealed that it would be integrating ChatGPT for its risk management and intelligence-gathering operations.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020230612ej6c00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price avoids 3-month lows as crypto dive liquidates $390M\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By   William Suberg \par \uc2 624 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 June 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin loses key BTC price trend line as altcoins face major drawdowns.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) challenged three-month lows into June 10 as altcoins felt the heat from United States regulatory pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/0791beb5-ea14-420e-9489-7cc869b591d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 . Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Altcoin bloodbath as exchanges reshape landscape\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.173325223.503936973.1685953699-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD hitting $25,483 on the day, down over $1,200 from the previous day\u8217\'20\'19s high.\par \par \uc2 While showing weakness, Bitcoin was spared the fate of major altcoins, which reacted strongly to delisting that accompanied U.S. legal action against major exchanges.\par \par \uc2 Trading app \uc2 Robinhood{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/robinhood-will-end-support-for-3-tokens-named-in-sec-lawsuits"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/robinhood-will-end-support-for-3-tokens-named-in-sec-lawsuits}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/robinhood-will-end-support-for-3-tokens-named-in-sec-lawsuits"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced that it would remove support}}}\uc2  for several cryptocurrencies named in the lawsuit against \uc2 Binance\uc2  and \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  by the \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC).\par \par \uc2 These subsequently hemorrhaged value, with both Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) down nearly 25% in 24 hours at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe regularly review the crypto we offer on \uc2 Robinhood\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D the firm {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://robinhood.com/us/en/support/articles/cardano-polygon-solana-update/?irclickid=WFC0sm0H2xyPTMGVl83KUWVXUkF0JIRHI3NuRA0&irgwc=1&utm_source=impact&utm_campaign=10078&utm_content=Skimbit%20Ltd.&utm_term=1375188"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stated}}}\uc2  on its website.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBased on our latest review, we\u8217\'20\'19ve decided to end support for Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Polygon (MATIC), and Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) on June 27th, 2023 at 6:59 PM ET.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/9864308b-37fe-4ba9-94a5-37068d72dd74.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Coinbase\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs expected, following this week\u8217\'20\'19s action on the regulatory front, we saw some delistings causing market selloff,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Kris Marszalek\uc2 , CEO of Crypto.com, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/kris/status/1667439869126410240"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 responded}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI guess we are in the \u8216\'20\'18then they fight you\u8217\'20\'19 stage on the \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2  curve. Make no mistake: crypto industry will go through this and emerge stronger than ever.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com confirmed that it would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-com-suspends-us-institutional-exchange-service"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 halt its U.S. institutional trading service}}}\uc2  beginning June 21.\par \par \uc2 BTC price 200-week trend line support fails\par \par \uc2 The events had a major impact on the overall cryptocurrency market cap, with Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe, founder and CEO of trading firm Eight, warning that worse may be to come.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-ethereum-to-shake-off-toothless-adversary-sec-as-fomc-looms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin, Ethereum to shake off \u8216\'20\'18toothless adversary\u8217\'20\'19 SEC as FOMC looms}}}\par \par \uc2 As with BTC/USD, should the total crypto cap tally lose its 200-week moving average (MA), this would constitute a clear bear signal. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s moving average trend line {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-weigh-next-move-with-btc-price-at-crucial-200-week-trendline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 currently stands at nearly $26,400}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is not the weekly candle you\u8217\'20\'19d want to see on the total market capitalization for Crypto,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1667486514853429248"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2 Twitter\uc2  followers alongside a chart.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLosing the 200-Week MA shouts for downwards continuation on the trend.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/de99e61a-b27a-4b18-aabd-dea107222c36.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market cap annotated chart. Source: Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Van de Poppe, like some other popular traders, nonetheless {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1667490393905152000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed}}}\uc2  interest in altcoin buys at lower prices.\par \par \uc2 Accompanying him was Crypto Tony, who predicted \u8220\'20\'1Cincredible entries\u8221\'20\'1D on the table for 2023.\par \par \uc2 These {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Altcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Altcoin}}}\uc2  drops get me way too excited in Crypto as they really do not come by that often\par \par \uc2 Got some incredible entries lined up later this year. I will share a few later today with you all and they are super realistic .. WHO IS READY\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Crypto Tony (@CryptoTony__) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoTony__/status/1667481985097531393?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 10, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 For existing traders, however, the damage was done, as long liquidations totaled $320 million for June 10, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/LiquidationData"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to data from CoinGlass, with the day not yet over.\par \par \uc2 Another $70 million in short positions also evaporated.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/52d05650-f43d-4c90-9b9f-13845f55e73a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto liquidations chart (screenshot). Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/crypto-home-loan-bitcoin-mortgage-risky/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Home loans using crypto as collateral: Do the risks outweigh the reward?}}}\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-06/728f3d93-4744-40df-9eb3-f3096885cd09.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230611ej6a0005q\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price avoids 3-month lows as crypto dive liquidates $390M