\par\par \b \uc2 Huobi\uc2  Joins HKVAC as First Member to Fuel Hong Kong's Ambition to be a Global Web3 Hub\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 687 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 May 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Singapore, Singapore, May 31st, 2023, Chainwire\par \par \uc2 Huobi\uc2  announced that it became the first member of Hong Kong Virtual Asset Consortium (HKVAC). By joining HKVAC, an organization dedicated to providing credit ratings for crypto asset exchanges and trading products. \uc2 Huobi\uc2  aims to develop a venture capital database that caters to the needs of the market, actively engage in educating the public about crypto investments, and offer Hong Kong traders a "one-stop" crypto asset trading service. Ultimately, with Huobi Hong Kong (\uc2 Huobi\uc2  HK) as the pivot, \uc2 Huobi\uc2  is committed to supporting Hong Kong in its efforts to become a global Web3 hub.\par \par \uc2 HKVAC is said to be a collaboration of many crypto industry players, including exchanges, institutional investors, and Hong Kong-licensed rating agencies. It was established primarily to enhance the industry's capabilities in security risk management and to assist the Central Government and Hong Kong's local authorities in building a world-leading hub for virtual asset and digital finance. At the same time, it commits itself to creating a safe, open and transparent environment for crypto asset investments under the guidance of "Hong Kong's new crypto regulations.\u8221\'20\'1D It will also promote the acceptance and recognition of crypto assets by helping the public gain systematic, correct and secure knowledge about crypto investments.\par \par \uc2 As an exchange that always prioritizes "global security and compliance operations", \uc2 Huobi\uc2  has maintained the best industry record of 100% functionality and no security incidents for ten years since its inception. \uc2 Huobi\uc2  will bring its expertise in security technology and its compliant, standardized processes to HKVAC as a reference. Together they can provide risk management indicators to investors in the industry and set strict rating standards to evaluate existing exchanges, so that more crypto investors can have a clear understanding of the risk level of their investments. This will accelerate the creation of a safe and friendly crypto environment in Hong Kong.\par \par \uc2 In addition, as a pioneer in establishing itself as a Web3 gateway, \uc2 Huobi\uc2  will join hands with HKVAC to continuously pursue multi-dimensional collaborations and advancements in technology, data, and ecosystem development. Together, \uc2 Huobi\uc2  and HKVAC will facilitate the application of Web3 infrastructure and build a bridge between the real world and the realm of Web3 to encourage wider acceptance and participation in Web3. These endeavors will drive the development of Hong Kong's Web 3.0 industry and serve as the stepping stones on Hong Kong's way to becoming a global hub for Web 3.0 (the third-generation Internet).\par \par \uc2 As previously reported, \uc2 Huobi\uc2  will officially launch \uc2 Huobi\uc2  HK. Starting June 1, Huobi HK is expected to deliver unparalleled trading experiences to Web3 users through its wide range of products. Users can trade cryptocurrencies like BTC, ETH, TRX, LTC, BCH, DOGE, SHIB, BTT, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and other major cryptocurrencies listed in the independent index on \uc2 Huobi\uc2  HK.\par \par \uc2 A \uc2 Huobi\uc2  representative said that joining HKVAC will boost \uc2 Huobi\uc2 's business in Hong Kong and lay the foundation for future operations that comply with laws and regulations. Meanwhile, \uc2 Huobi\uc2  intends to work with various parties in the industry to build the ecosystem of Web3 under the premise of policy compliance. It will start by establishing itself as a Web3 gateway to promote the development of Web3 in Hong Kong. Hopefully, \uc2 Huobi\uc2  will be granted a cryptocurrency trading license in Hong Kong in the near future, so that it can collaborate with the Hong Kong government, regulators, and other institutions to create a better crypto market in the region.\par \par \uc2 About \uc2 Huobi\par \par \uc2 Founded in 2013, \uc2 Huobi\uc2  has evolved from a crypto exchange into a comprehensive ecosystem of blockchain businesses that span \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading, financial derivatives, wallets, research, investment, incubation and other areas. \uc2 Huobi\uc2  serves millions of users worldwide, with a business presence covering over 160 countries and regions across five continents. Its three development strategies - "global development, technology drives development, and technology for good" - underpin its commitment to providing comprehensive services and values to global cryptocurrency enthusiasts.\par \par \uc2 ContactMichael Wangglo-media@huobi.com\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020230531ej5v000p2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/29: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,765 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 As the debt ceiling deal passes through Congress, some short-term bulls may book profits, resulting in increased \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Bitcoin and select altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and the S&P 500 Index (SPX) recovered from their respective intra-week lows to finish last week on a positive note. The recovery was largely driven by the expectations of a debt ceiling deal being reached between the White House and congressional Republicans.\par \par \uc2 While the short-term picture looks promising, traders should not let their guard down. Many times, the price rises on rumors and falls on the news. It needs to be seen whether the bulls will build upon last week\u8217\'20\'19s strength or give back some of the gains after the deal makes its way through Congress.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/f30e27af-9d37-4cb9-a266-f94d97dd8549.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 One positive in favor of the crypto bulls is that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mining-difficulty-passes-50-trillion-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 supply continues to diminish}}}\uc2  because long-term investors with conviction refuse to sell their holdings. Glassnode\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1CHodled and Lost Coins\u8221\'20\'1D metric has risen to its highest level since May 2018.\par \par \uc2 Going forward, what are the important resistance levels that need to be scaled for the up move to continue in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index turned up sharply from the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of 4,100 on May 24 and rose above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of 4,145 on May 25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/643b5781-d03a-472a-9532-3c8763f3f106.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to overcome the obstacle at 4,200. If they succeed, the index could rise to 4,300. This level may again act as a strong resistance, but if bulls do not allow the price to drop back below 4,200, the likelihood of a break above 4,300 increases. The index could then start its northward journey to the 4,500 to 4,600 zone.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down and collapses below 4,050. The index could then slump to the uptrend line and subsequently to 3,800.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 When an asset is consolidating in a range with well-defined boundaries, traders buy the dip near the support and sell close to the resistance. After bouncing off the 100.82 support, the bulls are trying to push the U.S. Dollar Index to the resistance at 106,\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/35326b50-c6bb-414f-b298-f1d609b65761.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA (103) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought territory indicate that the bulls are in command in the near term. The up move could reach 106, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense. If the price turns down from this resistance, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the first support is at the 20-day EMA and the next at the 50-day SMA (102). The next trending move is likely to begin on a break above 106 or on a drop below the crucial support at 100.82.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to tug the price below the immediate support at $25,811 attracted solid buying by the bulls. They pushed Bitcoin back into the symmetrical triangle pattern on May 28, but higher levels are attracting selling.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/5b012c7e-e14f-43e2-bb3f-af7ec0e0c585.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to stop the recovery at the resistance line of the triangle. If the bulls do not allow the price to slide below the 20-day EMA ($27,255), it will enhance the prospects of a break above the resistance line. If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to $30,000 and then to $31,000.\par \par \uc2 On the way down, the first support to watch out for is the 20-day EMA. If this level gives way, it will suggest that the bears are selling on rallies. The pair may then plunge to the vital support zone between $25,811 and $25,250.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The falling wedge pattern is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. Buyers kicked Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the resistance line on May 28, indicating that the corrective phase may have ended.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/b9b1569f-5ce1-47a0-9a19-83300b78dc5d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI has jumped into positive territory and the 20-day EMA ($1,841) has started to turn up, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. If bulls flip the resistance line into support, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to $2,000 and subsequently to $2,141. The pattern target of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup is $2,259.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply and tumbles below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the breakout may have been a bull trap. The pair may then crumble to the support line.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the immediate resistance of the 20-day EMA ($311) on May 28, indicating that the $300 level is acting as a strong floor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/00e30d80-5d81-4058-8da1-dc39e9352ead.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to push the price to the resistance line of the descending channel pattern. The bears are expected to defend this level aggressively because if they fail to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could surge to the overhead resistance of $350.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the resistance line, it will suggest that the pair may spend some more time inside the descending channel. The $300 level remains the key level to watch on the downside because a break below it could sink the pair to $280.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) climbed above the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern on May 28, which completed the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/4606cf78-1c4d-441a-b8aa-e0b630c3568e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Usually, after the breakout from a pattern, the price returns to retest the breakout level. In this case, the price may drop to the neckline. If the price rebounds off this level with strength, it will suggest that the bulls have flipped the neckline into support. That will enhance the prospects of a rally to the pattern target of $0.55.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($0.46), it may trap several aggressive bulls. The XRP/USDT pair may then slump to $0.44 and subsequently to the crucial support at $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounce off the uptrend line on May 26 shows that the ascending triangle pattern remains intact, and the bulls are fiercely guarding the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/50a6f663-e014-4612-af8c-ad05a2ebca5f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to halt the relief rally at the 50-day SMA ($0.38), but if sellers want to gain control, they will have to yank the price below the strong support at $0.34. If they do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may plummet to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls propel the price above the 50-day SMA, it will signal demand at higher levels. The pair may then rise to the overhead resistance zone of $0.44 to $0.46. A break above this zone will suggest the start of a new up move.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-erodes-4-gains-as-btc-price-downside-targets-stretch-to-23k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin erodes 4% gains as BTC price downside targets stretch to $23K}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to form a short-term low at $0.07. Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has reached the 20-day EMA ($0.07), which is the first important obstacle that needs to be crossed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/7577509c-1325-481e-a738-bfa00d484054.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating that the bears may be losing their grip. If the 20-day EMA is crossed, the DOGE/USDT pair could move up to $0.08. This level may again pose a strong challenge, but if the bulls surmount it, the pair may soar toward $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down sharply from the current level. In that case, the risk of a fall below $0.07 increases. The next support on the downside is $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on May 27 and the 20-day EMA ($20.42) on May 28, suggesting that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/f1454991-08cf-4900-a5ac-0e0d0f28fb41.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint also indicate that the selling pressure could be reducing. The 50-day SMA ($21.67) may again act as a minor hurdle, but it is likely to be crossed. That could start a strong relief rally toward $24.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. The SOL/USDT pair could then retest the crucial short-term support at $18.70.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) recovery has reached near the 50-day SMA ($0.97), where the bears are offering stiff resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/cf20bf48-aaf4-45a9-bc86-823b02159062.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers do not allow the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($0.90), it will indicate a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. That will increase the likelihood of a break above the 50-day SMA. If this resistance is scaled, the MATIC/USDT pair could start a rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA remains the key support to keep an eye on. If this level breaks down, the pair may slide to $0.82. That may keep the pair stuck inside the $0.82 to $0.94 range for a few days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/6f74cf31-0046-4146-8393-6faccb539de8.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230530ej5t0000b\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,745 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are trying to break above their respective resistance levels, indicating that the bulls are showing some interest.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading in a narrow range for the past few days. Generally, tight ranges are followed by a range expansion, resulting in strong trending moves. Market intelligence firm Glassnode {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/glassnode/status/1660513624593674240"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2  on May 22 that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) seven-day price range is \u8220\'20\'1Ccomparable to Jan 2023 and July 2020, both of which preceded large market moves.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 It is not only Bitcoin \u8212\'20\'14 even the S&P 500 Index (SPX) is at a critical juncture. After its 1.65% rise last week, the SPX has reached near a stiff resistance. The market participants will be keenly watching the outcome of the debt ceiling negotiations before attempting to start a trending move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/91ea2511-05ee-44b7-ab4d-b06622ef9837.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Another trigger could be the macroeconomic data, as it will provide insights on the likely action by the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  in its next meeting on June 13 and 14. The FedWatch {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cmegroup.com/markets/interest-rates/cme-fedwatch-tool.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tool}}}\uc2  currently projects a 72% probability of a pause by the Fed.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support and resistance levels that need to be crossed to signal the start of a new trending move on Bitcoin and the major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the SPX above the 4,200 resistance on May 19, but they could not sustain the higher levels. This shows that the bears are fiercely protecting this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/55bf0843-e0e5-473a-9fea-cc31bb3813e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) at 4,140 is sloping up gradually, and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the positive zone, indicating that bulls are in control. They are likely to make another attempt to overcome the hurdle at 4,200.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. The index could first rise to 4,300 and thereafter to 4,600.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are the important support levels to watch out for on the downside. A break below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) at 4,080 will be the first indication that the bulls may be rushing to the exit. That could pull the price down to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) has been range-bound between 100.82 and 106 for the past several days. In a range, traders generally buy near the support and sell closer to the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/f948db36-40cd-4c84-bf43-5536a9658f26.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The repeated failure of the bears to sink the price below 100.82 may have attracted buying from the aggressive bulls. They kicked the price above the moving averages on May 12, paving the way for a potential rally to 106. This level may act as a formidable resistance, and the bulls may find it difficult to surmount it.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break below the moving averages will be the first indication that the bears are selling on minor rallies. That could result in a retest of the pivotal level at 100.82.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears have successfully defended the 20-day EMA ($27,414), but they have not been able to sink the price to the crucial support at $25,250. This suggests that the bulls are buying on minor dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/27d340b6-039e-4b1e-b50f-532ca563f543.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 As long as the price stays above the nearby support at $26,361, the bulls will continue their efforts to push the price back into the symmetrical triangle pattern. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the markets have rejected the lower levels.\par \par \uc2 That could increase the likelihood of a rally to the resistance line. This level may again prove to be a major hurdle for the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below $26,361, it will suggest that supply exceeds demand. The BTC/USDT pair could then tumble to the critical level of $25,250.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading close to the 20-day EMA ($1,833) for the past few days. Although the bears have defended the level successfully, the bulls have kept up the pressure. This enhances the prospects of a break above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/0a310b54-a9be-4c71-b547-1affff83fc6a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to the resistance line of the falling wedge pattern. This level may again act as a strong barrier, but if bulls overcome it, the pair could start an up move to $2,000 and subsequently to $2,141.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below $1,771, the pair may drop to the support line. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it is likely to result in a drop to $1,600.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 20-day EMA ($313) and the horizontal support at $300 for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/f389331f-5453-4b84-9add-2aa90235bd9b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI near 44 suggest that the bears have a slight edge. Sellers will try to sink the price below $300 and challenge the support line of the descending channel pattern.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the moving averages, it will suggest that bulls are attempting a comeback. The BNB/USDT pair may then rise to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have failed to propel XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line, but a minor positive is that they have held the 20-day EMA ($0.45) support on the downside. This shows that the sentiment is turning \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the dips are being bought.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/2571b2f6-0cfc-4ce7-a264-b4fc5bcb156a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up gradually, and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers propel the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.47), the XRP/USDT pair could pick up momentum and dash toward $0.54.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and slips below the 20-day EMA. That could clear the path for a drop to the critical support zone of $0.43 to $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) continued its slide in the past three days and reached the uptrend line on May 21. This is an important level to watch for because a break below it will indicate that the bulls are losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/bec74e0e-33f5-4965-abb9-c326593d3ccc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The solid bounce off the uptrend line on May 22 shows that the buyers continue to protect this level with all their might. If bulls propel the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.37), it will suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum above the 50-day SMA ($0.39).\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price once again turns down from the 20-day EMA and breaks below the uptrend line, it will indicate the start of a deeper correction to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-stuck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price stuck?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on May 21, but the bulls continue to buy the dips to $0.07, indicating that the price remains stuck inside the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/49e2e148-352d-4ef5-9590-84296090fe42.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by yanking the price below the solid support at $0.07. If they can pull it off, the DOGE/USDT pair may slump to $0.06, where the buyers will again try to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if bulls thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that range has resolved in favor of the buyers. The pair could first reach the 50-day SMA ($0.08) and later attempt an up move to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down and plunged below the strong support of $19.85 on May 21, indicating that bears remain in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/7100e7b7-fd07-416c-a538-69fa78272f40.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair could decline to $18.70, which is an important level to keep an eye on because if this level cracks, the pair may descend to the crucial support at $15.28. This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a rally above the moving averages will suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. That will open the doors for a potential rally to $24 and then to $27.12. Sellers will try to halt the recovery at this level.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating in a narrow range between $0.91 and $0.82 for the past few days. This suggests that traders are unsure about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/93cb4f0c-4a1c-43f9-9c28-82ef101681a8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 39 indicate that the bears are in command. Sellers will try to sink the price below $0.82 and resume the downtrend. The MATIC/USDT pair could then retest the vital support at $0.69. Buyers are expected to aggressively defend this level.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to start a recovery, they will have to drive the price above the $0.91 to $0.94 resistance zone. The pair could then start a strong relief rally toward the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/5edc0f8e-56a5-4cba-83d7-4d0eff79d7f8.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230523ej5m0000m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,776 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Strong selling by the bears near overhead resistance levels in Bitcoin and altcoins indicates that \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains negative.\par \par \uc2 The United States stock market recovered sharply on May 17 and May 18 on hopes that the debt ceiling agreement could be reached, but the market gave back some of its gains on May 19 on reports of a temporary {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/05/18/stock-market-today-live-updates.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 halt}}}\uc2  in the talks.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY), which had been rising for the past three days, turned down on May 19 after Federal Reserve Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-flips-volatile-at-27k-as-fed-s-powell-teases-end-to-rate-hikes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hinted at an end to the rate hikes}}}\uc2 . While speaking at a conference in Washington D.C., Powell said that stresses in the banking system may restrict the need to raise rates as high as they \u8220\'20\'1Cwould have otherwise to achieve our goals.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/e522979b-997a-4fc8-a9ba-e65019c0c7b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) short-term picture is uncertain, analysts remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  about the long term. \uc2 Blockstream\uc2  CEO and co-founder \uc2 Adam Back\uc2  recently said that \u8220\'20\'1Chyper-Bitcoinization\u8221\'20\'1D could soon come. That would boost the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/hyperbitcoinization-coming-says-bitcoin-og-as-wholecoiners-hit-1-million"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 demand for Bitcoin, sending its price soaring}}}\uc2 . Back made a case that the number of \u8220\'20\'1Cwholesalers\u8221\'20\'1D has been steadily rising, and if the trend continues, it could happen that 10 million people try to buy 1 Bitcoin over a few years, and that \u8220\'20\'1Cwould push the price out of reach.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Do the charts signal a possible recovery in Bitcoin and the altcoins in the near term? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls again tried to drive the price into the symmetrical triangle pattern on May 17, but the bears fiercely guarded the level and pulled Bitcoin lower on May 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/8664391b-78a2-412b-bef5-d0cf8441541b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair will continue to witness a tough tussle between the bulls and the bears in the area between the support line and $25,250.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) at $27,590 and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory indicate that bears have a slight edge. However, the failure of the bears to sustain the price below $26,500 shows that the selling pressure reduces at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 If buyers pierce the overhead resistance, the pair could start a rally to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) at $28,412 and thereafter to the resistance line. A break above the triangle will turn the tables in favor of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been trying to drive Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($1,840) for the past few days, but the bears have not allowed that to happen.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/29b70aeb-e1b1-4271-a238-5d54edd2280f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the May 16 to May 18 candlestick shows that the bulls continue to buy the intraday dips. This enhances the prospects of a break above the 20-day EMA. If this obstacle is cleared, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to the resistance line of the falling wedge pattern.\par \par \uc2 This is the key level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it will indicate the start of a new up move. On the downside, the bears will have to tug the price below the support line to start a downward move to $1,600.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside a descending channel pattern. The price turned down from the 20-day EMA ($315) on May 18, indicating that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/fc52bfcc-4789-46a2-a19c-f27a2dce5079.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. That could clear the path for a likely rally to the resistance line. The bears are again expected to protect this level with vigor. If the price turns down sharply from the resistance line, it will suggest that the BNB/USDT pair may remain inside the channel for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to sink the price below the support line of the channel and challenge the crucial support at $280.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 After struggling near the 20-day EMA ($0.45) on May 17, buyers cleared the barrier on May 18. This suggests that XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a comeback by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/eacaa65a-c230-490d-8556-de0f93a03d55.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the selling pressure is reducing. There is a stiff resistance zone between the downtrend line and the 50-day SMA ($0.48), but it is likely to be crossed. If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair could start its northward march toward $0.54.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the bears continue to sell on relief rallies. That could keep the pair stuck between the 50-day SMA and $0.40 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to sustain Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.37) on May 17 and 18, but the bears did not relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/b2e3d07b-1f6e-43a5-87cd-ecd6abe1f2d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls have not given up much ground from the 20-day EMA, which is an encouraging sign. This shows that every minor dip is being purchased. The bulls will again try to launch the price above the 20-day EMA. If they can pull it off, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may first climb to the 50-day SMA ($0.39) and thereafter attempt a move to $0.44.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to seize control, they will have to quickly yank the price below the uptrend line. That will open the doors for a potential fall to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to propel Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on May 17, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/f579b401-d7cf-4658-94e4-2ac5fef52c0e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls may again try to clear the overhead hurdle, and if they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.08). This level is likely to act as a barrier, but if crossed, it will suggest that the pair continues to swing inside the large range between $0.07 and $0.11.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and plummets below $0.07, it will indicate that the bears have overpowered the bulls. The pair could then slump to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers drove Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the resistance of the narrow range of $0.82 to $0.88 on May 17. Although the bears pulled the price back into the range on May 18, a minor positive is that the bulls purchased the intraday dips, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/2c890dd5-31d7-471d-910e-6cfdca0e0809.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The zone between the 20-day EMA ($0.91) and $0.94 is likely to witness strong selling by the bears. If bulls overcome this obstacle, the MATIC/USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and reach the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price fails to rise above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the sentiment remains negative and the bears are selling on every minor relief rally. Sellers will then again attempt to sink the pair below $0.82.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-risk-us-debt-deal-to-trigger-1t-liquidity-crunch-analyst-warns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price risk? US debt deal to trigger $1T liquidity crunch, analyst warns}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply from the downtrend line on May 18, indicating that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/c7a34f72-150d-4d72-95d9-bd66fdb906b9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to increase their advantage further by sinking the price below the strong support at $19.85. If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair may first tumble to $18.70 and thereafter to $16.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rebounds off the current level and climbs above the 50-day SMA ($21.81), it will indicate that the bulls are active at lower levels. The pair may then attempt a rally to $24 and subsequently to $27.12.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been struggling to start a recovery, indicating that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/e9e1bba5-e24c-450c-93fc-421266e2eab1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Many times, a tight consolidation near a strong support level tends to break to the downside. In this case, a break and close below $5.15 will complete a descending triangle pattern and open the doors for a possible decline to $4.22.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent this fall, they will have to quickly drive the price above the 20-day EMA ($5.51). If they do that, the DOT/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($5.97) and thereafter rally to the downtrend line. Buyers will have to overcome this resistance to indicate that the correction may be over.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance of $96 on May 18, but a positive sign is that the bulls did not allow the price to slip below the 50-day SMA ($89). This shows that the bulls are trying to flip this level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/394d5c08-8e19-4e22-a1af-0c06b4dd1e19.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($87) has started to turn up, and the RSI is near 59, indicating that the bulls have the upper hand. Buyers will next make another attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $96 and propel the LTC/USDT pair to $106.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages. Such a move will indicate that the pair may oscillate between $75 and $96 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/020690fd-1e8d-4186-92c0-4e99bcfec10b.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230519ej5j000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,637 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins continue to fall toward key lower support price levels, but will traders buy the dip?\par \par \uc2 The United States stock markets are trying to recover on reports that the debt ceiling talks are showing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/05/16/stock-market-today-live-updates.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 promise}}}\uc2  and a debt default may be avoided. However, the same enthusiasm is not seen in the cryptocurrency markets. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has slipped back below the $27,000 support on May 17, indicating that buyers are struggling to sustain the relief rallies.\par \par \uc2 Institutional investors seem to be booking profits due to the macro uncertainty. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Report shows a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/digital-asset-market-shrinks-as-fund-outflows-reach-200m-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total outflow of $200 million}}}\uc2  from \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products in four consecutive weeks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/e1ff32f4-1488-4897-855b-f96655aa1cf3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While the short-term picture remains negative, the chart structure on Bitcoin has not been broken. Bitcoin has corrected about 15% from its local high of $31,000 made on April 14 but it remains above $25,000, indicating that the weakness is looking like a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-offers-good-signs-as-analysts-retain-40k-btc-price-target"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 corrective phase in a bull move}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels that the bulls need to hold to launch the next rally in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery stalled at the 20-day exponential moving average ($27,694) on May 15, indicating that the sentiment remains negative and the bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/56892834-32d2-4124-a345-d53b0b1e579e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price below the immediate support at $26,500 which could open the doors for a decline to $25,250. This remains the key level to keep an eye on because a break below it may accelerate selling. The BTC/USDT pair could then plunge to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price rebounds off $25,250, it will suggest that bulls are trying to defend the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders pattern. Starting a new rally is a tough task for the bulls because the recovery is likely to face selling at the moving averages and again at the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($1,844) on May 17, indicating that the bears are protecting the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/ee572592-0ef3-45fe-82ef-4b3f4cadd46f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a falling wedge pattern and the ETH/USDT pair could slide to the support line. This is an important level to watch out for because if bears yank the price below the wedge, the pair could drop to $1,600.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the support line, the bulls will make another attempt to thrust the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could rise to the resistance line of the wedge.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($316) on May 15, indicating that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/a1aa64d5-bf9d-4d98-a990-604c2fca8b97.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will again try to pull the price to the strong support at $300. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if they fail to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could extend the decline to $280.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price bounces off $300, it will signal demand at lower levels. The pair could then again rise to the moving averages. Buyers will have to clear this hurdle to enhance the prospects for a rally to the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 After trading in a tight range near $0.43 for several days, XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke above the overhead resistance on May 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/a4b14038-e26d-43eb-9ee6-a0c97b33d511.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued their buying and shoved the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.44) on May 17. However, the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that the bears are selling the relief rallies to the downtrend line. This suggests that the XRP/USDT pair may oscillate between the downtrend line and $0.40 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Buying could accelerate after the bulls drive and sustain the price above the 50-day simple moving average ($0.48). That may clear the path for a potential rally to the overhead zone of $0.54 to $0.58.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the $0.38 resistance on May 15 and May 17, but the long wick on the candlesticks shows that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/f2d5ebd7-db72-4a75-adc4-e64008a8f7d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.37) is trending down and the RSI is near 43, suggesting that bears have a slight edge. Sellers will next try to sink the price below the uptrend line. If they can pull it off, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could tumble to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level or the uptrend line and climbs above $0.38, it will indicate that the bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair may then rally to $0.42, which is again likely to act as a strong barrier.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is finding buyers at $0.07 but the failure to achieve a strong bounce indicates that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/f2c2da77-d95e-442f-96c2-04320443067e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are expected to fiercely defend the zone between the downtrend line and the 50-day SMA ($0.08). If the price turns down from this zone, the bears will make another attempt to sink the DOGE/USDT pair below $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price shoots up from the current level and rises above the 50-day SMA. If that happens, it will suggest the start of a strong relief rally. The pair may first rally to $0.10 and thereafter to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck in a narrow range between $0.82 and $0.88 for the past few days, indicating indecision among buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/32697d29-454b-49c0-bd78-78f23bb8cca7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near the oversold territory indicate that bears are in control. If the price breaks below $0.82, the selling could intensify and the MATIC/USDT pair may slump to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls are likely to face stiff resistance in the zone between the 20-day EMA ($0.91) and $0.94. A break above this zone will be the first indication that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-xrp-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is XRP price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to push Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line on May 15 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears are guarding the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/0372e5e2-1713-4281-84c7-e4199bbf9e51.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price remains stuck between the downtrend line and the horizontal support at $19.85 but this tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long. The bears will try to tug the price below $19.85 and challenge the support at $18.70.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, the bulls will try to propel and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($21.83) to signal the start of a sustained recovery. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could then rally to $24 and subsequently to $26.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating near the crucial support of $5.15 for the past few days. The failure to start a strong rebound suggests a lack of aggressive buying at current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/f94c2892-5228-4f16-be90-13dec4af4713.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($5.54) and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that bears are in command. If the $5.15 support cracks, the selling could pick up momentum and the DOT/USDT pair may slide to $4.50 and then to $4.22.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to propel the price above the 20-day EMA to indicate a comeback. The pair may then rise to the 50-day SMA ($6) and later attempt a rally to the downtrend line. A break above this resistance will signal that the tide has turned in the favor of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($85) on May 15 and followed that up with another up-move above the 50-day SMA ($89) on May 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/36c0d9f1-a507-4cdb-81e0-c255fb82a54f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USDT pair is nearing $96 where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense. If the bulls do not give up much ground from this level, the likelihood of a break above $96 increases. The pair could then retest the overhead level at $106.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from $96 and breaks below the moving averages, it will indicate that bears are holding their ground. The pair may then swing between $75 and $96 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/5c60bf8c-1742-4eb9-9eb4-cd4803a0c66b.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230517ej5h000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,743 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are attempting to start a recovery, indicating solid buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The debt ceiling negotiations in the United States are keeping traders on the edge. \uc2 JPMorgan Chase\uc2  CEO \uc2 Jamie Dimon\uc2  told \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  on May 11 that a possible sovereign default by the \uc2 U.S. government\uc2  could create {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/05/11/jpms-jamie-dimon-warns-of-market-panic-as-us-nears-default.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 panic}}}\uc2  in the stock markets, resulting in heightened \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The next big question troubling crypto investors is how will Bitcoin react to such an event. \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s latest Markets Live Pulse survey indicates that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) could be the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-top-3-asset-in-us-debt-default-survey"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 third-most preferred asset class}}}\uc2  behind gold and U.S. Treasurys should the \uc2 U.S. government\uc2  fail to prevent a debt default.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/89278a0a-44c7-427b-85b8-12ec496dff54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Billionaire fund manager \uc2 Paul Tudor Jones{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CNBC/status/1658124217294962688"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  CNBC that he is holding his Bitcoin and will always have some portion of his portfolio in it.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support and resistance levels to watch for in the S&P 500 Index (SPX), Bitcoin and the major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index has been trading near the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) at 4,118 for the past few days. This suggests a tough battle between the bulls and the bears for supremacy in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/0b5ee99e-4a01-41d3-b98f-334a2f320063.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint suggest range-bound action in the short term. The index could swing between the overhead resistance of 4,200 and the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of 4,059 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the 50-day SMA could pull the price to the uptrend line. If this support also gives way, the index may nosedive to 3,800.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to clear the hurdle at 4,200. The index may then rally to 4,325, where the bears will again pose a strong challenge. During the correction from this level, if buyers flip 4,200 into support, it will enhance the prospects of a rally above 4,325.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 After being unsuccessful for a few days, the bulls finally managed to push and sustain the U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) above the 20-day EMA (101.88) on May 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/baab5787-e9c2-4a9d-933b-038487453dae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued their buying and cleared the overhead hurdle at the 50-day SMA (102.47) on May 12. The 20-day EMA has started to turn up gradually, and the RSI has jumped into the positive zone, indicating that bulls have a slight edge. The index could rise to 103.50 in the short term, where it is again likely to face selling from the bears.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and slips below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the break above the 50-day SMA may have been a bull trap. The index could then retest the vital support at 100.82. A break and close below this level will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders (H&S) pattern, which may start a downward move to 97.50.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to force Bitcoin back into the symmetrical triangle pattern, suggesting strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/08f8318b-2603-4610-8fec-ef9914faee54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is likely to face strong selling at the moving averages and again at the resistance line of the triangle. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the bears will make another attempt to sink the BTC/USDT pair to $25,250.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to keep an eye on because if it cracks, the selling could intensify, and the pair may plunge to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to surmount the resistance line to indicate the start of a new up move. The pair may first rise to $31,000 and later attempt a break above $32,400.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $1,754 on May 12, and after a couple of days of consolidation, the bulls have pushed the price to the 20-day EMA ($1,854).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/5b598ee3-6c2c-431a-828e-f60ddb2bf8c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to guard the support line with vigor and flip it into resistance. If they can pull it off, it will signal that higher levels are attracting sellers. The ETH/USDT pair could then retest the immediate support at $1,740. A break and close below this level could tug the price down to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $1,663.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the decline, they will have to drive the price above the 50-day SMA ($1,883). The pair could then rally to the psychologically crucial level of $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) to the moving averages, indicating that the $300 level is proving to be a strong support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/4062b949-823a-4889-9411-91e680ac5eb0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the moving averages will clear the path for a potential rise to the overhead resistance at $338. This level may prove to be a strong barrier, but if bulls overcome it, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to $350.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears have not given up. They will then again try to yank the price below $300. If they do that, the pair could slide to the next support at $280.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below $0.43 for the past few days, but a minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the bears to extend the decline further.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/a8c88696-004f-43af-b747-88b58765c0c8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to take advantage of the situation and kick the price above $0.43. That could stretch the recovery to the resistance line, where the bears will again try to defend the level. The bulls will have to overcome this obstacle to start a rally to $0.48 and then to $0.54.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $0.40. That will signal the resumption of the down move. The XRP/USDT pair may then tumble to $0.36.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) recovery has reached the 20-day EMA ($0.37), which is an important level to keep an eye on in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/b1187b08-e166-416d-9258-67c15c7e85f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers shove the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then rise toward the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the neckline, it will indicate that the pair may oscillate between the neckline and the uptrend line for a few more days. A break and close below the uptrend line will indicate that bears have seized control. The pair may then slump to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-litecoin-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Litecoin price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have successfully guarded the $0.07 support level in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) for the past few days, indicating solid demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/14f3af60-d4bf-4fb8-bc96-7ca70f3f08af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is likely to face resistance near the moving averages. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest that demand dries up at higher levels. That will embolden the bears, who may then again attempt to sink the DOGE/USDT pair below $0.07. If they manage to do that, the pair could slide to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent a fall below $0.07, they will have to push the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.08). The pair could then rally to the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the strong support at $19.85 is nearing the downtrend line. This is likely to act as a strong hurdle for the bulls in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/a8ad6d13-e6d2-4296-ac7f-07b181226c64.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are flattening out, and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating that the selling pressure could be reducing. If buyers propel the price above the downtrend line, the SOL/USDT pair will attempt a rally to $24.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price once again turns down from the downtrend line, it will suggest that the bears are in no mood to relent. The pair could then remain stuck between the downtrend line and $19.85 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to start a recovery that is likely to reach the breakdown level of $0.94. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/7eb97dfd-06df-40c4-a49c-1167727f2a0d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.94, it will suggest that the bears have flipped this level into resistance. They will then try to strengthen their position further by pulling the MATIC/USDT pair below $0.81. If they succeed, it will open the doors for a potential decline to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if buyers drive the price above $0.94, it will signal strong buying at lower levels. The pair may first rise to the 50-day SMA ($1.03) and thereafter attempt a rally to the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/40ba0a8b-ad49-4709-8aa3-0e8e67892354.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230515ej5f000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset \highlight\uc2  market shrinks as fund outflows reach $200M: \uc2 CoinShares\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By   Judith BannermanQuist \par \uc2 341 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 latest report suggests that investors are growing \u8220\'20\'1Cmore adventurous and selective\u8221\'20\'1D in their investment choices with respect to crypto.\par \par \uc2 On May 15, European cryptocurrency investment firm \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  published its latest \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Report,\u8221\'20\'1D which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blog.coinshares.com/volume-131-digital-asset-fund-flows-weekly-report-c35066b852ae"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed}}}\uc2  that \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products experienced another week of consecutive outflows, with a total of $54 million exiting the market. This brings \u8220\'20\'1Cthe total outflow to US$200m, representing 0.6% of total assets under management (AuM),\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  reported.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/750c7e32-8160-4005-b890-7235a8d90fa8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Weekly crypto asset flows. Source: \uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 According to the report, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) funds witnessed outflows of $38 million. Over the past four weeks, total BTC outflows amounted to $160 million, accounting for 80% of all outflows. Furthermore, when combining the outflows from short positions on Bitcoin, the total value of outflows related to this asset alone reached $201 million. These numbers strongly highlight that recent investor activity has been overwhelmingly focused on Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 The report also noted that multi-asset investments experienced outflows of $7 million in the past week. However, there was a noteworthy development as inflows were observed across eight different altcoin assets, implying that investors are becoming \u8220\'20\'1Cmore adventurous and selective\u8221\'20\'1D in their investment choices.\par \par \uc2 Among the altcoins, funds tied to Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Tron ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tron-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRX}}}\uc2  ) and Sandbox ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/the-sandbox-sand-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SAND}}}\uc2  ) attracted minor inflows of less than $1 million each. Binance ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) was the only altcoin to witness outflows.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-offers-good-signs-as-analysts-retain-40k-btc-price-target"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin offers 'good signs' as analysts retain $40K BTC price target}}}\par \par \uc2 A recent survey conducted by \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Markets Live Pulse indicates that in the event of a theoretical debt default in the United States, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-top-3-asset-in-us-debt-default-survey"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could emerge}}}\uc2  as one of the top three assets alongside gold and United States Treasurys. This suggests that appetite for Bitcoin as a \u8220\'20\'1Cdigital gold\u8221\'20\'1D could emerge if investors doubt Washington\u8217\'20\'19s ability to avoid a default in the long run.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/3-4-billion-bitcoin-popcorn-tin-silk-road-hacker/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  $3.4B of Bitcoin in a popcorn tin: The Silk Road hacker\u8217\'20\'19s story}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/606b700d-75cf-446a-bf2e-41812958bd25.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230515ej5f000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,741 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are attempting to start a recovery, indicating solid buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The debt ceiling negotiations in the United States are keeping traders on the edge. \uc2 JPMorgan Chase\uc2  CEO \uc2 Jamie Dimon\uc2  recently told \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  on May 11 that a possible sovereign default by the \uc2 U.S. government\uc2  could create {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/05/11/jpms-jamie-dimon-warns-of-market-panic-as-us-nears-default.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 panic}}}\uc2  in the stock markets, resulting in heightened \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The next big question troubling crypto investors is how will Bitcoin react to such an event. \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s latest Markets Live Pulse survey indicates that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) could be the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-top-3-asset-in-us-debt-default-survey"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 third most preferred asset class}}}\uc2  behind Gold and U.S. Treasuries should the \uc2 U.S. government\uc2  fail to prevent a debt default.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/89278a0a-44c7-427b-85b8-12ec496dff54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Billionaire fund manager \uc2 Paul Tudor Jones{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CNBC/status/1658124217294962688"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  CNBC that he is holding his Bitcoin and will always have some portion of his portfolio in it.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support and resistance levels to watch for in the S&P 500 Index (SPX), Bitcoin, and the major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index has been trading near the 20-day exponential moving average (4,118) for the past few days. This suggests a tough battle between the bulls and the bears for supremacy in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/0b5ee99e-4a01-41d3-b98f-334a2f320063.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint suggest a range-bound action in the short term. The index could swing between the overhead resistance of 4,200 and the 50-day simple moving average (4,059) for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the 50-day SMA could pull the price to the uptrend line. If this support also gives way, the index may nosedive to 3,800.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to clear the hurdle at 4,200. The index may then rally to 4,325 where the bears will again pose a strong challenge. During the correction from this level, if buyers flip 4,200 into support, it will enhance the prospects of a rally above 4,325.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 After being unsuccessful for a few days, the bulls finally managed to push and sustain the U.S. dollar index (DXY) above the 20-day EMA (101.88) on May 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/baab5787-e9c2-4a9d-933b-038487453dae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued their buying and cleared the overhead hurdle at the 50-day SMA (102.47) on May 12. The 20-day EMA has started to turn up gradually and the RSI has jumped into the positive zone, indicating that bulls have a slight edge. The index could rise to 103.50 in the short term where it is again likely to face selling from the bears.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and slips below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the break above the 50-day SMA may have been a bull trap. The index could then retest the vital support at 100.82. A break and close below this level will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders (H&S) pattern which may start a downward move to 97.50.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to force Bitcoin back into the symmetrical triangle pattern, suggesting 