elegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) to the moving averages, indicating that the $300 level is proving to be a strong support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/4062b949-823a-4889-9411-91e680ac5eb0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the moving averages will clear the path for a potential rise to the overhead resistance at $338. This level may prove to be a strong barrier but if bulls overcome it, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to $350.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears have not given up. They will then again try to yank the price below $300. If they do that, the pair could slide to the next support at $280.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below $0.43 for the past few days but a minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the bears to extend the decline further.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/a8c88696-004f-43af-b747-88b58765c0c8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to take advantage of the situation and kick the price above $0.43. That could stretch the recovery to the resistance line where the bears will again try to defend the level. The bulls will have to overcome this obstacle to start a rally to $0.48 and then to $0.54.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $0.40. That will signal the resumption of the down move. The XRP/USDT pair may then tumble to $0.36.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) recovery has reached the 20-day EMA ($0.37), which is an important level to keep an eye on in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/b1187b08-e166-416d-9258-67c15c7e85f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers shove the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then rise toward the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the neckline, it will indicate that the pair may oscillate between the neckline and the uptrend line for a few more days. A break and close below the uptrend line will indicate that bears have seized control. The pair may then slump to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-litecoin-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Litecoin price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have successfully guarded the $0.07 support level in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) for the past few days indicating solid demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/14f3af60-d4bf-4fb8-bc96-7ca70f3f08af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is likely to face resistance near the moving averages. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest that demand dries up at higher levels. That will embolden the bears who may then again attempt to sink the DOGE/USDT pair below $0.07. If they manage to do that, the pair could slide to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent a fall below $0.07, they will have to push the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.08). The pair could then rally to the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the strong support at $19.85 is nearing the downtrend line. This is likely to act as a strong hurdle for the bulls in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/a8ad6d13-e6d2-4296-ac7f-07b181226c64.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are flattening out and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating that the selling pressure could be reducing. If buyers propel the price above the downtrend line, the SOL/USDT pair will attempt a rally to $24.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price once again turns down from the downtrend line, it will suggest that the bears are in no mood to relent. The pair could then remain stuck between the downtrend line and $19.85 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to start a recovery that is likely to reach the breakdown level of $0.94. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/7eb97dfd-06df-40c4-a49c-1167727f2a0d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.94, it will suggest that the bears have flipped this level into resistance. They will then try to strengthen their position further by pulling the MATIC/USDT pair below $0.81. If they succeed, it will open the doors for a potential decline to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if buyers drive the price above $0.94, it will signal strong buying at lower levels. The pair may first rise to the 50-day SMA ($1.03) and thereafter attempt a rally to the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/40ba0a8b-ad49-4709-8aa3-0e8e67892354.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230515ej5f000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery may trigger buying in these 4 altcoins\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,552 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has started a recovery and that may pull select altcoins such as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , ATOM, LDO, and ARB higher.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) closed the week with a nominal loss of 0.29% but Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is on target to finish the week with a deeper cut of more than 5%. The weakness in Bitcoin pulled several altcoins lower, indicating weakening sentiment.\par \par \uc2 A silver lining is Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s solid bounce on May 12. Several analysts anticipate Bitcoin to start a recovery but monitoring resource Material Indicators sounded cautious.\par \par \uc2 In a recent analysis, they said that the lack of a strong bid from the whales at lower levels could be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-bounces-at-25-8k-lows-amid-warning-over-low-whale-interest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a concerning sign}}}\uc2 . They believe that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  perspective will invalidate if Bitcoin sustains below the 200-week moving average.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/b81b9b9d-ace9-4528-8970-61c1d71fdfe8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Over the next few days, the progress on the debt ceiling talks between leaders from Congress and the White House is expected to take center stage. The uncertainty and risks of a potential U.S. default could keep the rally in the equities markets under check but it is difficult to predict how Bitcoin and altcoins will react to all the chaos.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has started a corrective phase and most altcoins have broken below their respective support levels. Only a handful of cryptocurrencies are looking positive on the charts. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the chart of the top five cryptocurrencies that may turn up in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s May 12 candlestick shows that the bulls are aggressively buying the dips to the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/55845040-e565-4088-80bd-8a05bb7c81e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to push the price back into the triangle but may face stiff resistance from the bears. The downsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($27,959) and the relative strength index below 41 indicate that bears have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again attempt to sink the BTC/USDT pair below $25,250. If they can pull it off, the selling may intensify and the pair could crash to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to clear the hurdle at the resistance line to regain control. The pair may then retest the overhead resistance at $31,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/a4bb4282-409e-4d31-94f3-0495d9d66c16.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 After facing stiff resistance at the 20-EMA, the bulls have cleared the obstacle. This indicates that the bulls are trying to seize control. The pair may first climb to the 50-simple moving average and then to $28,400.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply from the current level, it will suggest that the bears are trying to flip the support line of the triangle into resistance. The pair may then plunge to the crucial support at $25,250.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) solid rebound off the uptrend line on May 11 suggests that lower levels continue to attract strong buying.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/30599bd4-0f55-421e-840d-aa99e1561860.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to resume the recovery by propelling the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.38). This level may act as a minor barrier but if bulls overcome it, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could soar toward the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern. This level is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and drops to the uptrend line. The repeated retest of a support level at short intervals tends to weaken it. That may open the doors for a potential fall to $0.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/4c442430-1eb2-47c8-afde-ab9ebce30174.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the moving averages, indicating that the bears may be losing their grip. The 20-EMA has started to turn up gradually and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that the bulls are on a comeback.\par \par \uc2 If buyers pierce the overhead resistance at $0.37, the pair could pick up momentum and rally to $0.40 and later to $0.42. Conversely, if the price turns down from $0.37, the pair may slide to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Cosmos price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cosmos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/cosmos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ATOM}}}\uc2  ) snapped back from the $10.20 support on May 10, indicating that the bulls are buying the dips to this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/8b098fe8-5d90-4cc5-9565-d3c60663766e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ATOM/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to halt the relief rally at the 50-day SMA ($11.28) but the bulls have not given up much ground. This enhances the prospects of a rally above the 50-day SMA. If that happens, the ATOM/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level for the sellers to guard because a break above it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 The critical support to watch on the downside is $10.20. If it cracks, the descending triangle will complete and the pair may then plummet to $8.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/3cfb52d7-bf05-446a-9717-c6a3b030dc2a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ATOM/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The four-hour chart shows that the relief rally is facing selling at higher levels, but the price action is forming a possible inverse head-and-shoulders pattern that will complete on a break and close above $11.30. The pair may then start an up-move to $12 and subsequently to $12.50.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-SMA, it will suggest that the bears are in control. The pair may then slump toward the vital support at $10.20. A bounce off this level could keep the pair inside the boundaries of $11.30 and $10.20 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/4-alarming-charts-for-bitcoin-bulls-as-27k-becomes-formidable-hurdle"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 4 alarming charts for Bitcoin bulls as $27K becomes formidable hurdle}}}\par \par \uc2 Lido DAO price analysis\par \par \uc2 Lido Dao (LDO) rebounded off the $1.60 support and has reached the overhead resistance at the 20-day EMA ($1.95).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/c7de09f9-0502-4f4f-b4b1-85eaa55df2b3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LDO/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to protect the 20-day EMA but the bulls have not given up. This suggests that the buyers expect the recovery to continue. If bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the LDO/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line. This level is likely to attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 If buyers arrest the next decline above the 20-day EMA, that would suggest a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. The pair could then start a sustained recovery above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the bears will have to sink and sustain the price below $1.60 to indicate the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/a660b723-523f-4347-a554-5b76ffff53a9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LDO/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The four-hour chart shows that the bulls are trying to propel the price above the overhead resistance at $1.98. If they succeed, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  double-bottom pattern. This reversal setup has a target objective of $2.39. If this level is also crossed, the pair may reach $2.60.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level or $1.98 and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. That may keep the pair stuck between $1.57 and $1.98 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Arbitrum price analysis\par \par \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB) has been finding support near the psychologically important level of $1, indicating that the bulls are aggressively buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/496237da-c684-460e-b1e5-769e03844888.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ARB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bears have been attempting to stall the recovery at $1.20 but a minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have kept up the buying pressure. That increases the likelihood of a break above $1.20. If that happens, the ARB/USDT pair could rise to $1.40 and later to $1.50.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down sharply from $1.20. That will point to a possible consolidation between $1 and $1.20 for a few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/5da6844a-86ca-486c-8066-df699a13f8a8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ARB/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-EMA on the four-hour chart has started to turn up, and the RSI is in positive territory, indicating that the selling pressure is reducing. Buyers will try to strengthen their position by pushing the pair above $1.20. If they do that, the pair will complete a double-bottom pattern, which has a target objective of $1.35.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength for the bears will be a break and close below the 20-EMA. That could pull the pair to $1.05. A slide below $1 will signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/8454e8bd-4427-4403-9394-31000e8689a5.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230515ej5e0005u\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery may trigger buying in these 4 altcoins\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,554 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has started a recovery and that may pull select altcoins such as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , ATOM, LDO, and ARB higher.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) closed the week with a nominal loss of 0.29% but Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is on target to finish the week with a deeper cut of more than 5%. The weakness in Bitcoin pulled several altcoins lower, indicating weakening sentiment.\par \par \uc2 A silver lining is Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s solid bounce on May 12. Several analysts anticipate Bitcoin to start a recovery but monitoring resource Material Indicators sounded cautious.\par \par \uc2 In a recent analysis, they said that the lack of a strong bid from the whales at lower levels could be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-bounces-at-25-8k-lows-amid-warning-over-low-whale-interest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a concerning sign}}}\uc2 . They believe that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  perspective will invalidate if Bitcoin sustains below the 200-week moving average.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/b81b9b9d-ace9-4528-8970-61c1d71fdfe8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Over the next few days, the progress on the debt ceiling talks between leaders from Congress and the White House is expected to take center stage. The uncertainty and risks of a potential U.S. default could keep the rally in the equities markets under check but it is difficult to predict how Bitcoin and altcoins will react to all the chaos.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has started a corrective phase and most altcoins have broken below their respective support levels. Only a handful of cryptocurrencies are looking positive on the charts. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the chart of the top five cryptocurrencies that may turn up in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s May 12 candlestick shows that the bulls are aggressively buying the dips to the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders (H&S) pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/55845040-e565-4088-80bd-8a05bb7c81e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to push the price back into the triangle but may face stiff resistance from the bears. The downsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($27,959) and the relative strength index (RSI) below 41 indicate that bears have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again attempt to sink the BTC/USDT pair below $25,250. If they can pull it off, the selling may intensify and the pair could crash to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to clear the hurdle at the resistance line to regain control. The pair may then retest the overhead resistance at $31,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/a4bb4282-409e-4d31-94f3-0495d9d66c16.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 After facing stiff resistance at the 20-EMA, the bulls have cleared the obstacle. This indicates that the bulls are trying to seize control. The pair may first climb to the 50-simple moving average and then to $28,400.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply from the current level, it will suggest that the bears are trying to flip the support line of the triangle into resistance. The pair may then plunge to the crucial support at $25,250.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) solid rebound off the uptrend line on May 11 suggests that lower levels continue to attract strong buying.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/30599bd4-0f55-421e-840d-aa99e1561860.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to resume the recovery by propelling the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.38). This level may act as a minor barrier but if bulls overcome it, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could soar toward the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern. This level is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and drops to the uptrend line. The repeated retest of a support level at short intervals tends to weaken it. That may open the doors for a potential fall to $0.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/4c442430-1eb2-47c8-afde-ab9ebce30174.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the moving averages, indicating that the bears may be losing their grip. The 20-EMA has started to turn up gradually and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that the bulls are on a comeback.\par \par \uc2 If buyers pierce the overhead resistance at $0.37, the pair could pick up momentum and rally to $0.40 and later to $0.42. Conversely, if the price turns down from $0.37, the pair may slide to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Cosmos price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cosmos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/cosmos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ATOM}}}\uc2  ) snapped back from the $10.20 support on May 10, indicating that the bulls are buying the dips to this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/8b098fe8-5d90-4cc5-9565-d3c60663766e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ATOM/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to halt the relief rally at the 50-day SMA ($11.28) but the bulls have not given up much ground. This enhances the prospects of a rally above the 50-day SMA. If that happens, the ATOM/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level for the sellers to guard because a break above it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 The critical support to watch on the downside is $10.20. If it cracks, the descending triangle will complete and the pair may then plummet to $8.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/3cfb52d7-bf05-446a-9717-c6a3b030dc2a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ATOM/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the relief rally is facing selling at higher levels but the price action is forming a possible inverse H&S pattern that will complete on a break and close above $11.30. The pair may then start an up-move to $12 and subsequently to $12.50.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-SMA, it will suggest that the bears are in control. The pair may then slump toward the vital support at $10.20. A bounce off this level could keep the pair inside the boundaries of $11.30 and $10.20 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/4-alarming-charts-for-bitcoin-bulls-as-27k-becomes-formidable-hurdle"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 4 alarming charts for Bitcoin bulls as $27K becomes formidable hurdle}}}\par \par \uc2 Lido DAO price analysis\par \par \uc2 Lido Dao (LDO) rebounded off the $1.60 support and has reached the overhead resistance at the 20-day EMA ($1.95).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/c7de09f9-0502-4f4f-b4b1-85eaa55df2b3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LDO/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to protect the 20-day EMA but the bulls have not given up. This suggests that the buyers expect the recovery to continue. If bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the LDO/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line. This level is likely to attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 If buyers arrest the next decline above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. The pair could then start a sustained recovery above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the bears will have to sink and sustain the price below $1.60 to indicate the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/a660b723-523f-4347-a554-5b76ffff53a9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LDO/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the bulls are trying to propel the price above the overhead resistance at $1.98. If they succeed, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  double bottom pattern. This reversal setup has a target objective of $2.39. If this level is also crossed, the pair may reach $2.60.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level or $1.98 and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. That may keep the pair stuck between $1.57 and $1.98 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Arbitrum price analysis\par \par \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB) has been finding support near the psychologically important level of $1, indicating that the bulls are aggressively buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/496237da-c684-460e-b1e5-769e03844888.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ARB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bears have been attempting to stall the recovery at $1.20 but a minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have kept up the buying pressure. That increases the likelihood of a break above $1.20. If that happens, the ARB/USDT pair could rise to $1.40 and later to $1.50.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down sharply from $1.20. That will point to a possible consolidation between $1 and $1.20 for a few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/5da6844a-86ca-486c-8066-df699a13f8a8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ARB/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-EMA on the 4-hour chart has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive territory indicating that the selling pressure is reducing. Buyers will try to strengthen their position by pushing the pair above $1.20. If they do that, the pair will complete a double bottom pattern, which has a target objective of $1.35.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength for the bears will be a break and close below the 20-EMA. That could pull the pair to $1.05. A slide below $1 will signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/8454e8bd-4427-4403-9394-31000e8689a5.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230514ej5e000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,636 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The downside may be limited in Bitcoin and select altcoins in the near term as the bulls may buy near strong support levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin extended its decline on May 12, but analyst Philip Swift, co-founder of trading suite Decentrader and creator of data resource LookIntoBitcoin, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-enters-26k-bearadise-as-btc-price-approaches-2-month-lows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 does not expect a deep correction}}}\uc2 . He said it was \u8220\'20\'1Cinteresting to note that the long/short ratio has been climbing as price has trended down.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 One of the reasons that is keeping analysts \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  is Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) halving, which has followed a set cycle until now, and analysts expect it to continue. Citing previous cycles, investor and entrepreneur Alistair Milne, said that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/don-t-short-when-it-s-dark-green-how-to-trade-the-2024-bitcoin-halving"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 time to buy is now}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/42beee31-4d7b-4f15-ba8c-7d83c5930a98.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 However, in the near term, Bitcoin could be facing pressure due to the relief rally in the U.S. dollar index (DXY). Typically, the DXY has an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/s-p-global-attempts-to-assess-crypto-assets-susceptibility-to-macroeconomics"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inverse correlation with Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s performance}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels that may attract buyers in Bitcoin and the major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin formed a long-legged doji candlestick pattern on May 10, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. The sellers resolved that to the downside with a break below the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/57aeeaf4-03d1-45c6-9bec-c64dac760164.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover with the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $28,142 slipping below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $28,496.\par \par \uc2 This along with the relative strength index (RSI) in negative territory indicates that bears are in command. The next target on the downside is $25,250. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because it is the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 If the BTC price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to drive the BTC/USDT pair above the resistance line. On the other hand, a break below $25,250 could open the doors for a potential downside of $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($1,866) on May 10, indicating that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/6bf45b24-7389-4c13-9ced-9833d7330db5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair broke and closed below the support line on May 11, indicating the resumption of the correction. The pair could next reach the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $1,663. This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will indicate that the bears may be losing their grip. The ETH price may then reach the psychologically important level of $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) continued its southward journey and reached near the immediate support at $300. This level had acted as strong support on April 3 and March 15, hence the bulls will again try to defend it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/39384059-e131-4324-9b56-5952e7b1eca0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 In the near term, the $300 level may start a rebound, but that is likely to face strong selling at the 20-day EMA ($319). That will enhance the prospects of a break below $300. The BNB/USDT pair could then slump toward the next strong support at $280.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up and breaks above the moving averages. The pair could then climb toward the overhead resistance at $338. For now, the pair may continue to swing inside the large range between $280 and $338.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to push and sustain XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above $0.43, indicating that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/cf03e613-57e3-4283-9b15-960e945edd09.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.45) and the RSI near oversold territory indicate that bears are in control. Sellers will next try to sink the XRP/USDT pair below the $0.40 support. If they do that, the pair may complete a 100% retracement and plummet to $0.36.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the XRP price bounces off $0.40, the bulls will again try to push and sustain the pair above $0.43. Buyers will have to drive the price above the resistance line to signal the start of a sustained recovery.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) May 11 candlestick shows that the bulls are trying to buy the dips to the uptrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/8705018c-b0a2-4cdd-b280-a3b7715398ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.38) and the RSI in negative territory suggest that bears have the upper hand. They will try to sell on any recovery attempt to the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair will again drop to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 The repeated retest of a support level tends to weaken it. A break below the uptrend line could pull the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price to $0.33 and then to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if bulls thrust the price above the moving averages, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s price could rally to the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have managed to protect the $0.07 level for the past few days, but they have not been able to start a relief rally in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ). This suggests that buying fizzles out at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/9d50d0d0-67f0-4046-b109-6c5d0492b88f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position further by pulling the price below $0.07. If they can pull it off, the DOGE/USDT pair could fall to $0.06. This level is likely to act as a support, but the bears may pose a strong challenge at the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s price turns down from the downtrend line and breaks below $0.06, the selling could pick up momentum. The pair may then plunge to the critical support at $0.05. A break and close above the downtrend line will be the first sign that the selling pressure could be reducing.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has extended its decline below the breakdown level of $0.94. This has pulled the RSI into oversold territory, indicating that the selling may have been overdone in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/c25baf61-f92c-4f7e-b671-75a934fdf8bb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The MATIC/USDT pair may turn up and retest the breakdown level of $0.94. This level is likely to witness a tussle between the bulls and the bears. If MATIC\u8217\'20\'19s price turns down from $0.94, it will suggest that the bears have flipped the level into resistance. That will increase the possibility of a tumble to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if buyers kick the price above $0.94, it will suggest that the bulls are attempting a comeback. Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s price may then recover to the resistance line, where the bears will again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dive-liquidates-100m-btc-futures-traders-bullish"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin's dive under $27K liquidates $100M \u8212\'20\'14 So why aren't margin traders flipping \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22 ?}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the immediate support at $19.85 for the past four days. This shows that the bulls are buying the dips, but they have not been able to start a meaningful recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/3544d28f-f663-4ba1-87a6-eb0f2691c9c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($21.56) has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that bears have a minor edge. If SOL\u8217\'20\'19s price turns lower from the current level or the downtrend line, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative. The SOL/USDT pair may then descend to $18.70.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if bulls pierce the downtrend line, it will suggest that the pair is stuck inside the range between $19.85 and $27.12. The pair may first rise to $24 and thereafter attempt a rally to $27.12.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the strong support at $5.15 on May 10, but the bulls could not build upon this move. This suggests no takers at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/c40cb42d-52d6-4743-8e77-c60ac0daf6da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears used this opportunity and are trying to sink the price below the vital support at $5.15. If they manage to do that, it will suggest the start of the next leg of the down move. The DOT/USDT pair could then plummet to $4.50.\par \par \uc2 If DOT\u8217\'20\'19s price reverses direction from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA ($5.68), it will suggest solid buying at lower levels. The pair may first rise to the 50-day SMA ($6.06) and thereafter rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) bounce off the strong support at $75 is facing strong selling near $82. This shows that bears are pouncing on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/79767b2f-d1ac-4515-813e-6629739f1d90.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will make another attempt to yank the price below $75. If they do that, the LTC/USDT pair could resume its downtrend and slide toward the crucial support at $65. Buyers are expected to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/e070e3e6-c660-432b-b584-57a872647578.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230512ej5c000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,624 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The downside may be limited in Bitcoin and select altcoins in the near term as the bulls may buy near strong support levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) extended its decline on May 12 but analyst Philip Swift, co-founder of trading suite DecenTrader and creator of data resource LookIntoBitcoin, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-enters-26k-bearadise-as-btc-price-approaches-2-month-lows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 does not expect a deep correction}}}\uc2 . He said it was \u8220\'20\'1Cinteresting to note that the long/short ratio has been climbing as price has trended down.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 One of the reasons that is keeping analysts \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  is Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s halving, which has followed a set cycle till now and analysts expect it to continue. Citing previous cycles, investor and entrepreneur Alistair Milne, said that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/don-t-short-when-it-s-dark-green-how-to-trade-the-2024-bitcoin-halving"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 time to buy was now}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/42beee31-4d7b-4f15-ba8c-7d83c5930a98.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, in the near term, Bitcoin could be facing pressure due to the relief rally in the U.S. dollar index (DXY). Typically, the DXY has an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/s-p-global-attempts-to-assess-crypto-assets-susceptibility-to-macroeconomics"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inverse correlation with Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s performance}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels that may attract buyers in Bitcoin and the major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin formed a long-legged doji candlestick pattern on May 10, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. The sellers resolved that to the downside with a break below the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/57aeeaf4-03d1-45c6-9bec-c64dac760164.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover with the 20-day exponential moving average ($28,142) slipping below the 50-day simple moving average ($28,496).\par \par \uc2 This along with the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory indicates that bears are in command. The next target on the downside is $25,250. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because it is the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 If BTC price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to drive the BTC/USDT pair above the resistance line. On the other hand, a break below $25,250 could open the doors for a potential downside of $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($1,866) on May 10, indicating that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/6bf45b24-7389-4c13-9ced-9833d7330db5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair broke and closed below the support line on May 11, indicating the resumption of the correction. The pair could next reach the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $1,663. This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will indicate that the bears may be losing their grip. ETH price may then reach the psychologically important level of $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) continued its southward journey and reached near the immediate support at $300. This level had acted as strong support on April 3 and March 15, hence the bulls will again try to defend it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/39384059-e131-4324-9b56-5952e7b1eca0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 In the near term, the $300 level may start a rebound but that is likely to face strong selling at the 20-day EMA ($319). That will enhance the prospects of a break below $300. The BNB/USDT pair could then slump toward the next strong support at $280.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up and breaks above the moving averages. The pair could then climb toward the overhead resistance at $338. For now, the pair may continue to swing inside the large range between $280 and $338.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to push and sustain XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above $0.43, indicating that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/cf03e613-57e3-4283-9b15-960e945edd09.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.45) and the RSI near the oversold territory indicate that bears are in control. Sellers will next try to sink the XRP/USDT pair below the $0.40 support. If they do that, the pair may complete a 100% retracement and plummet to $0.36.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if XRP price bounces off $0.40, the bulls will again try to push and sustain the pair above $0.43. Buyers will have to drive the price above the resistance line to signal the start of a sustained recovery.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) May 11 candlestick shows that the bulls are trying to buy the dips to the uptrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/8705018c-b0a2-4cdd-b280-a3b7715398ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.38) and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears have the upper hand. They will try to sell on any recovery attempt to the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair will again drop to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 The repeated retest of a support level tends to weaken it. A break below the uptrend line could pull tADA price to $0.33 and then to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if bulls thrust the price above the moving averages, Cardano pricecould rally to the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have managed to protect the $0.07 level for the past few days but they have not been able to start a relief rally in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ). This suggests that buying fizzles out at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/9d50d0d0-67f0-4046-b109-6c5d0492b88f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position further by pulling the price below $0.07. If they can pull it off, the DOGE/USDT pair could fall to $0.06. This level is likely to act as a support but the bears may pose a strong challenge at the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If DOGE price turns down from the downtrend line and breaks below $0.06, the selling could pick up momentum. The pair may then plunge to the critical support at $0.05. A break and close above the downtrend line will be the first sign that the selling pressure could be reducing.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has extended its decline below the breakdown level of $0.94. This has pulled the RSI into the oversold territory, indicating that the selling may have been overdone in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/c25baf61-f92c-4f7e-b671-75a934fdf8bb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The MATIC/USDT pair may turn up and retest the breakdown level of $0.94. This level is likely to witness a tussle between the bulls and the bears. If MATIC price turns down from $0.94, it will suggest that the bears have flipped the level into resistance. That will increase the possibility of a tumble to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if buyers kick the price above $0.94, it will suggest that the bulls are attempting a comeback. Polygon price may then recover to the resistance line where the bears will again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dive-liquidates-100m-btc-futures-traders-bullish"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin's dive under $27K liquidates $100M \u8212\'20\'14 So why aren't margin traders flipping \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22 ?}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the immediate support at $19.85 for the past four days. This shows that the bulls are buying the dips but they have not been able to start a meaningful recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/3544d28f-f663-4ba1-87a6-eb0f2691c9c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($21.56) has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative zone indicating that bears have a minor edge. If SOL price turns lower from the current level or the downtrend line, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative. The SOL/USDT pair may then descend to $18.70.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if bulls pierce the downtrend line, it will suggest that the pair is stuck inside the range between $19.85 and $27.12. The pair may first rise to $24 and thereafter attempt a rally to $27.12.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the strong support at $5.15 on May 10 but the bulls could not build upon this move. This suggests no takers at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/c40cb42d-52d6-4743-8e77-c60ac0daf6da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears used this opportunity and are trying to sink the price below the vital support at $5.15. If they manage to do that, it will suggest the start of the next leg of the down move. The DOT/USDT pair could then plummet to $4.50.\par \par \uc2 If DOT price reverses direction from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA ($5.68), it will suggest solid buying at lower levels. The pair may first rise to the 50-day SMA ($6.06) and thereafter rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) bounce off the strong support at $75 is facing strong selling near $82. This shows that bears are pouncing on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/79767b2f-d1ac-4515-813e-6629739f1d90.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will make another attempt to yank the price below $75. If they do that, the LTC/USDT pair could resume its downtrend and slide toward the crucial support at $65. Buyers are expected to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/e070e3e6-c660-432b-b584-57a872647578.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230512ej5c000ba\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/10: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,702 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The CPI numbers have attracted buying in Bitcoin and select altcoins, but the bears may get active near overhead resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 The United States consumer price index (CPI) rose 4.9% annually, which was slightly less than estimates of a 5% increase. The CPI\u8217\'20\'19s monthly rise of 0.4% in April was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/05/10/cpi-inflation-april-2023.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in line}}}\uc2  with expectations.\par \par \uc2 Although inflation remains stubbornly higher than the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s 2% target, traders will take comfort from the slower pace of increase. That suggests the Fed rate hikes are having an effect, and further rate hikes may not be necessary.\par \par \uc2 If the Fed pivots and starts to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-eyes-28k-push-as-traders-demand-cpi-day-btc-price-volatility"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cut rates, as the FedWatch Tool projects}}}\uc2 , that may be positive for risky assets such as equities and cryptocurrencies. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) responded positively to the CPI data and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-cracks-28k-on-cpi-amid-warning-us-inflation-highly-elevated"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rose above $28,000}}}\uc2  on May 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/582e87d9-fb29-4a89-9011-08d43e191aa8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 While the downside looks limited, the bulls may not have it easy at higher levels because of the high risk of a recession and the possibility of the banking crisis erupting again. That may keep the price stuck inside a range, which may act as a base for the next leg of the rally if or when that happens.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support and resistance levels to watch out for on Bitcoin and the major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke below the moving averages on May 7 and nosedived to the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on May 8. The bulls are trying to defend this level with vigor, but the recovery may face difficulties at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/61c7f209-58bd-4007-a6c0-c6a0d70c1ad6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to aggressively defend the zone between the moving averages and the resistance line. If the price turns down and breaks below the support line, the BTC/USDT pair could descend to the breakout level of $25,250.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to keep an eye on because if it cracks, the selling could intensify and the BTC price can plunge to the psychologically important level of $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls thrust the price above the resistance line, it will suggest that the corrective phase may be over. The pair could first rally to $30,000 and then attempt an up move to $32,400.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) at $1,887 and the support line for the past two days, but this tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/19b4deee-335f-43cc-9b91-3d954105b316.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price clears the hurdle at the moving averages, it will indicate strong buying at lower levels. The ETH/USDT pair will then try to climb to psychological resistance at $2,000. The bears are expected to fiercely defend this level, but if bulls overcome this barrier, the ETH price may soar to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price fails to sustain above the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are pouncing on every minor rally. A break below the support line could start a down move that may reach the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $1,663.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke below the triangle on May 7, indicating that the uncertainty resolved in favor of the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/13d08971-5919-4adc-9894-20bb0e3c0cb5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling intensified on May 8, and the BNB/USDT pair started its journey toward psychological support at $300. This level may attract buying, which could start a recovery to the 20-day EMA ($322).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level, it will enhance the prospects of a break below $300. The next support level is at $280.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the decline, they will have to push the BNB price back above the 20-day EMA. If they are successful, the pair may reach overhead resistance at $338.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) crashed below the $0.43 support level on May 8, but the long tail on the candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/f8448e7e-7d38-40b0-bd10-0cff7652271e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair is showing a tough battle near the breakdown level of $0.43. The bears are trying to flip the level into resistance while the bulls are attempting to push the price above it.\par \par \uc2 If the XRP price turns down from the current level and breaks below $0.40, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may pick up and the pair could drop to $0.36. This negative view will be invalidated in the short term if bulls kick the price above the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the $0.37 support level on May 8, indicating that bears are trying to seize control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/69b73365-3570-486c-b6ed-dc8a1e0798bb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to stall the decline near the uptrend line, but they are likely to face stiff resistance at the breakdown level of $0.37. If the price turns down from this level, it will suggest that the bears have flipped $0.37 into resistance.\par \par \uc2 That will enhance the prospects of a break below the uptrend line. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then start its decline to $0.33 and later to $0.30. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the moving averages. That will open the doors for a rally to $0.42.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) continued its downward journey and touched the solid support level of $0.07 on May 8. The bulls are trying to achieve a bounce off this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/b8eac6d4-b685-44d0-a1f7-c4e9f8079f2c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is likely to reach the downtrend line, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense. If the price turns down from this level, the bears will again try to sink the DOGE/USDT pair below the support level of $0.07. If they succeed, the pair may plunge to $0.06, which is not major support. If this level gives way, the pair may collapse to $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers thrust the price above the downtrend line, it will signal the start of a stronger recovery. DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s price may then rise to the overhead resistance zone of $0.10 to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) nosedived below the vital support level of $0.94 on May 8, indicating that the bears are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/5400655a-3ae3-4bcb-ac9e-09ea32fca0de.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sharp fall of the past few days pulled the relative strength index (RSI) into oversold territory, suggesting that a recovery is possible. The sellers will try to pounce on any relief rally and keep the price below the $0.94 level. If they do that, the MATIC/USDT pair could start its journey toward the strong support level of $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($0.98) will suggest that lower levels are attracting solid buying. That may trap several aggressive bears and propel the MATIC price toward the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/pepe-vs-doge-how-memecoins-performed-first-time-hitting-1b-market-cap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pepe vs. Doge: How memecoins performed first time hitting $1B market cap}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the downtrend line on May 6 and fell to the strong support level of $19.85 on May 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/3b192dde-91bb-4da7-8aaf-3c9d5220ac8a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to start a recovery, but the rebound lacks conviction. If Solana\u8217\'20\'19s price turns down from the current level and plunges below $19.85, the SOL/USDT pair may fall to $18.70. This level may again act as strong support.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent a decline, they will have to quickly drive the price above