ly to face selling at the 20-day EMA. If \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price turns down from this level, it will increase the likelihood of a break below $75. If that happens, the LTC/USDT pair could tumble to $65.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls drive LTC\u8217\'20\'19s price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure is reducing. The pair may first recover to the 50-day SMA ($90) and thereafter dash toward $96.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/784431b4-c75e-44bf-9c94-be6f03bce553.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230510ej5a000bf\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/10: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,672 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The CPI numbers have attracted buying in Bitcoin and select altcoins but the bears may get active near overhead resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 The United States consumer price index rose 4.9% annually, which was slightly less than estimates of a 5% increase. The CPI\u8217\'20\'19s monthly rise of 0.4% in April was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/05/10/cpi-inflation-april-2023.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in line}}}\uc2  with expectations.\par \par \uc2 Although inflation remains stubbornly higher than the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s 2% target range, traders will take comfort from the slower pace of increase. That suggests the Fed rate hikes are having their effect and further rate hikes may not be necessary.\par \par \uc2 If the Fed pivots and starts to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-eyes-28k-push-as-traders-demand-cpi-day-btc-price-volatility"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cut rates as the FedWatch Tool projects}}}\uc2 , that may be positive for risky assets such as equities and cryptocurrencies. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has responded positively to the CPI data and has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-cracks-28k-on-cpi-amid-warning-us-inflation-highly-elevated"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 risen above $28,000}}}\uc2  on May 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/582e87d9-fb29-4a89-9011-08d43e191aa8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While the downside looks limited, the bulls may not have it easy at higher levels because of the high risk of a recession and the possibility of the banking crisis erupting again. That may keep the price stuck inside a range, which may act as a base for the next leg of the rally when that happens.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support and resistance levels to watch out for on Bitcoin and the major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke below the moving averages on May 7 and nosedived to the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on May 8. The bulls are trying to defend this level with vigor but the recovery may face difficulties at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERL