INK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/cb69ad7e-35cd-4d8e-80a8-f8a925a3e3f4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($86) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears are in command. Any recovery attempt is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA. If \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price turns down from this level, it will increase the likelihood of a break below $75. If that happens, the LTC/USDT pair could tumble to $65.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls drive LTC price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure is reducing. The pair may first recover to the 50-day SMA ($90) and thereafter dash toward $96.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/784431b4-c75e-44bf-9c94-be6f03bce553.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230510ej5a0008h\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/5: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,723 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins have held up well, increasing the likelihood of an upside breakout.\par \par \uc2 Confidence in the United States financial system seems to be eroding fast, with investors trying to find the next weakest link that is about to collapse. \uc2 Bill Ackman\uc2 , CEO of hedge fund management firm \uc2 Pershing Square\uc2 , cautioned that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-drops-with-stocks-as-analyst-warns-of-banking-crisis-endgame"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 time was running out to fix the problem}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The U.S. equities markets have become vulnerable to adverse news on the regional banks, as seen from the sell-off in the past three days. Compared to that, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has held strong and is hovering near its critical overhead resistance at $31,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/64412b59-321b-4d33-9ef0-b12f859973e4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is not the only outperformer. Gold had risen close to its all-time high during the week. This shows that Bitcoin is currently behaving as a safe-haven asset and investors are adding it to their portfolios along with gold.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin overcome the barrier at $31,000 and extend the up move? Will the altcoins follow Bitcoin higher? Studying the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies can help answer these questions.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin continues to trade inside the symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. Usually, the trend that was in force before the formation of the triangle tends to resume. That means the price is likely to break out to the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/33d0411e-9391-4e10-85f2-3d3daa4ffa84.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price closes above the triangle, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to $32,400. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this level because if the bulls drive the price above $32,400, the rally could reach $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the resistance line, it will suggest that the pair may continue its random price action inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the triangle will indicate that the bears have overpowered the bulls. The pair may then tumble to $25,250.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on May 5. This shows that the bulls absorbed the supply and have come out on top.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/11a589ab-4f96-4623-9a36-2a29186df887.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above the triangle, the ETH/USDT pair could first rise to $2,000 and then attempt a rally to $2,200. The bears may aggressively defend this level because if they fail to do that, the pair may skyrocket toward $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and re-enters the triangle, it will suggest that the breakout may have been a bull trap. The pair may then once again drop to the support line. A break below this level may sink the pair to the target objective of $1,619.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/7830ff48-e8a3-4df2-a305-f7112a0e0b9b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) at $326 and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price breaks above the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT pair may continue to oscillate inside the triangle for some more time.\par \par \uc2 A break below the triangle will indicate that bears have seized control. That is likely to start a downward move to $300 and then to the pattern target of $280. If bulls want to gain the upper hand, they will have to propel the price above the triangle. That will clear the path for a possible rally to $350 and then $400.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on May 4 and a Doji candlestick pattern on May 5. This suggests that the bulls and the bears are playing it safe and are not waging large bets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/9d7d343a-b9d8-4cf0-b792-d63aab2de4df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the negative territory, signaling that bears have a slight edge. The bears will try to sink the price to the strong support level at $0.43.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA ($0.47), it will indicate solid buying at lower levels. The XRP/USDT pair may then rise to the resistance line. Buyers will have to overcome this resistance to open up the possibility of a rally to $0.54.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dipped below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $0.38 on May 3 and 5, but the long tail on the candlestick shows that the bulls are aggressively defending the support near $0.37.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/b6c814a8-bfa2-4a77-9fd9-38d205d37d5e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.39) on May 4, but the bears did not budge. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a minor advantage to the bears. If the price turns down and crumbles below $0.37, the selling could intensify and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may descend to $0.33 and then $0.30.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent this decline, they will have to quickly propel the price above the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern. That could increase the chances of a rally to $0.46 and later $0.52.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have managed to keep Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the immediate support near $0.08, but they have failed to achieve a meaningful bounce off it. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/aa372a7c-d9a0-446f-8c33-fd56fd1681c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A tight consolidation near a strong support level generally resolves to the downside. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.08) and the RSI in the negative zone also indicate that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the support near $0.08 gives way, the DOGE/USDT pair may tumble to the next major support level of $0.07. This negative view will invalidate in the near term if buyers thrust the DOGE price above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) attempted to rise above the 20-day EMA ($1.02) on May 3 and 4, but the bears successfully protected the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/b4d88ee0-319b-4c25-81f0-c27f624cf607.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near 43 suggest that the bears are in command. If the price turns down and breaks below $0.94, the MATIC/USDT pair will complete a descending triangle pattern. That could start a down move toward $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the lower levels continue to attract buyers. The pair could then rally to the resistance line where the bears are again likely to sell aggressively.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sui-price-drops-70-from-market-debut-top-amid-excessive-supply-concerns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SUI price drops 70% from market debut top amid excessive supply concerns}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range for the past three days. This suggests a state of indecision among the buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/00860d37-7241-4e1a-8922-b60440fbedbd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair may remain stuck inside the large range between $15.28 and $27.12 for some time. If the price slips and sustains below the 50-day SMA ($21.90), it will suggest that the bears have the upper hand in the near term. The pair could then slide to $18.70.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair may start its march toward $24 and then $27.12.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Sellers yanked Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the $5.70 support level on May 3, but the long tail shows solid buying at lower levels. The bulls again thwarted attempts by the bears to break the support on May 4 and 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/82025a96-ac88-4510-977b-0ee698370339.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The repeated failure to sustain the price below $5.70 may attract buyers. Bulls will then try to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($5.96). If they do that, the DOT/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($6.18). Buyers will have to overcome this hurdle to gain the upper hand in the near term. The next target on the upside is $7.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on minor rallies. The sellers will then again attempt to tug the price below $5.70 and challenge the crucial support at $5.15.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) May 3 and 5 candlestick shows that the bulls continue to guard the $85 level with vigor, but they are struggling to clear the overhead hurdle at the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/9de9cb02-8410-455c-92f0-63ade209c3ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USDT pair is stuck in a tight range as the bulls are buying on dips while the bears are selling on rallies. The 20-day EMA ($89) is sloping down and the RSI is just below the midpoint, suggesting a minor advantage to the bears. A break below the $85 level will indicate that bears have taken control. The pair may then collapse to $75.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if buyers propel the price above the moving averages, the pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $96. If the price turns down from this level, it will point to possible range-bound action between $85 and $96 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/cf81fd07-4d4c-4eb8-b54d-b64e80b7e910.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230505ej55000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/5: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,710 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins have held up well, increasing the likelihood of an upside breakout.\par \par \uc2 Confidence in the United Sta