ownsloping 20-day EMA ($0.08) and the RSI in the negative zone also indicate that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the support near $0.08 gives way, the DOGE/USDT pair may tumble to the next major support at $0.07. This negative view will invalidate in the near term if buyers thrust DOGE price above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) attempted to rise above the 20-day EMA ($1.02) on May 3 and 4 but the bears successfully protected the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/b4d88ee0-319b-4c25-81f0-c27f624cf607.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near 43 suggest that the bears are in command. If the price turns down and breaks below $0.94, the MATIC/USDT pair will complete a descending triangle pattern. That could start a down move toward $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the lower levels continue to attract buyers. The pair could then rally to the resistance line where the bears are again likely to sell aggressively.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sui-price-drops-70-from-market-debut-top-amid-excessive-supply-concerns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SUI price drops 70% from market debut top amid excessive supply concerns}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range for the past three days. This suggests a state of indecision among the buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/00860d37-7241-4e1a-8922-b60440fbedbd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair may remain stuck inside the large range between $15.28 and $27.12 for some time. If the price slips and sustains below the 50-day SMA ($21.90), it will suggest that the bears have the upper hand in the near term. The pair could then slide to $18.70.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair may start its march toward $24 and then $27.12.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Sellers yanked Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the $5.70 support on May 3 but the long tail shows solid buying at lower levels. The bulls again thwarted attempts by the bears to break the support on May 4 and 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/82025a96-ac88-4510-977b-0ee698370339.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The repeated failure to sustain the price below $5.70 may attract buyers. They will then try to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($5.96). If they do that, the DOT/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($6.18). Buyers will have to overcome this hurdle to gain the upper hand in the near term. The next target on the upside is $7.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on minor rallies. The sellers will then again attempt to tug the price below $5.70 and challenge the crucial support at $5.15.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) May 3 and 5 candlestick shows that the bulls continue to guard the $85 level with vigor but they are struggling to clear the overhead hurdle at the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/9de9cb02-8410-455c-92f0-63ade209c3ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USDT pair is stuck in a tight range as the bulls are buying on dips while the bears are selling on rallies. The 20-day EMA ($89) is sloping down and the RSI is just below the midpoint, suggesting a minor advantage to the bears. A break below the $85 level will indicate that bears have taken control. The pair may then collapse to $75.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if buyers propel the price above the moving averages, the pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $96. If the price turns down from this level, it will point to a possible range-bound action between $85 and $96 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/cf81fd07-4d4c-4eb8-b54d-b64e80b7e910.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230505ej55000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 PnL\par \b \uc2 What is profit and loss (PnL) and how to calculate it\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Dilip Kumar Patairya \par \uc2 1,953 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Understanding PnL helps traders realize the efficiency of their trades and make informed decisions. Find out what PnL is in crypto and how to calculate it\par \par \uc2 Anyone who has dealt with trading in traditional finance is likely to be aware of profit and loss (PnL). But is PnL in the cryptocurrency world the same? The ability to comprehend terms like mark-to-market (MTM), realized PnL and unrealized PnL will help develop a better understanding of the cryptocurrency a person holds.\par \par \uc2 Without a well-defined process to get insight into profit or loss, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/how-to-trade-cryptocurrencies-the-ultimate-beginners-guide"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cryptocurrency trading}}}\uc2  may be overwhelming, and traders may struggle with what they are doing. PnL reflects the change in the value of a trader\u8217\'20\'19s positions over a specific period.\par \par \uc2 To gain a clearer understanding, let's examine it in the context of cryptocurrency trading.\par \par \uc2 Understanding the basics of PnL\par \par \uc2 PnL in crypto refers to the calculation of the profit or loss made on a cryptocurrency investment or trading position. It is a metric used to evaluate the financial performance of a trader or investor in the crypto market.\par \par \uc2 To begin, here are some key terms in PnL terminology:\par \par \uc2 MTM\par \par \uc2 MTM\uc2  refers to the process of valuing an asset or financial instrument based on its current market price or fair value. For example, in the context of crypto trading, if an investor holds a certain amount of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), the value of that Bitcoin will fluctuate based on the current market price.\par \par \uc2 The general formula for calculating PnL is:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/abb5d64a-6ccb-48ec-b5b7-d2bf239e4b24.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Suppose the MTM price for Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) today is $1,970, while the MTM price yesterday was $1,950. In this case, the PnL is $20. It indicates a profit of $20. On the contrary, if the MTM price of ETH was $1,980 yesterday, it indicates a loss of $10.\par \par \uc2 Future value\par \par \uc2 Future value indicates the value of a digital coin at a future point in time.\par \par \uc2 For example, if a trader stakes Tron ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tron-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRX}}}\uc2  ) worth $1,000 with a 4% yearly reward, how much will the person get back after a year? The answer is $1,040. At the time of staking, the present value will be $1,000, while the future value will be $1,040.\par \par \uc2 There will be a present value at the point when the trader stakes, but if the person considers the future as a whole, there could be countless future values.\par \par \uc2 There is a different way to use future value as well. Traders could ask how much to stake to get $1,040 in a year. If they know the present and future values, they could calculate the discount factor. The formula for calculating the discount factor is:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/978954fe-674f-4ffc-b36b-442e5321b122.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 For the example given above, the discount factor will be:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/8bf97f0a-502d-4ead-90a4-42492d2cf6ef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Realized PnL\par \par \uc2 Realized PnL is calculated after traders have closed their position (sold the cryptocurrency they hold). Only the executed price of the orders is taken into account in realized PnL, and it has no direct relation to the mark price.\par \par \uc2 The mark price is the price at which a derivatives contract is valued based on the current market price of the underlying asset rather than the price at which the contract is being traded.\par \par \uc2 The formula for realized PnL is:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/66650fff-10fa-452e-a333-edbe6a239146.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 An example will help understand how to calculate realized PnL. If the entry price for buying X number of Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is $70 and the exit price is $105, the PnL for the period is $35, which refers to a profit of $35. However, if the closing price of the trade was $55, the PnL will be $15, but it will reflect a loss.\par \par \uc2 Unrealized PnL\par \par \uc2 Unrealized PnL refers to the profit or loss that is currently held in open positions but has not yet been realized through closing the position. The formula for determining unrealized PnL is:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/5ee1176d-d0ee-4a36-9e32-45b8835dc5f8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Donald has purchased ETH contracts with an average entry price of $1,900. The mark price of ETH is currently $1,600. The unrealized PnL for Donald is the difference between the average entry price and the mark price.\par \par \uc2 Unrealized PnL = $1,900 - $1,600 = $300\par \par \uc2 How to do PnL calculation\par \par \uc2 To determine PnL in cryptocurrency, a trader needs to find the difference between the initial cost of acquiring a digital coin and the current market value of the same coin. Various methods to calculate PnL in cryptocurrency are as follows:\par \par \uc2 First-in, first-out (FIFO) method\par \par \uc2 The FIFO method requires the seller to use the price of the asset from when it was first bought. Here is the process to calculate PnL using the FIFO method:\par \par \uc2 1) To settle on the initial cost of the cryptocurrency, multiply the purchase price per unit by the number of units sold.\par \par \uc2 2) To determine the current market value of the asset disposed of, multiply the current market price per unit by the number of units sold.\par \par \uc2 3) To find the PnL, deduct the initial cost from the current market value.\par \par \uc2 Suppose Bob first bought 1 ETH at $1,100 and a few days later bought 1 ETH at $800. A year later, he sold 1 ETH at $1,200. As he had first bought ETH at $1,100, this price will be considered the initial cost. Applying the FIFO method, Bob could calculate PnL as follows:\par \par \uc2 Bob's initial cost = (1 ETH x $1,100) = $1,100\par \par \uc2 Current market value = (1 ETH x $1,200) = $1,200\par \par \uc2 PnL = $1,200 - $1,100 = $100 (profit)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/fea66670-42cb-43b4-8b21-9e157f0448db.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Last-in, first-out (LIFO) method\par \par \uc2 The LIFO method requires the seller to use the most recent purchase price of an asset in the calculation. The other aspects are just like the FIFO method. Here is the PnL using the LIFO method using the same example as above:\par \par \uc2 Bob\u8217\'20\'19s initial cost = (1 ETH x $800) = $800\par \par \uc2 Current market value = (1 ETH x $1,200) = $1,200\par \par \uc2 PnL = $1,200 - $800 = $400 (profit)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/f1bf5941-7761-4e86-bfe1-a771f71c4f81.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Weighted average cost method\par \par \uc2 The weighted average cost method requires traders to determine the average cost of all units of a digital currency in their portfolio to arrive at the initial cost. Here are the steps to calculate PnL using this method:\par \par \uc2 1) Determine the total cost of all units of the cryptocurrency. Multiply the purchase price per unit for each transaction by the number of units of the asset and add the numbers.\par \par \uc2 2) To arrive at the weighted average cost per unit of the digital coin, divide the total cost of all units by the number of units.\par \par \uc2 3) Find the current market value of the cryptocurrency sold. Multiply the current market price per unit by the number of units sold.\par \par \uc2 4) To determine PnL, subtract the average cost per unit from the current market value.\par \par \uc2 Suppose Alice bought 1 BTC at $1,500 and a few days later bought 1 BTC at $2,000. She later sold 1 BTC at $2,400. Here is the PnL using the weighted average cost method:\par \par \uc2 Total cost = (1 BTC x $1,500) + (1 BTC x $2,000) = $3,500\par \par \uc2 Weighted average cost = $3,500 / 2 BTC = $1,750\par \par \uc2 Current market value = (1 BTC x $2,400) = $2,400\par \par \uc2 PnL = $2,400 - $1,750 = $650 (profit)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/2072a24d-de5d-4e96-8514-63c9e7233a07.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Profits/losses from opening and closing positions\par \par \uc2 Analyzing open and closed positions at regular intervals is an efficient way to monitor performance. An initial purchase a person makes in the market is an open position, while selling the cryptocurrency is termed closing the position. If a trader buys 10 DOT, it is an open position. When the trader sells those DOT, the position gets closed.\par \par \uc2 For example, if a trader bought 10 DOT for $70 and sold them for $100, the person\u8217\'20\'19s PnL would be $30 ($100 - $70). Regular analysis of trades in line with open and closed positions helps a person trade in an organized manner.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/6472c192-2c28-4cf9-977f-7a8b3f593688.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Year-to-date (YTD) calculation\par \par \uc2 YTD is a way to measure the performance of investments made in cryptocurrency from the start of the year to the current date. Investors who regularly buy and hold cryptocurrencies for years can know their unrealized profits with a YTD calculation. The trader just needs to calculate the value of the portfolio at the beginning and end of a year and compare these values. This could be a calendar year or fiscal year, depending on the person\u8217\'20\'19s preference or requirements.\par \par \uc2 Suppose someone holds $1,000 worth of Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) on Jan. 1, 2022 and $1,600 of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Jan. 1, 2023. In this case, $600 is the unrealized profit. Unrealized profit denotes returns that haven\u8217\'20\'19t yet been converted into cash or cash equivalents such as term deposits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/064984bc-f981-4fab-8c45-d52f0dfe3957.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Transaction-based calculation\par \par \uc2 A transaction-based calculation requires a person to calculate the PnL for each specific transaction. For instance, if a person bought 1 ETH for $1,000 and sold it for $1,500, the PnL for the transaction would be $500 profit ($1,500 - $1,000). If the number of transactions is small and a trader needs to calculate PnL for these transactions separately, a transaction-based calculation is an ideal method.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/10850130-3818-4b6d-9ea9-c5fb93aa8646.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Percentage profit\par \par \uc2 The percentage profit method reflects the PnL as a percentage of the initial cost. An example will help understand better. Suppose a trader buys 1 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) for $300 and sells it for $390. In this case, the person\u8217\'20\'19s PnL would be $90 profit ($390 - $300). To arrive at the percentage profit, the trader needs to divide the PnL by the purchase price and multiply the amount by 100 (($90 / $300) x 100). This amounts to 30%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/284af4bd-fa55-4013-b87d-c7322bc635a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 However, please note that these are simplified examples that do not factor in variables such as taxes, trading fees paid to the platform, market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , etc. In real-life situations, a trader will need to take into account the specific context when calculating PnL.\par \par \uc2 How to calculate PnL of perpetual contracts\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-are-perpetual-futures-contracts-in-cryptocurrency"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Perpetual contracts}}}\uc2  are a type of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/crypto-derivatives"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 futures contract}}}\uc2  with no fixed settlement time or expiration date. Traders can hold their long or short positions indefinitely, provided they have sufficient maintenance margin, which is the minimal amount of collateral needed for maintaining open trading positions.\par \par \uc2 When traders calculate the PnL of perpetual contracts in cryptocurrencies, they need to calculate both realized and unrealized PnL and then add them to determine the total PnL.\par \par \uc2 Here are the steps to measure PnL of perpetual contracts:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/61e57253-87ae-4090-83fa-1a873ebaf37e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/363cf33a-97a4-4640-983b-c034ab71a040.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/7f70911d-7601-4003-96f2-bad307956714.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Again, this is a simplified way to explain the concept of calculating PnL for crypto perpetual contracts. When calculating total PnL in real life, a trader needs to take into account factors like trading fees and funding rates.\par \par \uc2 PnL calculations and associated tools\par \par \uc2 Understanding crypto PnL helps people know if their cryptocurrency portfolio is in profit or in loss. Gaining an insight into key parameters like cost basis, quantity, price of each trade and profitability of the portfolio helps traders assess the efficiency of their strategies and make necessary adjustments. Precise knowledge of the funds they have made or lost on a particular trade influences their upcoming trading decisions for the better.\par \par \uc2 Apart from PnL calculations, there are tools like specialized spreadsheets and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/are-crypto-trading-bots-legit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 automated trading bots}}}\uc2  that could help traders analyze their performances and zero in on profitable trading opportunities, regardless of their experience.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/0048351f-b6a1-48a3-ad71-957ae12a3659.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230505ej550002w\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/3: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,690 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to fiercely defend the respective support in Bitcoin and select altcoins if they want to resume the recovery.\par \par \uc2 Investors seem to have priced in a 25-basis-points rate hike by the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  on May 3. Next, they will look for clues on the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s actions for the rest of the year.\par \par \uc2 Will the Fed maintain its hawkish stance as inflation still remains well above its target range, or will the bank troubles and looming recession make the central bank signal a pause in its rate hikes?\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 World Economic Forum\uc2 's \u8220\'20\'1CChief Economists Outlook\u8221\'20\'1D report released on May 1 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/05/03/after-first-republics-rescue-economists-predict-further-pain.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows}}}\uc2  that 80% of the chief economists surveyed believe that central banks have to maintain a delicate balance between \u8220\'20\'1Cmanaging inflation and maintaining financial sector stability.\u8221\'20\'1D The economists anticipate that the central banks will find it difficult to bring down inflation to their target levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/011a7e2c-121a-4992-b17b-55da49870db9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-average-person-s-wealth-will-be-completely-destroyed-by-inflation-says-arthur-hayes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 an exclusive interview with Cointelegraph}}}\uc2 , \uc2 Arthur Hayes\uc2 , the co-founder and former CEO of crypto derivatives exchange BitMEX, cautioned investors that investing in assets \u8220\'20\'1Coutside of the traditional financial system\u8221\'20\'1D is the only way out if they want to preserve their capital.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and altcoins start an up-move after bouncing off key support levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern in Bitcoin. Generally, a symmetrical triangle acts as a continuation pattern and the price breaks out in the direction that was prevalent before the formation developed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/e235bd39-e382-49c8-8f7b-ab56968eae03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, it is better to wait for the price to complete the breakout before waging any new bets because sometimes, the setup behaves as a reversal pattern.\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($28,642) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below the triangle, it will suggest the start of a short-term corrective phase. The BTC/USDT pair may drop to $25,250. This level is likely to witness aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price bounces off the support line and breaks above the 20-day EMA, the pair may rise to the resistance line. A break and close above the triangle will open the doors for a potential rally to $32,400.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) jumped off the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on May 1, indicating that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/3e8a5a3c-2528-4044-a2eb-d18a135cf3d2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price above the moving averages and challenge the resistance line. If buyers kick the price above the triangle, the ETH/USDT pair may rally to $2,131. There is minor resistance at $2,000, but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears will make another attempt to sink the pair below the triangle. If they succeed in their endeavor, the pair may plunge to the pattern target of $1,619.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck inside the symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/ab9ae71a-323d-4751-952b-d56ced32dc76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to guard the support line of the triangle. If they manage to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($326), the BNB/USDT pair could rise to the resistance line. Traders will have to overcome this obstacle to signal the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price collapses below the triangle, it will suggest that the uncertainty has resolved in favor of the bears. The pair may then slide to $300 and thereafter extend the fall to the pattern target of $280.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the May 1 and 2 candlesticks shows that the bulls tried to start a recovery in XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ). However, they could not sustain the buying pressure, and the price turned lower on May 3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/2fa936de-39ff-4a00-af28-dc00c6456d22.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to extend the decline to the strong support at $0.43. This remains the key level to watch for in the near term. If this support crumbles, the XRP/USDT pair may drop to $0.36. This level is likely to attract aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up from $0.43 and breaks above the 20-day EMA ($0.47), it will signal that bulls are on a comeback. The pair could then rally to the resistance line. If buyers surmount this hurdle, the pair may surge to $0.54.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls held Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($0.38) on May 2, but they failed to overcome the obstacle at the 20-day EMA ($0.39).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/f0455ad6-6bec-42bc-8893-7a974ec34d8f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pounce on this opportunity and close the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below the 50-day SMA. There is minor support at $0.37, but if that cracks, the selling could pick up momentum, and the pair may slump to $0.33 and later to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 The important resistance on the upside is the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern. Buyers will have to drive the price above this level to signal a potential trend change in the near term. The pair can then surge to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is struggling to bounce off the strong support near $0.08, which suggests a lack of demand from the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/24f6f2ca-5c26-4f2a-bc3b-375b4b5e6037.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.08) is sloping down, and the RSI is below 42, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the support near $0.08 is breached, the DOGE/USDT pair could plummet to the next major support at $0.07.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent this decline, they will have to quickly push the price above the downtrend line. The pair may then rally to $0.09 and thereafter dash toward the stiff overhead resistance at $0.11.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $0.94 support on May 2, indicating that the bulls are trying to aggressively protect the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/7a3a7cbb-d63f-499b-80b8-1562e2e1ed6d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1.02) is sloping down, and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that the sentiment remains negative. Sellers will try to stall the recovery at the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the MATIC/USDT pair may turn down and fall to $0.94.\par \par \uc2 The repeated retest of a support level within a short interval tends to weaken it. If this support gives way, the selling could intensify, and the pair may nosedive to $0.69. Buyers will have to kick the price above the resistance line to invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/litecoin-price-poised-for-700-gains-vs-bitcoin-says-charlie-lee"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin price poised for 700% gains vs. Bitcoin, says Charlie Lee}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers defended the 50-day SMA ($21.78) on May 2, but they could not propel Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($22.26). This shows that the bears are selling on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/572386c5-700d-4dbf-87f8-bcca1b18808e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price below the 50-day SMA. If they sustain the breakdown, the SOL/USDT pair could reach the next strong support at $18.70. The possibility of a bounce off this level remains high. If that happens, the pair may stay range-bound between $18.70 and $27.12 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are attempting a comeback. The pair could then rally to $24 and later dash to the overhead resistance at $27.12.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the $5.70 support on May 1, and the bears are trying to build upon this advantage on May 3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/10e36cd2-765b-4685-8d4e-f88a9e0f3919.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted a recovery on May 2, but the shallow bounce showed a lack of aggressive buying near $5.70. This suggests that the DOT/USDT pair may continue lower and reach the crucial support at $5.15.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bulls. If they want to start a sustained recovery, they will have to quickly push the price above the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the pair may pick up momentum and rally toward $7.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) is getting squeezed between the 20-day EMA ($89) and the horizontal support at $85. The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that bears hold the edge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/7186a848-35de-40ec-8f2f-0fa35d3687b4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears tug the price below $85, the selling could intensify, and the LTC/USDT pair may plunge to the strong support at $75. The bulls are expected to defend this level with all their might because a break below it will open the doors for a further drop to $65.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price rebounds off the current level and rises above the moving averages. Such a move will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The pair may then rise to $96 and above it to $106.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/c87cd185-09ea-4273-ba75-04f01a0a2557.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230503ej53000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/1: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,766 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and several top altcoins need help from bulls at some crucial support levels.\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan Chase\uc2  emerged as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jpmorgan-first-republic-bank-acquisition"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the winner in the auction}}}\uc2  to acquire the deposits and a \u8220\'20\'1Csubstantial majority of assets\u8221\'20\'1D of troubled bank \uc2 First Republic\uc2 . This marked the failure of the third regional bank in the United States since March and laid bare the vulnerabilities in the legacy banking system.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has risen for four consecutive months from January through April, a feat it last achieved in 2013. Will the recovery extend in May?\par \par \uc2 Historical data does not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears in May. The performance is split right in the middle with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/2nd-biggest-us-bank-failure-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 five positive and five negative monthly closes}}}\uc2  in May, according to Coinglass data.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/ce95751e-e09e-406c-ae0a-3f111825910a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 The recovery in Bitcoin is facing a stiff hurdle above $30,000, indicating that the bulls are wary of buying at higher levels. That could be because of the upcoming Fed meeting on May 2 and 3, which is known to cause an increase in short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 What are the levels that the bulls need to defend on Bitcoin and select altcoins if they want to keep the chances alive for the continuation of the up move? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) bounced off the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) at 4,035 on April 26 and has reached the overhead resistance of 4,200 on May 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/e4ffa04c-aeaf-493e-a1ac-5b25a08f2297.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are expected to mount a strong defense in the zone between 4,200 and 4,325. If the price turns down from the overhead zone but does not fall below the moving averages, it would suggest that the sentiment is turning positive and traders are buying the dips.\par \par \uc2 That would increase the likelihood of a break above 4,325. If that happens, the index could accelerate toward 4,500 and then 4,650.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to gain the upper hand, they will have to quickly yank the price below the 50-day SMA. That could sink the index to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 After trading between the 100.82 support and the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of 101.93 for the past few days, the U.S. dollar index (DXY) is trying to break out of the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/113473e3-e090-496b-9dbf-7c759f07a86e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has been gradually rising toward the center, indicating that the selling pressure is reducing. If buyers sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the index could rally to the 50-day SMA (103.05).\par \par \uc2 Such a move would suggest that the index may extend its stay inside the 100.82 to 106 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to strengthen their position further, they will have to tug the price below 100.82. That would complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern, starting a possible downtrend toward 97.50.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s April 30 candlestick chart shows that the bears are aggressively defending the overhead resistance at $30,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/ad6b2f2e-fe20-41da-99db-4a445a6bfe16.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down and slumped on May 1 but a minor positive is that the bulls are fiercely protecting the 50-day SMA ($28,146). This suggests that the BTC/USDT pair may {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/will-28k-bitcoin-price-hold-two-indicators-remain-solid-despite-5-pullback"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 swing between $26,942 and $30,000 for a while}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Usually, a tight range of trading is followed by a range expansion. If the price continues lower and plunges below $26,942, the pair may decline to the crucial support level of $25,250.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the range expands above $30,000, the pair is likely to rise to $31,000 and thereafter to $32,400. A break above this level would signal a pickup in momentum.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($1,896), indicating that the bears are trying to flip this level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/59996d7b-35a0-42bc-a285-12a02629a47d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down gradually and the RSI has dipped below 45, indicating that bears have a slight edge. If bears sink the price and keep it below $1,785, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $1,663.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will again try to propel the pair above the psychological level of $2,000. If they succeed, the pair can rally to the stiff overhead resistance level of $2,200.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($323) on April 30, indicating that the bulls continue to guard this level with full force.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/6d76c43b-b8a6-41c9-97ca-221117f7fe39.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision among the buyers and sellers. The 20-day EMA ($328) is sloping up gradually and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating a minor advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive the price above the triangle, it would signal the start of a new up move. The BNB/USDT pair could then rally to the pattern target of $380 and subsequently to $400.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to sink the pair below the support line of the triangle and deepen the correction to $280.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) recovery hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($0.47) on April 29, which suggests that the sentiment is negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/d469b00c-f355-448a-825d-94ded1273566.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to the strong support level of $0.43. This is an important level to keep an eye on because if it cracks, the XRP/USDT pair may collapse to the next major support level of $0.36.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. Such a move would suggest that the bears are losing their grip. That could open the doors for a possible rally to the resistance line. If bulls overcome this barrier, the pair could surge toward $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers are finding it difficult to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the neckline, indicating that the bears are fiercely protecting the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/96638099-9686-4e5d-ba3b-766678cf8ca7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to slip below the 50-day SMA ($0.38). The RSI is in negative territory and the 20-day EMA ($0.40) is flattening out, indicating that bears are trying to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price plunges below $0.37, the selling could intensify and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may descend to the next support level of $0.33.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to cross the obstacle at the neckline to set up a retest of $0.46. A break above this level would signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/meta-sec-filing-reveals-debt-securities-offering-plans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Meta SEC filing reveals debt securities offering plans}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) is facing selling by the bears on relief rallies while the bulls are trying to defend support at $0.94.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/09fcb8bf-2f84-43d0-b58e-2ead66dc3e9d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This tight trading range is unlikely to continue for long. The down-sloping 20-day EMA ($1.03) and the RSI in negative territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If bears tug the price below $0.94, the MATIC/USDT pair could nosedive toward $0.69.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it would suggest the start of a stronger recovery. The pair may then rise to the resistance line, where the bulls will again face stiff pressure from the bears.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.08) on April 30, indicating that the sentiment is negative 