y, if the bulls catapult the price above $27.12, the next stop could be as high as $39.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/4e599c0e-8319-42e6-8bd7-880e110e817d.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230501ej51000e4\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/1: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,757 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 May 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and several top altcoins need help from bulls at some crucial support levels.\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan Chase\uc2  emerged as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jpmorgan-first-republic-bank-acquisition"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 winner in the auction}}}\uc2  to acquire the deposits and a \u8220\'20\'1Csubstantial majority of assets\u8221\'20\'1D of the troubled bank \uc2 First Republic\uc2 . This marked the failure of the third regional bank in the United States since March and laid open the vulnerabilities in the legacy banking system.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has risen for four consecutive months from January through April, a feat it last achieved in 2013. Will the recovery extend in May?\par \par \uc2 Historical data does not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears in May. The performance is split right in the middle with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/2nd-biggest-us-bank-failure-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 five positive and five negative monthly closes}}}\uc2  in May, according to Coinglass data.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/ce95751e-e09e-406c-ae0a-3f111825910a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The recovery in Bitcoin is facing a stiff hurdle above $30,000, indicating that the bulls are wary of buying at higher levels. That could be because of the upcoming Fed\u8217\'20\'19s meeting on May 2 and 3, which is known to cause an increase in short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 What are the levels that the bulls need to defend on Bitcoin and select altcoins if they want to keep the chances alive for the continuation of the up-move? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) bounced off the 50-day simple moving average (4,035) on April 26 and has reached the overhead resistance of 4,200 on May 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/e4ffa04c-aeaf-493e-a1ac-5b25a08f2297.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are expected to mount a strong defense in the zone between 4,200 and 4,325. If the price turns down from the overhead zone but does not fall below the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment is turning positive and traders are buying the dips.\par \par \uc2 That will increase the likelihood of a break above 4,325. If that happens, the index could accelerate toward 4,500 and then 4,650.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to gain the upper hand, they will have to quickly yank the price below the 50-day SMA. That could sink the index to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 After trading between the 100.82 support and the 20-day exponential moving average (101.93) for the past few days, the U.S. dollar index (DXY) is trying to break out of the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/113473e3-e090-496b-9dbf-7c759f07a86e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has been gradually rising toward the center, indicating that the selling pressure is reducing. If buyers sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the index could rally to the 50-day SMA (103.05).\par \par \uc2 Such a move will suggest that the index may extend its stay inside the 100.82 to 106 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to strengthen their position further, they will have to tug the price below 100.82. That will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern, starting a possible downtrend toward 97.50.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s April 30 candlestick shows that the bears are aggressively defending the overhead resistance at $30,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/ad6b2f2e-fe20-41da-99db-4a445a6bfe16.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down and slumped on May 1 but a minor positive is that the bulls are fiercely protecting the 50-day SMA ($28,146). This suggests that the BTC/USDT pair may {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/will-28k-bitcoin-price-hold-two-indicators-remain-solid-despite-5-pullback"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 swing between $26,942 and $30,000 for a while}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Usually, a tight-range trading is followed by a range expansion. If the price continues lower and plunges below $26,942, the pair may decline to the crucial support at $25,250.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the range expands above $30,000, the pair is likely to rise to $31,000 and thereafter to $32,400. A break above this level will signal a pick-up in momentum.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($1,896), indicating that the bears are trying to flip this level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/59996d7b-35a0-42bc-a285-12a02629a47d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down gradually and the RSI has dipped below 45, indicating that bears have a slight edge. If bears sink and sustain the price below $1,785, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $1,663.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will again try to propel the pair above the psychological level of $2,000. If they succeed, the pair can rally to the stiff overhead resistance of $2,200.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($323) on April 30, indicating that the bulls continue to guard this level with full force.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/6d76c43b-b8a6-41c9-97ca-221117f7fe39.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern,