r could then slump to the strong support at $18.70. Buyers are likely to guard this level with force. If the price rebounds off $18.70, the bulls will again try to clear the hurdle at $24.\par \par \uc2 If they can pull it off, the pair will attempt a rally to $27.12. A downturn from this level may result in rangebound price action between $27.12 and $18.70 for some time. Alternatively, if the bulls catapult the price above $27.12, the next stop could be as high as $39.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-05/4e599c0e-8319-42e6-8bd7-880e110e817d.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230501ej51000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/28: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,755 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 April 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins continue to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near their respective resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-retargets-29k-after-mt-gox-panic-liquidates-320m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sharp \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  on April 26}}}\uc2  on rumors that large sums of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) were on the move from the wallets linked to the defunct cryptocurrency exchange \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  and the \uc2 United States government\uc2 . A minor positive is that Bitcoin and select altcoins held their respective support levels.\par \par \uc2 After Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sharp rally in 2023, some traders seem to be planning to book profits. Coinglass reported that the Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sell-off-next-binance-btc-balance-shoots-up-1-5b-in-1-month"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 balance held at Binance soared by 50,000 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  in the past 30 days.\par \par \uc2 While this could add to short-term pressure, bulls can take solace because the increase is not identical across exchanges. Coinglass said that the aggregate increase of Bitcoin balance across exchanges was 14,000 Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/02e9f306-2c12-485f-99f8-45f1bcdb83e4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The next major event for the market is likely to be the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s meeting on May 2 and 3. The FedWatch Tool {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-gdp-misses-goal-as-bitcoin-price-seeks-to-erase-ultra-nasty-7-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 projects a 90% probability}}}\uc2  of a 25 basis point rate hike in the meeting. Most analysts expect this to be the final rate hike before a pivot later in the year.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and select altcoins break above their respective resistance levels and resume the up-move? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin formed a long-legged {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-is-a-doji-candle-pattern-and-how-to-trade-with-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 doji candlestick}}}\uc2  pattern on April 26, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move. This uncertainty resolved to the upside with a close above the 20-day exponential moving average ($28,619) on April 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/c97eb608-01c8-4125-a00a-3c068706c18a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA while the bulls will attempt to flip the level into support. If buyers succeed, the BTC/USDT pair will try to challenge the overhead resistance zone between $31,000 and $32,400. This zone is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and slips below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the sentiment is turning negative and traders are selling on rallies. The pair may then retest the strong support at the 50-day simple moving average ($27,657). A break and close below this level could open the gates for a decline to $25,250.\par \par \uc2 ETH price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls kicked Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($1,905) on April 26 and 27 but they could not reach the psychological level of $2,000. This suggests that the bears are trying to halt the recovery below $2,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/6b7ff5c5-8743-4138-9f35-4124e6521f5a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This points to a possible range-bound action between $2,000 and $1,785 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, it will be a positive sign because it will indicate that the bulls are not rushing to book profits. That will enhance the prospects for a potential rally to $2,200. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below $1,785. The ETH/USDT pair could then collapse to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $1,663.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls propelled BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the $338 overhead resistance on April 26 but they could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/3bd3eea5-3006-45af-a4c2-e021f5262aa1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls again tried to overcome the obstacle at $338 on April 27 but the bears did not budge. The selling picked up momentum on April 28 and the bears are trying to sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($321). If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could dive to $300 and thereafter to $280.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price rebounds off the current level, it will indicate that bulls have not given up and are buying on dips. The bulls will have to surmount the hurdle at $350 to signal the start of a new uptrend toward $400.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support at $0.43 on April 26, indicating that the bulls are fiercely guarding this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/41ae39d3-cf20-4da9-b98e-6beb7dbaeb59.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the 20-day EMA ($0.48), which is an important level for the bears to defend in the near term. If the price turns down from this level, the sellers will again try to yank the price below $0.43. If they manage to do that, the XRP/USDT pair may plunge to $0.36.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair can reach the resistance line. A break and close above this level will suggest that the short-term corrective phase is over. The pair will then attempt a rally to $0.54 and subsequently to $0.58.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($0.38) on April 25 and 26, indicating that buyers are trying to start a recovery from this support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/e99559cd-050e-4262-a3d2-7ebeef2c29e1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair has reached the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders pattern where the bears are trying to halt the recovery. If buyers overpower the sellers and sustain the price above the neckline, the pair should rally to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the neckline, it will suggest that the bears are trying to prevent the reversal pattern from forming. The sellers will then make another attempt to sink the price below the 50-day SMA. If they can pull it off, the pair could dump to $0.34.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the support near $0.08 on April 26 but they failed to build upon the breakdown. Buyers purchased the dip and pushed the price back above the 50-day SMA ($0.08) on April 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/296fd289-a437-4b2b-92ce-012a6b05179d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The next resistance to watch out for is the 20-day EMA ($0.08) and then the downtrend line. Buyers will have to propel the price above the downtrend line to clear the path for a possible rally to the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to sink the price back below the support near $0.08. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair may slide to the vital support near $0.07. The bulls are likely to protect this level with all their might.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) April 25 and 26 candlestick shows that the bulls are defending the support at $0.94 with vigor but the bears have not yet given up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/cabefd5b-95da-4a23-b3e3-88735f02afc9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($1.05) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have the upper hand. Sellers will try to halt the recovery in the zone between the 20-day EMA and the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the resistance line, it will signal the formation of a potential descending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break below $0.94. If this support cracks, the MATIC/USDT pair risks a plunge to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-holds-29k-as-us-pce-data-sparks-90-fed-rate-hike-bets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price holds $29K as US PCE data sparks 90% Fed rate hike bets}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) tried to break out of the tight range trading on April 26 but failed. The bulls are again trying to resolve the uncertainty in their favor on April 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/07d1b93e-bdb8-417a-b0d2-936d153e52e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rises above the immediate resistance at $23.18, it will signal that the bulls have absorbed the supply. The SOL/USDT pair will then attempt a rally toward the stiff overhead resistance at $27.12, which remains the key level for the bulls to overcome. If they do that, the pair can start a new up-move and soar to $39.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the rally, they will have to quickly tug the price below the $18.70 support. That can sink the pair to the next support at $15.28.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears successfully defended the moving averages on April 26 but could not sustain the drop below the support at $5.70. This indicates that Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is finding buyers at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/c8ee9da7-258f-4858-89ad-2e9d1a01bb73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair can swing between $5.70 and the 50-day SMA ($6.20) for some time. If the consolidation resolves to the downside, the selling could intensify and the pair may fall to $5.15. This level is likely to attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if buyers drive the price above the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that the bulls are on a comeback. The pair may first climb to $7 and if this resistance is scaled, the rally could stretch to $7.90.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) witnessed a hugely volatile day on April 26, indicating that the bulls and the bears tried to gain complete control but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/9e3dcf65-ec9d-441e-8a7e-4d941b899425.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Usually, large volatile days are followed by a range contraction for a few days. The flattish moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a range-bound action in the near term. The LTC/USDT pair may oscillate between $85 and $96 for some time.\par \par \uc2 A break above $96 or below $85 will start the next leg of the trending move. If bears sink the price below $85, the pair may plummet to $75. On the other hand, a rally above $96 may open the gates for a possible rally to $106.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/d59ff025-4401-4e6c-895e-d89932dd0e38.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230428ej4s000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
