\par\par \b \uc2 Bit4You Suspends Activities After CoinLoan Declared Insolvent\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 463 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 April 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Belgian cryptocurrency trading platform Bit4You has announced the suspension of operations after it discovered that CoinLoan, one of its service providers, was declared insolvent by an Estonian court.\par \par \uc2 The CoinLoan Insolvency\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency trading platform learned about CoinLoan\u8217\'20\'19s insolvency issues on the 24th of April. According to a blog post published by the crypto lender, it learned that CoinLoan no longer had the necessary registration to qualify as a \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  custodian. The blog post stated,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe would like to inform you that we recently learned that one of our major service providers, CoinLoan, based in Estonia, no longer has the required registration as custodian of virtual currencies. Following this, we immediately took several steps to understand the nature and scope of this situation.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 However, Bit4you added that it does not have any reason to believe that the funds it held with CoinLoan would not be recovered.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe were informed that a court decision of insolvency was issued against CoinLoan on Monday, the 24th of April 2023, in Estonia. However, to date, we have no indication that the virtual currencies held on behalf of our customers with CoinLoan will not be recovered, especially in view of the message published by CoinLoan on the 25th of April 2023.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Estonian authorities issued a stop order on the 24th of April, preventing CoinLoan from releasing assets in the absence of a \u8220\'20\'1Ctemporary insolvency practitioner.\u8221\'20\'1D In June 2022, CoinLoan had capped withdrawals at $5000 for 24 hours in an attempt to stave off a run on its funds following the collapse of the Terra ecosystem. CoinLoan published a message to its users stating,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA Notice of restraint on disposition received yesterday, the 24th of April, 2023, obliges CoinLoan to halt all operations for its users, including withdrawals. This action is unexpected and has an immediate effect. As a result, we have no choice but to comply with the said requirements. We are doing everything in our power to resolve this situation as quickly as possible.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bit4You Assets On CoinLoan\par \par \uc2 In an effort to ensure transparency and keep users in the loop, Bit4You listed out the assets and how much of them it had on CoinLoan. This includes 1097.5 ETH worth $2.1 million, 145 BTC worth $4.2 million, and 501 BNB worth around $166,00. Other assets Bit4You held on the platform include \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , CLT, DOT, LINK, LTC, USDT, XLM, XRP, and XMR.\par \par \uc2 Bit4You assured users that it was doing everything in its power to resolve the situation without risking any funds and protecting the interest of its clients.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020230428ej4s0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Belgian crypto platform Bit4You suspends operations after CoinLoan halts activity\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By   Tristan Greene \par \uc2 413 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 April 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The crypto platform has paused operations and withdrawals amid regulatory action against partnering service provider CoinLoan.\par \par \uc2 Belgian cryptocurrency trading platform Bit4You has suspended all operations, including withdrawals, amid an insolvency investigation of one of its key partners.\par \par \uc2 Suite \u224\'00\'E0 cela, nous avons imm\u233\'00\'E9diatement entam\u233\'00\'E9 plusieurs d\u233\'00\'E9marches pour comprendre la nature et la port\u233\'00\'E9e de cette situation.\par \par \uc2 En savoir plus - {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/wg7iHqN9jt"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/wg7iHqN9jt}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Bit4you (@Bit4you1) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Bit4you1/status/1651263959440277508?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 April 26, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 The company {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://bit4you.medium.com/suspention-des-activit%C3%A9s-7376a2fe90da"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 explained}}}\uc2  the freeze in a blog post, claiming it was a necessary action to protect platform users and citing \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  against CoinLoan, a partnering cryptocurrency loan service based in Estonia:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe would like to inform you that we recently learned that one of our major service providers, Estonia-based CoinLoan, no longer had the required registration as a custodian of virtual currencies.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Estonian regulatory authorities {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ametlikudteadaanded.ee/ee/Harju%20Maakohus%20Tallinna%20kohtumaja/pankrotimenetlus/kasutuskeelu-teatavakstegemine/2023/4/24/2065591"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 issued}}}\uc2  a stop order on April 24 prohibiting CoinLoan from processing or releasing assets without the expressed consent of an appointed \u8220\'20\'1Ctemporary insolvency practitioner.\u8221\'20\'1D This prohibits the platform from moving, releasing, or disposing of assets or otherwise processing transactions without such permission.\par \par \uc2 Bit4You claims, as of April 26, that it has \u8220\'20\'1Cno indication that virtual currencies held on behalf of our customers with CoinLoan will not be recoverable.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A blog post from CoinLoan, cited by the Bit4You team in its announcement, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinloan.io/blog/important-message-to-all-coinloaners/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 states}}}\uc2  that the company believes it has the capability to meet its obligations:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COur legal team has provided sufficient arguments to prove CoinLoan's ability to fulfill its obligations. The appointment of the interim trustee seems to be the easiest way for the court to find a solution by letting an independent third party verify the financial situation of the company.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The post also mentions that the Estonian court\u8217\'20\'19s action was \u8220\'20\'1Cunexpected\u8221\'20\'1D and would have an immediate effect.\par \par \uc2 Among the current list of Bit4You user and company assets locked up in the CoinLoan suspension order is more than 145 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), worth in excess of $4 million at the time of this article\u8217\'20\'19s publication. Per the company\u8217\'20\'19s blog post, this represents more than 81% of the organization\u8217\'20\'19s total BTC assets.\par \par \uc2 Also frozen are 638,630 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ); 1,247,519 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ); 1,097 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ); and numerous other tokens.\par \par \uc2 CoinLoan has signaled its intent to appeal the decision but maintains that it must currently comply with the Estonian court\u8217\'20\'19s cessation order.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/c45eaa50-be3d-46a4-acbb-27d47a319c7c.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230427ej4r000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/24: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,707 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 April 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to defend the important support levels in Bitcoin and select altcoins, but they have failed to clear their most important overhead resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) managed to stay above $27,000 for the past three days, but its 9% loss last week spooked some newbie traders. Glassnode data shows that short-term holders who acquired Bitcoin less than 155 days ago have been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/smart-money-eyes-btc-bull-run-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 moving coins to the exchanges at a loss}}}\uc2  since April 16.\par \par \uc2 While short-term traders are panicking and focusing on the $25,000 level on the downside, some analysts are turning \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the next year. Bloomberg Intelligence analyst Jamie Douglas Coutts expects Bitcoin to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.msn.com/en-us/money/markets/bitcoin-halving-due-next-year-spurs-predictions-of-rally-in-token-past-50000/ar-AA1adNQv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reach}}}\uc2  $50,000 by April 2024.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/642dddd0-80a8-4690-8ea1-8c45047e5366.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  voice was that of Standard Chartered analyst Geoff Kendrick who said that the \u8220\'20\'1Ccrypto winter\u8221\'20\'1D may be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/04/24/bitcoin-btc-price-could-hit-100000-by-end-2024-standard-chartered.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 over}}}\uc2 . He projected that Bitcoin could skyrocket to $100,000 by end-2024.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels where the latest leg of the correction may attract buyers? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of Bitcoin and altcoins to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) has pulled back to the 20-day exponential moving average (4,098), indicating that the bears are selling the rallies near 4,200.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/a8d65157-ad8c-4283-bf74-68f1122b743e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to slip below the 20-day EMA. That improves the prospects of a break above 4,200. If that happens, the index may rally to 4,300. This level may witness aggressive selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 The first level of support on the downside is the 20-day EMA. If it cracks, the index may slip to the 50-day simple moving average (4,034) and, thereafter, to the uptrend line of the ascending triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push the U.S. dollar index (DXY) above the 20-day EMA (102) in the past few days seems to have emboldened the bears who are trying to gain control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/829f7fad-151d-49c6-92de-c95013d6a419.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The index could retest 100.82 which is an important level to keep an eye on. If this support breaks down, the index will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern. This setup may start the next leg of the downtrend toward 97.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price once again rebounds off 100.82, it will suggest that the bulls are protecting this level with all their might. A break and close above the 20-day EMA will suggest that the index may oscillate between 100.82 and 106 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is stuck between the moving averages for the past few days, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. The bulls are buying the dips to the 50-day SMA ($27,078) while the bears are protecting the 20-day EMA ($28,466).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/11311541-41f8-49d0-9318-05bf8e3b2d2d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This uncertainty is unlikely to continue for long. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory indicate advantage to the bears. This increases the likelihood of a break below the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair may then plunge to the important support at $25,250. The bulls are expected to defend this level with all their might.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the 20-day EMA will suggest that the bulls are attempting a comeback. The index may then attempt a rally to $31,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully held Ether\u8217\'20\'19s pullback at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $1,846, but they failed to clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA ($1,913).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/f16a28a6-5d17-4cb7-8e6f-88be059e3135.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position further by pulling the price below the 50-day SMA ($1,799). If they do that, the ETH/USDT pair could extend its decline to the 61.8% retracement level of $1,663.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a strong rebound off the 50-day SMA or the 50% retracement level of $1,754 will suggest solid buying at lower levels. A break and close above the 20-day EMA will tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls. The pair may then rise to $2,000 and later to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $338 but the bears are holding their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/c75d5bb7-a49b-4f89-a974-583815799bbc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to clear the overhead hurdle, the bears will again attempt to sink the BNB/USDT pair below the 50-day SMA ($316). If they manage to do that, the pair may drop to $300. This level may act as a minor support, but if it also cracks, the next stop could be $280.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to thrust the price above the $338-to-$346 resistance zone to seize control. There is a minor resistance at $360, but that is likely to be crossed. The pair could then soar to $400.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls defended the 50-day SMA ($0.45) on April 22 and tried to thrust XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.48) on April 24, but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/d95c3494-fd29-46e9-a418-c889056e7735.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have the upper hand. If the 50-day SMA gives way, the XRP/USDT pair could plummet to $0.43. This is an important level to watch for because, if it cracks, the pair may extend its decline to $0.36.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent a decline, they will have to quickly propel the price back above the 20-day EMA. The pair could then rise to the resistance line where the bears may again mount a strong defense. If this barrier is overcome, the pair may rally to $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the moving averages for the past few days. This suggests uncertainty regarding the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/5b7fb983-be5e-4fe8-a30e-5a05f47e8a4a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.40) has started to turn down and the RSI is near 45, indicating that the bears are trying to gain the upper hand. If the 50-day SMA ($0.37) support crumbles, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may descend to $0.33 and then to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the 50-day SMA and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls have overpowered the bears. The pair will then again try to rally above the neckline and retest the resistance near $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-tags-new-april-low-as-traders-weigh-odds-of-25k-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price tags new April low as traders weigh odds of $25K next}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) remains in a firm bear grip in the near term as every attempt to rally is being met with selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/8b2422d0-1f96-4334-9dcf-63b3d16cf472.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The MATIC/USDT pair could next fall to $0.94 which is likely to act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off this level with strength, the buyers will make one more attempt to push the pair above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 If they are successful, the pair may reach the resistance line. Buyers will have to kick the price above this level to start a potential recovery to $1.30.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price plunges below the $0.94 support. In that case, the pair will clear the path for a likely fall toward $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to defend the support near $0.08 but the shallow bounce in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) shows that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/8d61a921-c268-4f8f-abcb-05f7f601f1ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.08) has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that bears have a slight edge. If the price crumbles below the $0.08 support, the DOGE/USDT pair may decline further to the next major support at $0.07.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA. The pair may then rise to $0.10 and, subsequently, to $0.11. The bears are likely to guard this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to protect the 50-day SMA ($21.26) but the bears have kept up the pressure and have not allowed Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) to sustain above the 20-day EMA ($22.30).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/c7643449-3ff5-4cea-a7c7-7e211c5fdb69.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the 50-day SMA support collapses, the SOL/USDT pair could dump to $18.70. The bulls will try to defend this level but if they fail, the pair may continue its downward move toward the vital support at $15.28.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up and rallies above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to flip the downtrend line into support. The pair may then attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $27.12.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/01cc6604-8a21-4051-97de-908042673d08.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230425ej4o0000c\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/24: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,706 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 April 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to defend the important support levels in Bitcoin and select altcoins, but they have failed to clear their most important overhead resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) managed to stay above $27,000 for the past three days but its 9% loss last week spooked some newbie traders. Glassnode data shows that short-term holders, who acquired Bitcoin less than 155 days ago, have been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/smart-money-eyes-btc-bull-run-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 moving coins to the exchanges at a loss}}}\uc2  since April 16.\par \par \uc2 While short-term traders are panicking and focusing on the $25,000 level on the downside, some analysts are turning \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the next year. Bloomberg Intelligence analyst Jamie Douglas Coutts expects Bitcoin to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.msn.com/en-us/money/markets/bitcoin-halving-due-next-year-spurs-predictions-of-rally-in-token-past-50000/ar-AA1adNQv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reach}}}\uc2  $50,000 by April 2024.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/642dddd0-80a8-4690-8ea1-8c45047e5366.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  voice was that of Standard Chartered analyst Geoff Kendrick who said that the \u8220\'20\'1Ccrypto winter\u8221\'20\'1D may be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/04/24/bitcoin-btc-price-could-hit-100000-by-end-2024-standard-chartered.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 over}}}\uc2 . He projected that Bitcoin could skyrocket to $100,000 by end-2024.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels where the latest leg of the correction may attract buyers? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of Bitcoin and altcoins to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) has pulled back to the 20-day exponential moving average (4,098), indicating that the bears are selling the rallies near 4,200.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/a8d65157-ad8c-4283-bf74-68f1122b743e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to slip below the 20-day EMA. That improves the prospects of a break above 4,200. If that happens, the index may rally to 4,300. This level may witness aggressive selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 The first level of support on the downside is the 20-day EMA. If it cracks, the index may slip to the 50-day simple moving average (4,034) and thereafter to the uptrend line of the ascending triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push the U.S. dollar index (DXY) above the 20-day EMA (102) in the past few days seems to have emboldened the bears who are trying to gain control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/829f7fad-151d-49c6-92de-c95013d6a419.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The index could retest 100.82 which is an important level to keep an eye on. If this support breaks down, the index will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern. This setup may start the next leg of the downtrend toward 97.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price once again rebounds off 100.82, it will suggest that the bulls are protecting this level with all their might. A break and close above the 20-day EMA will suggest that the index may oscillate between 100.82 and 106 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is stuck between the moving averages for the past few days, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. The bulls are buying the dips to the 50-day SMA ($27,078) while the bears are protecting the 20-day EMA ($28,466).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/11311541-41f8-49d0-9318-05bf8e3b2d2d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This uncertainty is unlikely to continue for long. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory indicate advantage to the bears. This increases the likelihood of a break below the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair may then plunge to the important support at $25,250. The bulls are expected to defend this level with all their might.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the 20-day EMA will suggest that the bulls are attempting a comeback. The index may then attempt a rally to $31,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully held Ether\u8217\'20\'19s pullback at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $1,846 but they failed to clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA ($1,913).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/f16a28a6-5d17-4cb7-8e6f-88be059e3135.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position further by pulling the price below the 50-day SMA ($1,799). If they do that, the ETH/USDT pair could extend its decline to the 61.8% retracement level of $1,663.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a strong rebound off the 50-day SMA or the 50% retracement level of $1,754 will suggest solid buying at lower levels. A break and close above the 20-day EMA will tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls. The pair may then rise to $2,000 and later to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $338 but the bears are holding their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/c75d5bb7-a49b-4f89-a974-583815799bbc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to clear the overhead hurdle, the bears will again attempt to sink the BNB/USDT pair below the 50-day SMA ($316). If they manage to do that, the pair may drop to $300. This level may act as a minor support but if it also cracks, the next stop could be $280.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to thrust the price above the $338 to $346 resistance zone to seize control. There is a minor resistance at $360 but that is likely to be crossed. The pair could then soar to $400.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls defended the 50-day SMA ($0.45) on April 22 and tried to thrust XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.48) on April 24 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/d95c3494-fd29-46e9-a418-c889056e7735.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have the upper hand. If the 50-day SMA gives way, the XRP/USDT pair could plummet to $0.43. This is an important level to watch for because if it cracks, the pair may extend its decline to $0.36.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent a decline, they will have to quickly propel the price back above the 20-day EMA. The pair could then rise to the resistance line where the bears may again mount a strong defense. If this barrier is overcome, the pair may rally to $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the moving averages for the past few days. This suggests uncertainty regarding the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/5b7fb983-be5e-4fe8-a30e-5a05f47e8a4a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.40) has started to turn down and the RSI is near 45, indicating that the bears are trying to gain the upper hand. If the 50-day SMA ($0.37) support crumbles, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may descend to $0.33 and then to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the 50-day SMA and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls have overpowered the bears. The pair will then again try to rally above the neckline and retest the resistance near $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-tags-new-april-low-as-traders-weigh-odds-of-25k-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price tags new April low as traders weigh odds of $25K next}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) remains in a firm bear grip in the near term as every attempt to rally is being met with selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/8b2422d0-1f96-4334-9dcf-63b3d16cf472.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The MATIC/USDT pair could next fall to $0.94 which is likely to act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off this level with strength, the buyers will make one more attempt to push the pair above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 If they are successful, the pair may reach the resistance line. Buyers will have to kick the price above this level to start a potential recovery to $1.30.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price plunges below the $0.94 support. In that case, the pair will clear the path for a likely fall toward $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to defend the support near $0.08 but the shallow bounce in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) shows that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/8d61a921-c268-4f8f-abcb-05f7f601f1ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.08) has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that bears have a slight edge. If the price crumbles below the $0.08 support, the DOGE/USDT pair may decline further to the next major support at $0.07.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA. The pair may then rise to $0.10 and subsequently to $0.11. The bears are likely to guard this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to protect the 50-day SMA ($21.26) but the bears have kept up the pressure and not allowed Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) to sustain above the 20-day EMA ($22.30).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/c7643449-3ff5-4cea-a7c7-7e211c5fdb69.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the 50-day SMA support collapses, the SOL/USDT pair could dump to $18.70. The bulls will try to defend this level but if they fail, the pair may continue its downward move toward the vital support at $15.28.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up and rallies above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to flip the downtrend line into support. The pair may then attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $27.12.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/01cc6604-8a21-4051-97de-908042673d08.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230424ej4o000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price holding $27K could open buying opportunities in BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XMR and TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,608 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 April 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 If Bitcoin price starts a recovery, BNB, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , XMR and TON could be the first altcoins to rally.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is on target to finish the week with a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-call-for-calm-as-btc-price-slips-10-in-a-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sharp fall of around 9%}}}\uc2 . This suggests that some traders may be booking profits in fear of a resumption of the downtrend. Analysts expect {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-crawls-2-5-off-lows-as-weekly-chart-risks-bearish-engulfing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to reach the $26,600\u8211\'20\'13$25,000 zone}}}\uc2 , where buying interest may pick up.\par \par \uc2 When an asset emerges from a bear market, it tries to form higher lows on the way up. These levels act as strong supports during subsequent corrections. The current pullback could end up forming a higher floor for Bitcoin, which may act as a launch pad for the next rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/3336912e-cd64-40cc-907e-3e09fcc5d9f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 If long-term investors believe that a bottom has been made, then panicking and selling on every corrective phase is not a good strategy. Rather, every dip could be an opportunity to build a portfolio.\par \par \uc2 The correction in Bitcoin has pulled several altcoins lower. Only a handful of major cryptocurrencies are holding out and looking strong on the charts. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of five cryptocurrencies that may outperform on the way up.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to arrest Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s correction at the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($26,983), but the shallow bounce suggests that the bears are not willing to give up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/7061e56d-14d1-4114-857c-482b9e679920.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($28,606) has started to turn down, and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative zone, signaling that bears have a slight edge. The selling could pick up further if the 50-day SMA cracks.\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair could then tumble to the breakout level of $25,250. This is an important level to keep an eye on because if this support crumbles, the pair may plunge to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to signal a comeback. That could attract buying and push the price toward the $31,000\u8211\'20\'13$32,500 resistance zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/39694c3e-f326-4a40-8bfe-301aa12bb595.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The pair bounced off $27,125 and reached the 20-day EMA. This is the first hurdle that the bulls need to cross to start a strong recovery. The pair may then reach the 50-day SMA, where the bears will again try to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level and slides below $27,125, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on every minor rally. That will increase the likelihood of a fall to $26,500 and eventually to $25,250.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. Sellers are active above $338, while the bulls are fiercely defending the 50-day SMA ($316).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/7e387687-4329-4cec-b2aa-466bcc32fa2c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair rebounded off the 50-day SMA on April 21, and the bulls are attempting to clear the hurdle at $338. If they succeed, it will enhance the prospects of a rally above $346. The pair may then soar toward $400. The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA ($325) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the up-move, they will have to yank the price back below the 50-day SMA. That could accelerate selling and sink the pair to $300 and thereafter toward $280.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/608c35eb-e8db-46a2-94ab-ceae00663e60.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The four-hour chart shows that the price rebounded off the support near $316 and has reached the 50-SMA. If bulls overcome this obstacle, the pair will try to rise to $338 and subsequently to $346. A break above this level could witness a pick-up in \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 The first support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA. If this support gives way, it will suggest that the pair may consolidate between $315 and $335 for some time. The advantage will tilt in favor of the bears if the $315 support gives way.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down and plunged back below the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders (H&S) pattern on April 20. This indicates that the bears are trying to trap the aggressive bulls. A minor positive in favor of the buyers is that they are trying to guard the 50-day SMA ($0.37).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/c93333c1-75e2-4435-ada5-6cfd39653ab7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.40) has turned down, and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating that sellers are trying to seize control. If the price plummets below the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that the bears are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then collapse to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers want to retain their supremacy, they will have to quickly thrust the price back above the neckline. If they manage to do that, the pair could witness solid buying. The pair may then surge to $0.46.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/ff7d216a-6a99-42ff-9b6a-14ea3d6bc4ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The four-hour chart shows that the bears pulled the price below the uptrend line and are trying to flip the level into resistance on a retest. The downsloping 20-EMA and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have the upper hand. If the price slips below $0.38, the selling could intensify, and the pair may plunge to $0.34.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate in the near term if buyers propel the price back above the uptrend line. Such a move will suggest that the recent breakdown may have been a bear trap. The recovery is likely to pick up momentum after buyers push the price above the 50-SMA.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/chinese-city-public-servants-to-receive-digital-rmb-salaries-from-may"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chinese city public servants to receive digital yuan salaries starting May}}}\par \par \uc2 Monero price analysis\par \par \uc2 Monero ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xmr-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XMR}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the neckline of the developing inverse H&S pattern, but the sharp recovery from lower levels indicates aggressive buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/a78ef214-ea07-4c95-9e7e-90c6826feb51.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XMR/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers have pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA ($157) and will again try to challenge the neckline. If this level is scaled, it will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, clearing the path for a potential rise to $185 and thereafter to the pattern target of $199.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the neckline, it will signal that bears are selling on rallies. A break and close below $149 will signal that bears have seized control. The XMR/USDT pair may then slump to $145 and later to $140.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/5db19a32-c927-4b38-b295-01a5b98ee5e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XMR/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The pair is trading inside a descending channel pattern on the four-hour chart. The snapback from the support line of the channel shows solid buying at lower levels. If buyers sustain the price above the 50-SMA, the pair could rally to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price continues lower and slides below the 20-EMA, it will suggest that the pair may remain stuck inside the channel for some more time. The bears will gain the upper hand on a break below the channel.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern, but a positive sign in favor of the buyers is that the price has been trading near the resistance line of the triangle for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/04fcabdf-a70b-4c88-96c6-d1a69d9859aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to drive and sustain the price above the resistance line, which will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. A breakdown of a negative pattern usually results in an up-move because aggressive traders who may have gone short in anticipation of a decline cover their positions.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders who have been sitting on the sidelines due to the negative setup jump in to buy. Above the resistance line, the TON/USDT pair could rally to $2.64 and thereafter to $2.90.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below $2.20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/b114d42a-b633-400b-b0b7-02e018b645cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The four-hour chart shows that the pair is rising inside an ascending channel pattern. In the near term, the bears are trying to protect the $2.33 level, but the bulls continue to attack the level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If the $2.33 level gives way, the pair may start its journey toward the resistance line of the channel near $2.45. Alternatively, if the price once again turns down from $2.33, the bears will try to sink the pair to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDQvM2Y3YWViNTYtMGMzOC00YzgyLThiZDktMzlmYTE0ODg0YmMxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230423ej4n000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/21: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,775 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 April 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull Bitcoin and select altcoins below their crucial near-term supports, which could lead to a sharp long liquidation.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major cryptocurrencies have pulled back from their recent local highs, signaling profit-booking by traders. Is the current pullback a buying opportunity, or has the trend turned lower? This is likely to be the question in every trader\u8217\'20\'19s mind.\par \par \uc2 Bollinger Bands creator \uc2 John Bollinger\uc2  said in a recent tweet that Bitcoin had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-at-key-point-with-btc-price-at-28-8k-bollinger-bands-creator"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 turned down from the upper Bollinger Band}}}\uc2  and reached the middle bank, near its breakout level. He said it was a \u8220\'20\'1Clogical place\u8221\'20\'1D and advised traders to \u8220\'20\'1Cpay attention.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/4240e6c9-a1fd-4baf-bc1a-3f47a7915a76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The correction could worry short-term crypto traders, but for long-term investors who believe that a bottom is in, this could prove to be an opportunity to build their portfolio with cryptocurrencies of their choice. It is generally a good strategy to avoid buying on the way down and wait for the price to stop falling before resuming purchases.\par \par \uc2 What are the levels that may act as strong support? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin fell and closed below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($28,869) on April 19. This was the first close below the 20-day EMA since March 13, indicating weakness.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/af53a2b7-ac14-4cce-a49b-fa5055eedfb6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to stage a recovery on April 20, but they could not overcome the barrier at the 20-day EMA. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance. The BTC/USDT pair may next slip to $26,500 and thereafter to the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders (H&S) pattern at $25,250.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $25,250, it will indicate that the neckline is acting as a higher floor. The bulls will then try to propel the price back above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair may rise to $32,400.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to maintain the price of Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($1,942) on April 19 and 20, but the bears had other plans. They maintained their selling pressure and yanked ETH below the 20-day EMA on April 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/30ef2fdd-03e0-4355-ab68-9afebcb2b11d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $1,846. This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls. If the price turns up from this level, it improves the prospects for a rally to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price continues lower and breaks below $1,846, the ETH/USDT pair could tumble to the 50% retracement level of $1,755 and thereafter to the 61.8% retracement level of 1,663.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $318 support on April 21 and rose above the 20-day EMA ($324). This suggests that the bulls are making a strong effort to arrest the decline at $318.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/126d3366-a276-4843-8e30-74ef35d1695f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) just above the midpoint do not give a clear edge either to the bulls or the bears. If bulls thrust the price above the $338\u8211\'20\'13$350 resistance zone, the BNB/USDT pair may pick up momentum and soar toward $400.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price once again turns down and breaks below $318, it will suggest that the bears remain active at higher levels. The pair may then slump to the 200-day simple moving average (SMA) ($295), which is an important level for the bulls to defend.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to start a recovery in XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.49) on April 19 and 20, but the bears were in no mood to relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/cfa3a9aa-5fc6-475d-ae7f-59548a8b8f55.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to arrest the fall near the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.47, but the bears maintained the selling pressure and pulled the price below it. The XRP/USDT pair may next drop to the 200-day SMA ($0.41).\par \par \uc2 It looks like the pair may trade inside a large range between $0.56 and $0.30 for a while longer. If the price rebounds off the 200-day SMA, the pair may trade in the upper half of the range while a break below it may keep the pair stuck in the lower half.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears succeeded in pulling Cardano\u8216\'20\'18s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) back below the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern on April 20. This suggests that the bears are making a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/cf035c6c-0af9-4223-aa3b-4ff8cf56a6af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears pin the price below the neckline, it will signal that the breakout on April 13 may have been a bull trap. That could lead to long liquidation, which may extend the decline to the 200-day SMA ($0.35). This level is likely to attract solid buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.40) and the RSI near the center do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If bulls want to come out on top, they will have to kick and sustain the price above the neckline. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then rise to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) witnessed hugely volatile moves on April 19 and 20. The bulls are trying to hold the 200-day SMA ($0.08) but are facing stiff resistance from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/a8f6307b-9c43-44c3-86ec-d6bbb3f83947.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA ($0.09), it will suggest that the bears are selling on every minor rally. That will increase the risk of a collapse below the 200-day SMA. If that happens, the DOGE/USDT pair may dive to the crucial support at $0.07.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the price turns up from the current level and soars above $0.10. That will indicate solid buying near the 200-day SMA. The pair may then reach $0.11, where the bulls may again face formidable resistance from the bears.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty of the symmetrical triangle pattern in Polygon\u8216\'20\'18s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) resolved to the downside with a break below the support line on April 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/91d7d7f2-2004-4443-b38f-4904a68e4db2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to protect the 200-day SMA ($1.01), but any recovery is likely to face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($1.11). If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will increase the possibility of a break below the 200-day SMA. That could intensify selling and sink the MATIC/USDT pair toward the pattern target of $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong buying at lower levels. The pair may then rise to the resistance line of the triangle. A break and close above this level may turn the table in favor of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/warren-buffett-was-wrong-about-a-rat-poison-bitcoin-portfolio-data-shows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Warren Buffett was wrong about a 'rat poison' Bitcoin portfolio, data shows}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8216\'20\'18s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between the 20-day EMA ($22.61) and the 200-day SMA ($20.91) for the past two days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/2acfc7a2-66df-45b7-9209-fd3652d2c650.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the bears have yanked the price below the 20-day EMA, they have not yet been able to retest the 200-day SMA. This suggests a lack of aggressive selling at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out, and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair may swing inside the large range between $27.12 and $15.28 for some time. If the price slips below the 200-day SMA, the pair may drop to $18.70; but if the price turns up and rises above the 20-day EMA, the pair may surge to $27.12.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\}s DOT ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply and plunged below the uptrend line on April 19. This indicates aggressive selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/e6f8fb36-76ad-44fc-b816-69bb1cf29771.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price back above the 20-day EMA on April 20, but the long wick on the candlestick shows the bears protected the level successfully. That started a downward move toward the 200-day SMA ($5.93).\par \par \uc2 Buyers are expected to fiercely guard the zone between the 200-day SMA and $5.70 because if they fail to do that, the selling may intensify further and the DOT/USDT pair could dive to $5.15. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate in the near term if bulls push and sustain the price back above the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the 20-day EMA ($93) on April 19, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/de220647-da8b-4c90-9815-f34151ce7d0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to push the price back above the 20-day EMA on April 20, but the bears did not relent. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the 20-day EMA into resistance.\par \par \uc2 The sellers will next try to strengthen their position further by sinking the price below the strong support at $85. If they manage to do that, the LTC/USDT pair may reach the 200-day SMA ($78).\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent this decline, they will have to quickly drive the price above the 20-day EMA and the overhead resistance of $96.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDQvN2E1MjljM2ItZDc1Yy00YmFjLTk1OGMtZjk2NzBiMTk1MDkwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230421ej4l000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,690 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 April 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The sharp pullback in Bitcoin and most major altcoins suggests that the next leg of the up-move may not start in a hurry.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been witnessing volatile moves in the past three days. The pick-up in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  shows that the buyers and sellers are vying for supremacy.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-mega-whales-send-btc-price-to-30k-as-volatility-hits-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recovered sharply on April 18}}}\uc2  but {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-dives-3-in-minutes-as-deep-correction-grips-crypto-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gave back all the gains on April 19}}}\uc2 . The latest sell-off may have been triggered by the high inflation figures in the United Kingdom and the regulatory uncertainty in the United States. Profit booking was not limited to Bitcoin as most major altcoins also turned lower.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/bd983d08-ab4b-4802-abf5-c6edcb84f1eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While a deep correction is possible, Glassnode said in its analysis on April 17 that several on-chain indicators are pointing toward the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-on-chain-data-highlights-the-steps-btc-is-taking-to-exit-the-bear-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 end of the bear market}}}\uc2 . If that is the case, the dips may be viewed as a buying opportunity by long-term investors.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels that are likely to be guarded by the bulls? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is witnessing a keen battle between the bulls and the bears at the 20-day exponential moving average ($29,092). The bears are trying to sink the price below the 20-day EMA while the bulls are attempting to start a strong rebound.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/8bd2befd-bc4a-47a5-a12b-c4dbad96e922.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price snaps back from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and that traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will then make one more attempt to overcome the resistance zone between $31,000 to $32,000. If they succeed, it will indicate the resumption of the uptrend. The BTC/USDT pair may then soar to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. If they tug the price below the 20-day EMA, the selling could accelerate and the pair may slump to $27,800 and subsequently to $26,500.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to resume the uptrend in Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) on April 18 but the bears remained sellers near the overhead resistance at $2,200.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/11e17def-e57e-4cf7-b017-aac790411463.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair has pulled back to the 20-day EMA ($1,949), which is just below the psychological support of $2,000. This is an important support for the bulls to defend because a break and close above it may tilt the advantage in favor of the sellers. The pair may first collapse to $1,800 and later to $1,700.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to flip the $2,000 level into support. If they can pull it off, the pair may rally to $2,200. A break and close above this level will clear the path for a potential rally to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers defended the $338 level on April 17 and 18 but failed to push the price above the $350 resistance. That may have emboldened the bears who pulled BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) to the 20-day EMA ($325) on April 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/42538c0a-6047-4f97-b578-c4c3583d7823.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to keep an eye on because if it cracks, the selling could intensify and the BNB/USDT pair may nosedive to the 200-day simple moving average ($294). This level is likely to attract solid buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns up quickly from the 20-day EMA. If that happens, it will suggest that the bulls are buying the pullbacks. They will then make another attempt to kick the price above $350. If they can pull it off, the pair may shoot up to $400.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($0.50) on April 18 but the bulls could not clear the overhead hurdle at the resistance line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/813ac132-3d9d-46f5-bf88-f5359185868f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down sharply on April 19 and collapsed below the 20-day EMA ($0.50). However, the long tail on the candlestick shows that the buyers are trying to arrest the decline at the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.47.\par \par \uc2 Any attempt to recover is likely to face strong selling in the zone between the resistance line and $0.58. On the downside, a break below $0.47 could drag the XRP/USDT pair down to the 200-day SMA ($0.41). The bulls are likely to aggressively buy the dips to this level.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is in a pullback, which has reached the breakout level of the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/0ff8c5a4-7e36-4962-b317-e95b92491a01.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price snaps back from the neckline, it will suggest that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That will enhance the prospects of a break above $0.46. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then start its northward march toward the pattern target of $0.60. The $0.52 level may act as a resistance but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bears pull the price below the neckline, it will suggest that the breakout may have been a bull trap. The pair may then tumble to the 200-day SMA ($0.35) where the bulls may step in to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) had been gradually moving higher but the bulls hit a wall near the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/a664712c-a2c8-4093-89ce-586165cdd0a9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.09) but they could not sustain the lower levels. The bulls bought the dip and started a recovery as seen from the long tail on the April 19 candlestick.\par \par \uc2 If buyers maintain the buying pressure and push the price above $0.10, the DOGE/USDT pair could reach the crucial resistance at $0.11. Alternatively, a break below the 200-day SMA ($0.08) may keep the pair range-bound between $0.11 and $0.07 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 After trading near the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern for a few days, Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) turned down and reached the support line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/b7903161-62d9-4c85-90f0-deac384d18bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA ($1.13) and the RSI below 50 indicate that the bulls may be losing their grip. If the price breaks below the support line, it will tilt the short-term advantage in favor of the bears. The MATIC/USDT pair may then collapse to the 200-day SMA ($1) where the buyers are likely to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the resistance line. That could open the doors for a potential rally to $1.30.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/can-bitcoin-reclaim-30k-watch-these-btc-price-levels-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Can Bitcoin reclaim $30K? Watch these BTC price levels next}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to drive Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the $27.12 resistance may have attracted short-term bulls to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/1735d79f-f467-4bf2-bde9-b584e6f9e616.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair slipped below the 20-day EMA ($22.82) on April 19 but the long tail on the candlestick suggests that the bulls are trying to protect the level. If the price turns up from the current level, the buyers will again try to kick the pair above $27.12 and commence the journey toward $39.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price breaks below the 200-day SMA ($21.02), it will signal that the pair may consolidate between $27.12 and $15.28 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($6.49) on April 18 but the bears continued to defend the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $6.85.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/d637546b-0401-49ba-9750-ea465bfe419b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Strong selling by the bears yanked the price below the 20-day EMA on April 19 but the bulls are attempting to guard the uptrend line. If the price turns up from the uptrend line, the buyers will again try to resume the up-move and propel the DOT/USDT pair to the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the uptrend line gives way, the bears will try to sink the pair to $5.70. This is an important level to keep an eye on because below it, the pair could drop to $5.15.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) rose above the immediate resistance of $96 on April 14 and reached $103 on April 18 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/f320879b-7b9c-4dba-8233-df7b338d8f70.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Aggressive profit-booking by the bears pulled the price back below the support at $96. This suggests that the bulls may be rushing to the exit. The selling could accelerate further if the price dips and sustains below the 20-day EMA ($94). The LTC/USDT pair could then extend its decline to $85.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level, it will suggest that bulls continue to accumulate at lower levels. The bulls will then again try to push the price to the stiff overhead resistance at $106.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph does not endorse the content of this article nor any product mentioned herein. Readers should do their own research before taking any action related to any product or company mentioned and carry full responsibility for their decisions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/addc3c06-2cd4-44b3-b698-e3075407f6aa.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230419ej4j000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/17: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,858 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 April 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Short-term crypto traders could be exiting their long positions, which may result in a deeper pullback to underlying support levels.\par \par \uc2 Pullbacks are a part and parcel of uptrends. They not only help shake out the weaker hands but also offer an opportunity for traders to add to their position or make fresh entries. Currently, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a correction as bulls and bears battle for control, but is this a buying opportunity or the start of a trend reversal?\par \par \uc2 The Crypto Fear & Greed Index has risen to 69, indicating that traders have started to get greedy again. When this happens, it is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-heading-under-30k-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 time to become cautious in the near term}}}\uc2 , as when new traders begin chasing prices higher, experienced traders sell into strength and buy on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/a6813dab-74bb-49fd-b7d7-0648e382cbe6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 ARK Invest CEO \uc2 Cathie Wood\uc2  said in a recent interview that Bitcoin and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) are being {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-ether-are-like-gold-says-cathie-wood-but-ray-dalio-is-skeptical"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 considered safe-haven assets like gold}}}\uc2 . Meanwhile, \uc2 Bridgewater Associates\uc2  founder Ray Dalio does not consider Bitcoin to be \u8220\'20\'1Can effective store hold of wealth or a medium of exchange.\u8221\'20\'1D He called it \u8220\'20\'1Ca very, very poor alternative to gold.\u8221\'20\'1D This shows that some legacy investors are still uncertain about the future prospects of Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Will traders buy the dip in Bitcoin and the major altcoins, or could the correction deepen further? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) has been gradually moving toward the overhead resistance at 4,200. The price action of the past few days has formed an ascending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close above 4,200.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/f556b6cf-0c78-4b7d-9c0b-b80d907c56ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If that occurs, the index may start a new uptrend that has a target objective of 4,909. It is unlikely to be a straight dash higher because the buyers are likely to face stiff resistance at 4,300 and then again at 4,625.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance at 4,200 and slips below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) (4,070). The index may then drop to the uptrend line of the triangle. If this support gives way, the advantage may turn in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) bounced off the strong support at 100.82 on April 13, signaling that the bulls are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/6859b5d1-367f-478b-bf26-61b18d5cf0cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The index has reached the 20-day EMA (102.32), where the bulls may face solid resistance from the bears. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will increase the possibility of a break below 100.82. The index will then complete a head-and-shoulders (H&S) pattern, which has a long-term target objective of 86.87.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rises above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate strong buying near the 100.82 support. That may keep the index range-bound between the 200-day simple moving average (SMA) (106.33) and 100.82 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from $31,000 on April 14, indicating profit-booking by the bulls. The bears will try to take advantage of the situation and tug the price to the 20-day EMA ($28,937).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/86b8f8b2-29f6-4251-a63a-ddc1fba03eff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will then make another attempt to propel the price to the stiff overhead resistance at $32,400. This remains the key level to watch for because a break and close above it may open the doors for a potential rally to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price plummets below the 20-day EMA. That may embolden the bears, who will then try to sink the BTC/USDT pair to $27,800 and later to $26,500.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether is in an uptrend, but it is facing resistance near the critical overhead level of $2,200. This suggests that some short-term traders may be booking profits after the strong rally in the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/a793badd-3fe3-4818-954c-d92214dd5f75.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair may dip down to the psychological support at $2,000 and then to the 20-day EMA ($1,930). In an uptrend, buyers generally try to defend the 20-day EMA during pullbacks.\par \par \uc2 In this case, if the price turns up from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that lower levels are attracting buyers. That could enhance the prospects of a break above $2,200. If this level gives way, the pair may surge to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price slumps below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls are rushing to the exit. The pair may then descend to $1,680 and thereafter to the 200-day SMA ($1,482).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) continued its northward journey and soared above the $338\u8211\'20\'13$346 overhead resistance zone on April 16. However, the bulls are finding it difficult to latch on to the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/0a1a28cd-1798-4198-b5ae-437df0a2d265.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price back below the breakout level. If the price tumbles below $338, it may trap several aggressive bulls. That could result in a long liquidation, sinking the BNB/USDT pair to the 20-day EMA. If bulls want to keep the recovery intact, they will have to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $350, it will indicate that bulls are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair may then climb to $360 and later to $400. This level is again likely to act as a formidable resistance.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 After the failed attempt to thrust the price above the $0.56\u8211\'20\'13$0.58 resistance zone on April 14, the bears are trying to start a correction in XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/3af244d6-68ae-4c39-9cac-c6e139897d83.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears tug the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.50), the XRP/USDT pair may plunge to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.47. This level may witness strong buying by the bulls because if it cracks, the pair may collapse to the vital support at $0.43.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent this short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  projection, they will have to drive the price above the overhead zone. If they do that, the pair may accelerate toward $0.65 and later extend the rally to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The up-move in Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) halted near $0.46. The price may turn down and retest the breakout level from the inverse H&S pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/ef9c38bb-7f15-445f-8dcc-148165a7ccd3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($0.40) and the RSI near the overbought zone indicate that bulls have the edge. If the price snaps back from the neckline, it will suggest that bulls have flipped the level into support. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then resume its uptrend toward the pattern target of $0.60.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price continues lower and plunges below the neckline, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. That may trap several aggressive bulls and sink the pair to the 200-day SMA ($0.35).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sparks-liquidations-as-analyst-says-btc-price-may-dip-12-more"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin sparks liquidations as analyst says BTC price may dip 12% more}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on April 16, but they are struggling to sustain the breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/e1724034-ea9f-4f69-a90e-0b2df668d778.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears succeed in pulling the price back below the resistance line, it will suggest a lack of demand at higher levels. The MATIC/USDT pair may then extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1.13) has turned up gradually, and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that the bulls are at a slight advantage. If the price turns up from the resistance line, it will indicate that the bulls have flipped the level into support. The pair may then rally to $1.30, where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to stall Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.09 between April 14 to 16, but the buyers did not cede ground to the sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/c833febf-ab0d-46e2-bf6c-333ac35835d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers asserted their supremacy and kicked the price above the overhead resistance on April 17, but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the sellers are protecting the 61.8% retracement level at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to strengthen their position by dragging the price below the moving averages. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair may stay inside the large range between $0.07 and $0.11 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $0.10, it will suggest that bulls are attempting a comeback. The pair may then rise to the crucial resistance at $0.11. A break above this level will signal a possible pick-up in momentum.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the downtrend line since April 11, indicating that the bulls are in no hurry to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/0c8492e6-7de1-4efb-91e2-b294a8962bc9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up, and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that the bulls have the upper hand. However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to guard the overhead resistance at $27.12.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from this level, the SOL/USDT pair may fall to the 20-day EMA. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will enhance the prospects of a rally toward $39.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may oscillate between $15.28 and $27.12 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDQvYjJjZTQyZDItZmIzYi00ZmY3LThiYTUtNTM1YzZiYmQ0ZjIwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230418ej4h0000c\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/17: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,853 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 April 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Short-term crypto traders could be exiting their long positions, which may result in a deeper pullback to underlying support levels.\par \par \uc2 Pullbacks are a part and parcel of uptrends. They not only help shake out the weaker hands but also offer an opportunity for traders to add to their position or make fresh entries. Currently, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a correction as bulls and the bears battle for control, but is this a buying opportunity or the start of a trend reversal?\par \par \uc2 The Crypto Fear & Greed Index has risen to 69, indicating that traders have started to get greedy again. When this happens, it is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-heading-under-30k-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 time to become cautious in the near term}}}\uc2  because when new traders begin chasing prices higher, experienced traders sell into strength and buy on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/a6813dab-74bb-49fd-b7d7-0648e382cbe6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 ARK Invest CEO \uc2 Cathie Wood\uc2  said in a recent interview that Bitcoin and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) are being {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-ether-are-like-gold-says-cathie-wood-but-ray-dalio-is-skeptical"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 considered as safe haven assets like gold}}}\uc2 . Meanwhile, \uc2 Bridgewater Associates\uc2  founder Ray Dalio does not consider Bitcoin to be \u8220\'20\'1Can effective store hold of wealth or a medium of exchange.\u8221\'20\'1D He called it \u8220\'20\'1Ca very, very poor alternative to gold.\u8221\'20\'1D This shows that some legacy investors are still uncertain about the future prospects of Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Will traders buy the dip in Bitcoin and the major altcoins or could the correction deepen further? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) has been gradually moving toward the overhead resistance at 4,200. The price action of the past few days has formed an ascending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close above 4,200.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/f556b6cf-0c78-4b7d-9c0b-b80d907c56ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If that occurs, the index may start a new uptrend which has a target objective of 4,909. It is unlikely to be a straight dash higher because the buyers are likely to face stiff resistance at 4,300 and then again at 4,625.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance at 4,200 and slips below the 20-day exponential moving average (4,070). The index may then drop to the uptrend line of the triangle. If this support gives way, the advantage may turn in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index (DXY) bounced off the strong support at 100.82 on April 13, signaling that the bulls are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/6859b5d1-367f-478b-bf26-61b18d5cf0cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The index has reached the 20-day EMA (102.32) where the bulls may face solid resistance from the bears. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will increase the possibility of a break below 100.82. The index will then complete a head and shoulders (H&S) pattern, which has a long-term target objective of 86.87.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rises above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate strong buying near the 100.82 support. That may keep the index range-bound between the 200-day simple moving average (106.33) and 100.82 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from $31,000 on April 14, indicating profit-booking by the bulls. The bears will try to take advantage of the situation and tug the price to the 20-day EMA ($28,937).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/86b8f8b2-29f6-4251-a63a-ddc1fba03eff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will then make another attempt to propel the price to the stiff overhead resistance at $32,400. This remains the key level to watch for because a break and close above it may open the doors for a potential rally to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price plummets below the 20-day EMA. That may embolden the bears who will then try to sink the BTC/USDT pair to $27,800 and later to $26,500.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether is in an uptrend but it is facing resistance near the critical overhead level of $2,200. This suggests that some short-term traders may be booking profits after the strong rally in the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/a793badd-3fe3-4818-954c-d92214dd5f75.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair may dip down to the psychological support at $2,000 and then to the 20-day EMA ($1,930). In an uptrend, buyers generally try to defend the 20-day EMA during pullbacks.\par \par \uc2 In this case, if the price turns up from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that lower levels are attracting buyers. That could enhance the prospects of a break above $2,200. If this level gives way, the pair may surge to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price slumps below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls are rushing to the exit. The pair may then descend to $1,680 and thereafter to the 200-day SMA ($1,482).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) continued its northward journey and soared above the $338 to $346 overhead resistance zone on April 16. However, the bulls are finding it difficult to latch on to the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/0a1a28cd-1798-4198-b5ae-437df0a2d265.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price back below the breakout level. If the price tumbles below $338, it may trap several aggressive bulls. That could result in a long liquidation, sinking the BNB/USDT pair to the 20-day EMA. If bulls want to keep the recovery intact, they will have to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $350, it will indicate that bulls are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair may then climb to $360 and later to $400. This level is again likely to act as a formidable resistance.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 After the failed attempt to thrust the price above the $0.56 to $0.58 resistance zone on April 14, the bears are trying to start a correction in XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/3af244d6-68ae-4c39-9cac-c6e139897d83.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears tug the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.50), the XRP/USDT pair may plunge to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.47. This level may witness strong buying by the bulls because if it cracks, the pair may collapse to the vital support at $0.43.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent this short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  projection, they will have to drive the price above the overhead zone. If they do that, the pair may accelerate toward $0.65 and later extend the rally to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) up-move halted near $0.46. The price may turn down and retest the breakout level from the inverse H&S pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/ef9c38bb-7f15-445f-8dcc-148165a7ccd3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($0.40) and the RSI near the overbought zone indicate that bulls have the edge. If the price snaps back from the neckline, it will suggest that bulls have flipped the level into support. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then resume its uptrend toward the pattern target of $0.60.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price continues lower and plunges below the neckline, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. That may trap several aggressive bulls and sink the pair to the 200-day SMA ($0.35).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sparks-liquidations-as-analyst-says-btc-price-may-dip-12-more"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin sparks liquidations as analyst says BTC price may dip 12% more}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on April 16 but they are struggling to sustain the breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/e1724034-ea9f-4f69-a90e-0b2df668d778.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears succeed in pulling the price back below the resistance line, it will suggest a lack of demand at higher levels. The MATIC/USDT pair may then extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1.13) has turned up gradually and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that the bulls are at a slight advantage. If the price turns up from the resistance line, it will indicate that the bulls have flipped the level into support. The pair may then rally to $1.30 where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to stall Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.09 between April 14 to 16 but the buyers did not cede ground to the sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/c833febf-ab0d-46e2-bf6c-333ac35835d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers asserted their supremacy and kicked the price above the overhead resistance on April 17 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the sellers are protecting the 61.8% retracement level at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to strengthen their position by dragging the price below the moving averages. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair may stay inside the large range between $0.07 and $0.11 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $0.10, it will suggest that bulls are attempting a comeback. The pair may then rise to the crucial resistance at $0.11. A break above this level will signal a possible pick-up in momentum.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the downtrend line since April 11, indicating that the bulls are in no hurry to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/0c8492e6-7de1-4efb-91e2-b294a8962bc9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that the bulls have the upper hand. However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to guard the overhead resistance at $27.12.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from this level, the SOL/USDT pair may fall to the 20-day EMA. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will enhance the prospects of a rally toward $39.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may oscillate between $15.28 and $27.12 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDQvYjJjZTQyZDItZmIzYi00ZmY3LThiYTUtNTM1YzZiYmQ0ZjIwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230417ej4h000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/14: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,673 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 April 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins faced slight selling at their recently notched highs, but analysis suggests that bulls view dips as buying opportunities.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) are trading above the psychologically important levels of $30,000 and $2,000, respectively, suggesting the crypto winter may be on its last legs.\par \par \uc2 Some {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-spikes-above-31k-as-ethereum-gains-spark-altseason-calls"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 analysts are calling for an altseason to begin}}}\uc2 , but it may be too early for that. When most crypto bears turn \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bitcoin will likely turn down sharply and catch the late entrants off guard. That could hurt sentiment in the short term and cause a sell-off in altcoins. After the weak hands are shaken out, the crypto markets may stabilize and begin a sustained uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/9440f6bd-692a-4ba1-b359-d8d7a5f48a67.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Data from on-chain intelligence platform Glassnode suggests that there are significant {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-bitcoin-bear-market-btc-price-closely-copying-old-halving-cycles"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 similarities between the current having cycle}}}\uc2  and the previous ones. However, Ecoinometrics warned that an economic recession could alter things.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s watch the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to spot the critical resistance levels that may start a pullback.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to stall the up-move on April 12 but the bulls did not give up. They resumed their purchases on April 13 and cleared the hurdle at $30,550 on April 14.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/41bf5d6d-c4cc-4bd1-bb81-8b939f2220bf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $30,550, the BTC/USDT pair may rally to $32,400. The bears are expected to protect this level with all their might.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level but does not break below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) at $28,542, it will enhance the prospects of a rally above $32,400. If this level is scaled, the pair may zoom toward $40,000.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the 20-day EMA cracks, it will suggest that the bears are trying to make a comeback. That could clear the path for a possible drop to $25,250.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether bounced off the 20-day EMA ($1,870) on April 12, indicating that the bulls are vigorously guarding the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/9e9b679d-25dd-4dec-90e7-506b4863b484.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buying continued on April 13, with the bulls pushing the price above the psychologically important level of $2,000. That attracted further buying, with the ETH/USDT pair climbing toward $2,200. This is a crucial level for the bears to defend because if they fail to do that, the pair may witness a buying stampede. The pair could then skyrocket to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from $2,200 and breaks below $2,000, the pair may tumble to the 20-day EMA. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break below it may pull the pair to $1,680.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls did not allow BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) to dip below the 20-day EMA ($317) on April 12 and 13. This indicates that the sentiment is turning positive and traders are buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/2964571c-d942-4dc0-a12e-4efd92d4fff9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up and the relative strength index (RSI) has jumped above 60, suggesting that the tide is turning in favor of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to solidify their position by catapulting the price above the $338 to $346 overhead zone. If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair may pick up momentum and rally to $360 and subsequently to $400.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the overhead zone, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. That may keep the pair stuck between the 20-day EMA and $346 for some time.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers successfully protected the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.49. That attracted further buying in XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fld